#: ../mergewt/quspect/circuit/circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.circuit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.compose:3
msgid ""
"Since qubit count is dynamically inferred, you must specify how ``other``'s "
"qubits map onto this circuit's qubits. Gates, measurements, barriers and "
"noise channels are all carried over with their qubits (and clbits) remapped."
msgstr ""
"由于量子比特数是动态推断的，你必须指定 ``other`` 的量子比特如何映射到本电路的"
"量子比特上。门、测量、屏障和噪声信道都会连同其量子比特（及经典比特）一起被重"
"映射并合并进来。"

