#: ../mergewt/quspect/circuit/circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.circuit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.to_json:1
msgid "Serialize this circuit to a JSON string."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/circuit/circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.circuit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.to_json:3
msgid ""
"Gates (including symbolic parameters and affine expressions), measurements, "
"barriers, labels and noise channels are serialized. Noise channels store all "
"of their strength fields (``p``, ``gamma``, ``p_thermal``, ``px``/``py``/"
"``pz``) so that :meth:`from_json` restores an equal channel. Kraus channels "
"only record their operator count and cannot be deserialized."
msgstr ""
"门（包括符号参数和仿射表达式）、测量、屏障、标签以及噪声信道都会被序列化。噪"
"声信道会保存其全部强度字段（``p``、``gamma``、``p_thermal``、``px``/``py``/"
"``pz``），以便 :meth:`from_json` 还原出相等的信道。Kraus 信道仅记录其算符数"
"量，无法反序列化。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/circuit/circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.circuit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.to_json:10
msgid "A JSON string representing the circuit."
msgstr ""

