msgid "Deserialize a circuit from a JSON string."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/circuit/circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.circuit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.from_json:3
msgid ""
"Older documents that omit channel strengths (they then default to ``0.0``) "
"or use the legacy channel name ``\"gen_amp_damp\"`` are still accepted; the "
"latter is normalized to ``\"generalized_amplitude_damping\"``."
msgstr ""
"仍然接受省略信道强度的旧文档（此时强度默认为 ``0.0``）或使用旧信道名 "
"``\"gen_amp_damp\"`` 的文档；后者会被规范化为 "
"``\"generalized_amplitude_damping\"``。"

