msgid ""
"Measurement is represented as an instruction with "
"``type=InstructionType.MEASURE`` rather than as a Gate, because measurement "
"is not a unitary operation (architecture decision 7.3 — 方案 B)."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/circuit/instruction.py:docstring of
#: quspect.circuit.instruction.CircuitInstruction:15
msgid ""
"Noise channels use ``type=InstructionType.CHANNEL`` and the ``channel`` "
"field, keeping them distinct from unitary gates at the type level."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/circuit/instruction.py:docstring of
#: quspect.circuit.instruction.CircuitInstruction:19
msgid ""
"Gate and channel instructions must act on distinct qubits: an instruction "
"such as ``cx(0, 0)`` is rejected with ``ValueError`` at construction time. "
"Measurements may repeat a qubit (measuring the same qubit into several "
"classical bits)."
msgstr ""
"门和信道指令必须作用于互不相同的量子比特：诸如 ``cx(0, 0)`` 的指令会在构造时"
"以 ``ValueError`` 被拒绝。测量可以重复使用同一量子比特（将同一量子比特测量到"
"多个经典比特中）。"

