#: ../mergewt/quspect/operators/qubit_operator.py:docstring of
#: quspect.operators.qubit_operator.QubitOperator.__init__:1
msgid "Initialize a QubitOperator from a term-to-coefficient mapping."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/operators/qubit_operator.py:docstring of
#: quspect.operators.qubit_operator.QubitOperator.__init__:3
msgid ""
"A dict mapping Pauli term tuples to coefficient values. Empty terms ``()`` "
"represent the identity.  Terms will be normalized (sorted) and zero-"
"coefficient entries removed. Letters are case-insensitive and ``I`` entries "
"are dropped. A qubit that appears more than once in a term is reduced with "
"the Pauli algebra, multiplying left to right (e.g. ``((0, \"X\"), (0, "
"\"Z\"))`` becomes ``-1j`` times ``Y0``). If ``None``, the operator is "
"initialized to zero."
msgstr ""
"将 Pauli 项元组映射到系数值的字典。空项 ``()`` 表示单位算符。项会被规范化（排"
"序），系数为零的条目会被移除。字母不区分大小写，``I`` 条目会被丢弃。同一项中"
"出现多次的量子比特会按 Pauli 代数从左到右相乘进行化简（例如 ``((0, \"X\"), "
"(0, \"Z\"))`` 变为 ``-1j`` 乘以 ``Y0``）。若为 ``None``，则算符初始化为零。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/operators/qubit_operator.py:docstring of
#: quspect.operators.qubit_operator.QubitOperator.__init__:12
msgid ""
"If a term is not a tuple of ``(qubit, letter)``     pairs with an integer "
"qubit and a letter in     ``I``/``X``/``Y``/``Z``, or if reducing a repeated "
"qubit     yields an imaginary phase on a symbolic coefficient."
msgstr ""
"当某个项不是由 ``(qubit, letter)`` 对组成的元组（其中 qubit 为整数，letter "
"为 ``I``/``X``/``Y``/``Z`` 之一），或化简重复量子比特时对符号系数产生了虚数相"
"位时。"

