#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/passes/base.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.passes.base.PassManager.run:3
msgid ""
"Convergence is detected when a full iteration of all enabled passes leaves "
"the circuit structure unchanged. The structure is compared "
"via :func:`dag_signature` (the sequence of instructions -- name, parameters, "
"operands -- on every wire), so a pass that only reorders commuting gates "
"also counts as a change. This handles the ``cancel → commute → rotate → (re-"
"cancel)`` pattern where commutation enables further cancellations."
msgstr ""
"当所有已启用的 pass 完整执行一轮后电路结构未发生变化时，即判定为收敛。结构通"
"过 :func:`dag_signature` 进行比较（即每条线上的指令序列——名称、参数、操作"
"数），因此仅重排对易门的 pass 也会被视为一次改变。这可以处理 ``cancel → "
"commute → rotate → (re-cancel)`` 模式，即对易变换使进一步的消去成为可能。"

