msgstr "可复用的量子算法线路构造器。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/__init__.py:docstring of
#: quspect.algorithms.qft.build_qft_circuit:1
#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/qft.py:docstring
msgid "Build an exact quantum Fourier transform circuit."
msgstr "构造精确的量子傅里叶变换线路。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/__init__.py:docstring of
#: quspect.algorithms.qft.build_qft_circuit:3
#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/qft.py:docstring
msgid ""
"The returned circuit uses QuSpect's little-endian qubit convention and "
"decomposes the transform into Hadamard, controlled-phase, and optional SWAP "
"gates. For ``N = 2**num_qubits``, the forward circuit implements the "
"positive-sign discrete Fourier transform ``|x> -> (1 / sqrt(N)) sum_y "
"exp(+2*pi*i*x*y/N) |y>``."
msgstr ""
"返回的线路采用 QuSpect 的小端量子比特约定，并将该变换分解为 Hadamard 门、受控"
"相位门以及可选的 SWAP 门。对于 ``N = 2**num_qubits``，正向线路实现正号离散傅"
"里叶变换 ``|x> -> (1 / sqrt(N)) sum_y exp(+2*pi*i*x*y/N) |y>``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/__init__.py:docstring of
#: quspect.algorithms.qft.build_qft_circuit:9
#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/qft.py:docstring
msgid ""
"When ``include_swaps=False``, the forward circuit omits the final SWAP gates "
"and leaves its output in bit-reversed order. Setting ``inverse=True`` "
"returns the adjoint of the complete gate sequence selected by "
"``include_swaps``; in particular, disabling swaps also omits them from the "
"sequence whose adjoint is returned."
msgstr ""
"当 ``include_swaps=False`` 时，正向线路省略末尾的 SWAP 门，其输出保持为比特反"
"转顺序。设置 ``inverse=True`` 将返回由 ``include_swaps`` 所选完整门序列的伴"
"随；具体而言，禁用交换也会从所返回伴随对应的序列中省略这些门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/__init__.py:docstring of
#: quspect.algorithms.qft.build_qft_circuit:15
#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/qft.py:docstring
msgid ""
"Number of qubits in the transform. Must be a positive integer and cannot be "
"a boolean."
msgstr "变换所用的量子比特数。必须为正整数，且不能是布尔值。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/__init__.py:docstring of
#: quspect.algorithms.qft.build_qft_circuit:17
#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/qft.py:docstring
msgid ""
"If True, return the inverse quantum Fourier transform. Must be a boolean."
msgstr "若为 True，则返回逆量子傅里叶变换。必须为布尔值。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/__init__.py:docstring of
#: quspect.algorithms.qft.build_qft_circuit:19
#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/qft.py:docstring
msgid ""
"If True, append the final swaps that restore natural output bit order. Must "
"be a boolean."
msgstr ""
"若为 True，则追加用于恢复自然输出比特顺序的末尾 SWAP 门。必须为布尔值。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/__init__.py:docstring of
#: quspect.algorithms.qft.build_qft_circuit:22
#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/qft.py:docstring
msgid ""
"A circuit named ``\"qft\"`` for the forward transform or ``\"iqft\"`` for "
"the inverse transform."
msgstr ""
"正向变换返回名为 ``\"qft\"`` 的线路，逆向变换返回名为 ``\"iqft\"`` 的线路。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/__init__.py:docstring of
#: quspect.algorithms.qft.build_qft_circuit:25
#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/qft.py:docstring
msgid ""
"If ``num_qubits`` is not an integer, or if ``inverse`` or     "
"``include_swaps`` is not a boolean."
msgstr ""
"当 ``num_qubits`` 不是整数，或 ``inverse`` 或 ``include_swaps`` 不是布尔值"
"时。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/__init__.py:docstring of
#: quspect.algorithms.qft.build_qft_circuit:26
#: ../mergewt/quspect/algorithms/qft.py:docstring
msgid "If ``num_qubits`` is not positive."
msgstr "当 ``num_qubits`` 不是正数时。"

