#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:56
msgid "Single-Qubit Synthesis"
msgstr "单量子比特综合"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of quspect.gates.synthesis:1
msgid "Basis-aware synthesis of single-qubit unitaries."
msgstr "单量子比特酉矩阵的基感知（basis-aware）综合。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of quspect.gates.synthesis:3
msgid ""
":func:`synthesize_one_qubit` turns an arbitrary 2×2 unitary into a short "
"gate sequence that uses only the gates of a target basis, up to a global "
"phase. It is used by the DAG optimizer (single-qubit run resynthesis) and by "
"the decomposition rules for ``u3``/``u2`` on ``{h, rz}``-style bases."
msgstr ""
":func:`synthesize_one_qubit` 将任意 2×2 酉矩阵转换为仅使用目标基门集中的门的"
"短门序列（至多相差一个全局相位）。它被 DAG 优化器（单量子比特门序列重综合）以"
"及 ``{h, rz}`` 类基门集上 ``u3``/``u2`` 的分解规则所使用。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of quspect.gates.synthesis:8
msgid "Supported synthesis forms (the shortest valid one is returned):"
msgstr "支持的综合形式（返回其中最短的有效形式）："

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.gates.synthesis:10
msgid ""
"``[]`` for the identity, a single named basis gate (``h``, ``x``, ``s``…) "
"when the unitary equals it, ``rz``/``p``/``u1`` (or a Clifford+T word) for "
"diagonal unitaries;"
msgstr ""
"恒等变换返回 ``[]``；当酉矩阵恰好等于某个命名基门（``h``、``x``、``s``…）时返"
"回该单个门；对角酉矩阵使用 ``rz``/``p``/``u1`` （或 Clifford+T 门串）；"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.gates.synthesis:13
msgid "``u3`` when available;"
msgstr "可用时使用 ``u3``；"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.gates.synthesis:14
msgid "ZXZ with ``rx`` and ZYZ with ``ry`` (three gates at most);"
msgstr "使用 ``rx`` 的 ZXZ 分解和使用 ``ry`` 的 ZYZ 分解（至多三个门）；"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.gates.synthesis:15
msgid ""
"``rz · h · rz`` (or ``rz · sx · rz`` / ``rz · sxdg · rz``) when the unitary "
"is a \"half\" rotation (``|u00| = 1/√2``), ``x · rz`` (or ``sx · sx · rz``) "
"for anti-diagonal unitaries;"
msgstr ""
"当酉矩阵为“半”旋转（``|u00| = 1/√2``）时使用 ``rz · h · rz``（或 ``rz · sx · "
"rz`` / ``rz · sxdg · rz``），反对角酉矩阵使用 ``x · rz``（或 ``sx · sx · "
"rz``）；"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.gates.synthesis:18
msgid ""
"the general ``rz · h · rz · h · rz`` form (``RX(b) = H·RZ(b)·H``) and, for "
"IBM-style ``{rz, sx}`` bases, the ZSX form ``rz · sx · rz · sx · rz`` "
"(``U3(θ, φ, λ) ∝ RZ(φ+π)·SX·RZ(θ+π)·SX·RZ(λ)``)."
msgstr ""
"一般形式 ``rz · h · rz · h · rz``（``RX(b) = H·RZ(b)·H``），以及面向 IBM 风"
"格 ``{rz, sx}`` 基的 ZSX 形式 ``rz · sx · rz · sx · rz``（``U3(θ, φ, λ) ∝ "
"RZ(φ+π)·SX·RZ(θ+π)·SX·RZ(λ)``）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.gates.synthesis:22
msgid "Identity rotations are dropped, so every form can come out shorter."
msgstr "恒等旋转会被丢弃，因此每种形式的结果都可能更短。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.gates.synthesis.is_identity_up_to_phase:1
msgid "Return whether a 2×2 unitary equals the identity up to global phase."
msgstr "判断一个 2×2 酉矩阵在相差全局相位的意义下是否等于单位矩阵。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.gates.synthesis.is_identity_up_to_phase:3
#: quspect.gates.synthesis.synthesize_one_qubit:8
msgid "A 2×2 unitary matrix."
msgstr "一个 2×2 酉矩阵。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.gates.synthesis.is_identity_up_to_phase:4
msgid "Absolute tolerance."
msgstr "绝对容差。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.gates.synthesis.is_identity_up_to_phase:6
msgid "True if ``matrix ≈ e^{iα}·I``."
msgstr "若 ``matrix ≈ e^{iα}·I`` 则为 True。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.gates.synthesis.synthesize_one_qubit:1
msgid "Synthesize a single-qubit unitary into a short sequence of basis gates."
msgstr "将单量子比特酉矩阵综合为由基门组成的短序列。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.gates.synthesis.synthesize_one_qubit:3
msgid ""
"The result implements ``matrix`` up to a global phase and only uses gate "
"names contained in ``basis_gates``. All candidate forms listed in the module "
"docstring are tried and verified numerically; the shortest valid sequence is "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"结果在相差全局相位的意义下实现 ``matrix``，且只使用 ``basis_gates`` 中包含的"
"门名称。模块文档字符串中列出的所有候选形式都会被尝试并进行数值验证，最终返回"
"最短的有效序列。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.gates.synthesis.synthesize_one_qubit:9
msgid ""
"Names of the allowed gates (e.g. ``{\"h\", \"rz\", \"cz\"}``). Multi-qubit "
"names are ignored."
msgstr ""
"允许使用的门名称（例如 ``{\"h\", \"rz\", \"cz\"}``）。多量子比特门名称会被忽"
"略。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.gates.synthesis.synthesize_one_qubit:12
msgid ""
"The gate sequence in circuit (time) order, ``[]`` for the identity, or "
"``None`` if the unitary cannot be expressed in the basis by the supported "
"forms."
msgstr ""
"按线路（时间）顺序排列的门序列；恒等变换返回 ``[]``；若该酉矩阵无法用所支持的"
"形式在该基门集中表示，则返回 ``None``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/gates/synthesis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.gates.synthesis.synthesize_one_qubit:16
msgid "If ``matrix`` is not 2×2."
msgstr "当 ``matrix`` 不是 2×2 矩阵时。"

