#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit:1
msgid "DAG representation of a quantum circuit."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit:3
msgid ""
"A DAGCircuit is a directed acyclic graph that makes qubit dependencies "
"explicit. It is the primary intermediate representation for circuit "
"compilation, optimization, and analysis."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit:7
msgid ""
"The graph has explicit INPUT and OUTPUT nodes marking the boundaries of each "
"qubit and classical bit line. Between them, OPERATION nodes are connected by "
"edges that follow the qubit/bit flow."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit:13
msgid ""
"Adjacency is stored per node, ordered by edge insertion, so that local "
"updates are O(degree). The topological order is cached and recomputed lazily "
"after a structural change. Node IDs are assigned sequentially starting from "
"0 for INPUT nodes, N for OUTPUT nodes, and continuing for OPERATION nodes."
msgstr ""
"邻接关系按节点存储，并按边的插入顺序排列，因此局部更新的开销为 O(度数)。拓扑"
"序会被缓存，并在结构变化后惰性地重新计算。节点 ID 按顺序分配：INPUT 节点从 0 "
"开始，OUTPUT 节点从 N 开始，OPERATION 节点随后继续编号。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
