msgstr "按插入顺序返回所有边。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.DAGCircuit.modification_count:1
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.modification_count:1
msgid "Return a counter that increases on every structural modification."
msgstr "返回一个在每次结构修改时递增的计数器。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.DAGCircuit.modification_count:3
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.modification_count:3
msgid ""
"Adding or removing nodes or edges, and replacing a node's instruction "
"through :meth:`substitute_node_instruction`, increase the counter. Comparing "
"two readings is a cheap way to detect whether a pass touched the DAG."
msgstr ""
"添加或删除节点或边，以及通过 :meth:`substitute_node_instruction` 替换节点的指"
"令，都会使计数器递增。比较两次读数是检测某个 pass 是否修改了 DAG 的廉价方法。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.DAGCircuit.modification_count:8
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.modification_count:8
