#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.remove_edge:7
msgid "Wire label of the edge (e.g. ``\"q0\"``)."
msgstr "边的线标签（例如 ``\"q0\"``）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.remove_edge:9
msgid "If no such edge exists."
msgstr "当不存在这样的边时。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.remove_node:1
msgid "Remove a node and all its incident edges from the DAG."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.remove_node:3
msgid ""
"The neighbours are **not** reconnected; callers that want to keep the wires "
"connected should use :meth:`remove_node_and_reconnect`. Runs in O(degree) "
"time."
msgstr ""
"相邻节点\\ **不会**\\ 被重新连接；希望保持各条线连通的调用方应使"
"用 :meth:`remove_node_and_reconnect`。运行时间为 O(度数)。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.remove_node:7
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.remove_node_and_reconnect:7
msgid "The ID of the node to remove."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.remove_node_and_reconnect:1
msgid "Remove an operation node and splice each of its wires back together."
msgstr "删除一个操作节点，并把它的每条线重新拼接起来。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.remove_node_and_reconnect:3
msgid ""
"For every wire of the node (qubits in instruction order, then clbits) the "
"wire predecessor is connected to the wire successor, so the DAG stays a "
"valid circuit DAG. Runs in O(degree) time."
msgstr ""
"对于该节点的每条线（先按指令顺序遍历量子比特，再遍历经典比特），将该线上的前"
"驱连接到该线上的后继，从而使 DAG 仍然是一个有效的线路 DAG。运行时间为 O(度"
"数)。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.substitute_node_instruction:1
msgid "Replace the instruction of an operation node in place."
msgstr "原地替换某个操作节点的指令。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.substitute_node_instruction:3
msgid ""
"The node keeps its ID, wires and edges; only its payload changes. Using this "
"method (rather than assigning ``node.instruction``) also records the change "
"in :attr:`modification_count`."
msgstr ""
"该节点保留其 ID、线和边；只有其承载的指令发生变化。使用此方法（而不是直接给 "
"``node.instruction`` 赋值）还会在 :attr:`modification_count` 中记录这次修改。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.substitute_node_instruction:7
msgid "The node whose instruction is replaced."
msgstr "要替换其指令的节点。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.substitute_node_instruction:8
msgid ""
"The new :class:`~quspect.circuit.instruction.CircuitInstruction`. It must "
"act on the same qubits/clbits as the old one."
msgstr ""
"新的 :class:`~quspect.circuit.instruction.CircuitInstruction`。它必须作用于与"
"旧指令相同的量子比特/经典比特。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.set_qubit_count:1
msgid "Set the number of qubit lines."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
