msgstr "``(target node ID, wire label)`` 对组成的列表。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.in_edges_with_wires:1
msgid "Return ``(source_id, wire)`` for every incoming edge, in edge order."
msgstr "按边的顺序，为每条入边返回 ``(source_id, wire)``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.in_edges_with_wires:5
msgid "List of ``(source node ID, wire label)`` pairs."
msgstr "``(source node ID, wire label)`` 对组成的列表。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.has_edge:1
msgid "Return whether a direct edge ``source -> target`` exists."
msgstr "判断是否存在一条直接边 ``source -> target``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.has_edge:5
msgid "If given, the edge must carry this wire label."
msgstr "若给定，则该边必须携带此线标签。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.has_edge:7
msgid "True if a matching edge exists. Runs in O(out-degree)."
msgstr "若存在匹配的边则为 True。运行时间为 O(出度)。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.wire_predecessor:1
msgid "Return the node feeding ``node_id`` on ``wire``."
msgstr "返回在 ``wire`` 上馈入 ``node_id`` 的节点。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.wire_predecessor:3
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.wire_successor:3
msgid "The node ID."
msgstr "节点 ID。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.wire_predecessor:4
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.wire_successor:4
msgid "Wire label such as ``\"q0\"``."
msgstr "线标签，例如 ``\"q0\"``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.wire_predecessor:6
msgid ""
"The predecessor node ID on that wire, or ``None`` if there is none. If "
"several edges match, the most recently added wins."
msgstr ""
"该线上的前驱节点 ID；若不存在则为 ``None``。若有多条边匹配，以最近添加的边为"
"准。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.wire_successor:1
msgid "Return the node following ``node_id`` on ``wire``."
msgstr "返回在 ``wire`` 上紧随 ``node_id`` 的节点。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.wire_successor:6
msgid ""
"The successor node ID on that wire, or ``None`` if there is none. If several "
"edges match, the most recently added wins."
msgstr ""
"该线上的后继节点 ID；若不存在则为 ``None``。若有多条边匹配，以最近添加的边为"
"准。"

