#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.topological_order:1
msgid "Return node_ids in topological order."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.topological_order:3
msgid ""
"Uses Kahn's algorithm. The DAG must be acyclic (guaranteed by construction "
"from a sequential circuit). The result is cached until the next structural "
"modification."
msgstr ""
"使用 Kahn 算法。DAG 必须是无环的（由顺序线路构造时可以保证）。结果会被缓存，"
"直到下一次结构修改。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.topological_order:7
msgid "List of node IDs in topological order (INPUTs first, OUTPUTs last)."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.topological_order:10
msgid ""
"If a cycle is detected (should not happen     for DAGs constructed from "
"valid circuits)."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.ensure_topological_positions:1
msgid "Compute the incremental topological numbering if it is missing."
msgstr "若增量拓扑编号缺失，则计算它。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.ensure_topological_positions:3
msgid ""
"Reordering passes call this before rewiring the DAG so that the "
"subsequent :meth:`reverse_adjacent_edge_order` checks are local."
msgstr ""
"重排序 pass 在重新连接 DAG 之前调用此方法，使得随后"
"的 :meth:`reverse_adjacent_edge_order` 检查是局部的。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.ensure_topological_positions:6
msgid "If the DAG contains a cycle."
msgstr "当 DAG 中存在环时。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.reverse_adjacent_edge_order:1
msgid ""
"Repair the topological numbering after ``second`` was moved before ``first``."
msgstr "在 ``second`` 被移到 ``first`` 之前后，修复拓扑编号。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.reverse_adjacent_edge_order:3
msgid ""
"This is the incremental (Pearce-Kelly) step used by commutation reordering: "
"the caller has rewired the DAG so that ``second_id`` now precedes "
"``first_id`` (an edge ``second -> first`` exists and the old ``first -> "
"second`` edges are gone), where previously ``first_id`` preceded "
"``second_id``. The method checks in time proportional to the affected region "
"whether the rewiring created a cycle and, if not, updates the internal "
"numbering."
msgstr ""
"这是交换重排序所使用的增量（Pearce-Kelly）步骤：原先 ``first_id`` 位于 "
"``second_id`` 之前，调用方已重新连接 DAG，使 ``second_id`` 现在位于 "
"``first_id`` 之前（存在一条 ``second -> first`` 边，且旧的 ``first -> "
"second`` 边已被移除）。该方法以与受影响区域成正比的时间检查此次重连是否产生了"
"环，若没有，则更新内部编号。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.reverse_adjacent_edge_order:11
msgid "The node that used to come first."
msgstr "原先位于前面的节点。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.reverse_adjacent_edge_order:12
msgid "The node that now comes first."
msgstr "现在位于前面的节点。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.reverse_adjacent_edge_order:14
msgid ""
"True if the DAG is still acyclic, False if a cycle was created (the "
"numbering is left unchanged in that case)."
msgstr "若 DAG 仍然无环则为 True；若产生了环则为 False（此时编号保持不变）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.layers:1
msgid "Partition nodes into layers (depth levels) for scheduling."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.layers:3
msgid ""
"Each layer contains nodes whose longest path from any INPUT node is the same "
"length. Within a layer, nodes have no dependencies on each other and can be "
"executed in parallel."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.layers:7
msgid "A list of layers, each layer is a list of node_ids."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.critical_path_length:1
msgid "Return the length of the critical path through the DAG."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.critical_path_length:3
msgid ""
"The critical path is the longest chain of dependent operations, which "
"determines the minimum execution time. INPUT and OUTPUT nodes are excluded "
"from the count."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.critical_path_length:7
msgid "Number of operation nodes on the longest dependency chain."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.nodes_on_wire:1
msgid "Return node_ids on a given qubit/bit wire in topological order."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.nodes_on_wire:3
msgid ""
"For a well-formed circuit DAG this walks the wire from its INPUT node in "
"O(length of the wire); otherwise it falls back to scanning the (cached) "
"topological order."
msgstr ""
"对于结构良好的线路 DAG，此方法从该线的 INPUT 节点出发沿线遍历，耗时为 O(线的"
"长度)；否则回退为扫描（已缓存的）拓扑序。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.dag_circuit.DAGCircuit.nodes_on_wire:7
msgid "Wire identifier, e.g. ``\"q0\"`` or ``\"c1\"``."
msgstr ""

