msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomial.optimize:1
msgid "Simplify the phase terms without changing the represented unitary."
msgstr "在不改变所表示酉算符的前提下化简相位项。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomial.optimize:3
msgid ""
"The phase function ``phi(x) = sum_k angle_k * (c_k . x mod 2)`` is "
"canonicalised in place:"
msgstr "相位函数 ``phi(x) = sum_k angle_k * (c_k . x mod 2)`` 会被原地规范化："

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomial.optimize:6
msgid "terms with the same parity vector are merged (angles added),"
msgstr "具有相同奇偶向量的项会被合并（角度相加），"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomial.optimize:7
msgid ""
"terms whose angle is a multiple of ``2*pi`` (within ``atol``) are dropped, "
"as are terms with an all-zero parity (global phase)."
msgstr ""
"角度为 ``2*pi`` 整数倍（在 ``atol`` 范围内）的项会被丢弃，奇偶向量全零的项"
"（全局相位）也会被丢弃。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomial.optimize:10
msgid ""
"The parity matrix is left untouched: it is the linear (CNOT) part of the "
"circuit and is required to reproduce the circuit semantics. CNOT-count "
"reduction happens during synthesis in :meth:`to_circuit`."
msgstr ""
"奇偶矩阵保持不变：它是电路的线性（CNOT）部分，是复现电路语义所必需的。CNOT 数"
"量的削减在 :meth:`to_circuit` 的综合过程中进行。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomial.optimize:15
msgid "Absolute tolerance for treating an angle as ``0 mod 2*pi``."
msgstr "将角度视为 ``0 mod 2*pi`` 时使用的绝对容差。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomial.to_circuit:1
msgid "Synthesize a QuantumCircuit from this phase polynomial."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomial.to_circuit:3
msgid ""
"The synthesised {CNOT, RZ} circuit implements ``|x> -> exp(i phi(x)) |A x>`` "
"(up to a global phase), where ``A`` is :attr:`parity_matrix` and ``phi`` the "
"phase function of :attr:`terms`. The synthesis tracks the current linear map "
"of the wires (starting from the identity):"
msgstr ""
"综合得到的 {CNOT, RZ} 电路实现 ``|x> -> exp(i phi(x)) |A x>`` （至多相差一个"
"全局相位），其中 ``A`` 为 :attr:`parity_matrix`，``phi`` 为 :attr:`terms` 的"
"相位函数。综合过程会跟踪各线当前的线性映射（从单位映射开始）："

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomial.to_circuit:9
msgid ""
"For every phase term with parity ``v``, CNOTs are applied so that some wire "
"carries exactly ``v`` (``v`` is written as a sum of current wire parities "
"via Gaussian elimination over GF(2)), and ``RZ(angle)`` is applied to that "
"wire."
msgstr ""
"对于每个奇偶性为 ``v`` 的相位项，施加 CNOT 使某条线恰好携带 ``v`` （通过 "
"GF(2) 上的高斯消元把 ``v`` 写成当前各线奇偶性之和），然后在该线上施加 "
"``RZ(angle)``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomial.to_circuit:13
msgid ""
"Finally a CNOT network maps the current linear map to the target parity "
"matrix."
msgstr "最后，一个 CNOT 网络将当前线性映射变换为目标奇偶矩阵。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomial.to_circuit:16
msgid ""
"A QuantumCircuit implementing this phase polynomial (up to global phase)."
msgstr "实现该相位多项式的 QuantumCircuit（至多相差一个全局相位）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomial.to_circuit:19
msgid "If the parity matrix is not invertible over GF(2)."
msgstr "当奇偶矩阵在 GF(2) 上不可逆时。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomial.to_circuit:23
msgid ""
"This produces a {CNOT, RZ} circuit. Hadamard gates and other Clifford "
"operations are not synthesized by this method (they must be handled "
"separately)."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomialCompiler:1
msgid "Compiler that extracts a PhasePolynomial from a DAGCircuit."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomialCompiler:3
msgid ""
"This compiler handles {CNOT, RZ, H, X, S, T, ...} circuits by: 1. Tracking "
"the parity matrix through CNOT gates 2. Accumulating phase terms from RZ/"
"Phase gates 3. Handling Hadamard gates via basis-change commutativity rules"
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomialCompiler:8
msgid ""
"For full universality, Clifford+T or Clifford+RZ gates are needed. RZ gates "
"contribute directly to the phase polynomial; other gates are handled via "
"commutation or basis changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomialCompiler.extract:1
msgid "Extract a phase polynomial from a DAGCircuit."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomialCompiler.extract:5
msgid "A PhasePolynomial representing the {CNOT, RZ} skeleton of the circuit."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomialCompiler.extract:10
msgid ""
"Only CNOT, CZ, RZ, Phase, S, T, and similar diagonal or parity-transforming "
"gates are extracted. Hadamard and other non-diagonal gates are skipped with "
"a warning."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomialCompiler.extract_and_optimize:1
msgid "Extract and optimize a phase polynomial."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomialCompiler.extract_and_optimize:3
msgid ""
"Convenience method that runs extraction followed "
"by :meth:`PhasePolynomial.optimize` (merging same-parity terms and dropping "
"trivial ones). The result still represents the input circuit, so "
"``extract_and_optimize(dag).to_circuit()`` is equivalent to it up to global "
"phase."
msgstr ""
"便捷方法：先执行提取，再调用 :meth:`PhasePolynomial.optimize` （合并相同奇偶"
"性的项并丢弃平凡项）。结果仍表示输入电路，因此 "
"``extract_and_optimize(dag).to_circuit()`` 在至多相差全局相位的意义下与输入电"
"路等价。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhasePolynomialCompiler.extract_and_optimize:11
msgid "Optimized PhasePolynomial."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhaseTerm:1
msgid "A single term in a phase polynomial."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhaseTerm:3
msgid ""
"Represents ``angle * (-1)^{parity}`` applied as a diagonal unitary on the "
"computational basis states."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhaseTerm:8
msgid "The rotation angle in radians."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
#: quspect.dag.phase_polynomial.PhaseTerm:10
