msgid ""
"Binary vector (over GF(2)) of length ``num_qubits``. The term applies a "
"phase of ``angle`` to all basis states where ``dot(parity, x) = 1 (mod 2)``."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/phase_polynomial.py:docstring of
