#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_node.py:docstring of quspect.dag.dag_node:1
msgid ""
"DAG node and edge data models for quantum circuit intermediate "
"representation."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_node.py:docstring of quspect.dag.dag_node:3
msgid ""
"The DAG (Directed Acyclic Graph) is the core intermediate representation "
"(IR) for quantum circuit compilation, optimization, and analysis. It "
"explicitly encodes qubit/bit dependencies between operations."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of quspect.dag.dag_circuit:1
msgid "DAG representation of quantum circuits."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of quspect.dag.dag_circuit:3
msgid ""
"The :class:`DAGCircuit` is the core intermediate representation (IR) for "
"quantum circuit compilation. It makes qubit dependencies explicit through a "
"directed acyclic graph structure."
msgstr ""

#: ../mergewt/quspect/dag/dag_circuit.py:docstring of quspect.dag.dag_circuit:7
msgid ""
"Internally every node keeps its incoming and outgoing edges in small lists "
"ordered by an edge *sequence number* (the global insertion order), so that "
"local queries (wire neighbours, adjacency tests, node removal) cost "
"O(degree) instead of O(edges). Wire traversal walks the per-wire chain from "
"the wire's INPUT node, and the topological order is cached until the next "
"structural modification."
msgstr ""
"在内部，每个节点都把其入边和出边保存在按边\\ *序号*\\ （全局插入顺序）排序的"
"小列表中，使局部查询（线上的相邻节点、邻接判断、节点删除）的开销为 O(度数) 而"
"不是 O(边数)。线遍历从该线的 INPUT 节点出发沿每条线的链进行，拓扑序会被缓存，"
"直到下一次结构修改。"

