#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:137
msgid "Synthesis"
msgstr "综合"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/__init__.py:docstring of quspect.synthesis:1
msgid "QuSpect synthesis — exact unitary-to-circuit synthesis routines."
msgstr "QuSpect 综合模块——精确的酉矩阵到线路综合例程。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/__init__.py:docstring of quspect.synthesis:3
msgid ""
"Currently provides two-qubit synthesis via the KAK (Cartan) decomposition, "
"emitting the minimal number of entangling gates (0–3) plus single-qubit "
"gates: by default CZ with ``{h, rz, x}``, or "
"any :class:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitBasis` (e.g. CX with the "
"IBM ``{rz, sx, x}`` gates)."
msgstr ""
"目前提供基于 KAK（Cartan）分解的两比特综合，使用最少数量（0–3 个）的纠缠门以"
"及单量子比特门：默认使用 CZ 与 ``{h, rz, x}``，也可使用任"
"意 :class:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitBasis`\\ （例如 CX 加 IBM 的 "
"``{rz, sx, x}``）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler:1
msgid "A native two-qubit gate that is locally equivalent to CZ."
msgstr "与 CZ 局部等价的原生两比特门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler:3
msgid ""
"The KAK templates are written with CZ; each CZ is replaced by the entangler "
"through ``CZ = (after[0] ⊗ after[1]) · E · (before[0] ⊗ before[1])`` "
"(matrices, ``before`` acts first in time), and the dressings are folded into "
"the adjacent single-qubit layers."
msgstr ""
"KAK 模板用 CZ 写成；每个 CZ 通过 ``CZ = (after[0] ⊗ after[1]) · E · "
"(before[0] ⊗ before[1])``\\ （矩阵形式，``before`` 在时间上先作用）替换为该纠"
"缠门，修饰门被并入相邻的单量子比特层。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler:10
msgid "Gate name emitted for the entangler (e.g. ``\"cx\"``)."
msgstr "该纠缠门输出时使用的门名（例如 ``\"cx\"``）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler:16
msgid "Its ``4×4`` unitary on ``(q0, q1)`` (``q0`` most significant)."
msgstr "它在 ``(q0, q1)`` 上的 ``4×4`` 酉矩阵（``q0`` 为最高有效位）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler:23
msgid "``(B0, B1)`` applied to ``(q0, q1)`` before ``E``."
msgstr "在 ``E`` 之前作用于 ``(q0, q1)`` 的 ``(B0, B1)``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler:25
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler:31
msgid "tuple[numpy.ndarray, numpy.ndarray]"
msgstr "tuple[numpy.ndarray, numpy.ndarray]"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler:29
msgid "``(A0, A1)`` applied to ``(q0, q1)`` after ``E``."
msgstr "在 ``E`` 之后作用于 ``(q0, q1)`` 的 ``(A0, A1)``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler:35
msgid ""
"Whether ``E`` is invariant under exchanging its qubits (then only one "
"orientation is tried)."
msgstr "``E`` 在交换两个量子比特后是否不变（若是，只尝试一种朝向）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler.from_matrix:1
msgid "Build an entangler from its matrix, deriving the CZ dressing by KAK."
msgstr "由矩阵构造纠缠门，并用 KAK 推导出 CZ 修饰门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler.from_matrix:3
msgid "Gate name emitted for the entangler."
msgstr "该纠缠门输出时使用的门名。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler.from_matrix:4
msgid ""
"Its ``4×4`` unitary; must be locally equivalent to CZ (Weyl point ``(π/4, 0, "
"0)``)."
msgstr "它的 ``4×4`` 酉矩阵；必须与 CZ 局部等价（Weyl 点 ``(π/4, 0, 0)``）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler.from_matrix:7
msgid "The :class:`Entangler`."
msgstr "该 :class:`Entangler`。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler.from_matrix:9
msgid ""
"If ``matrix`` is not a ``4×4`` unitary or not in the     CZ class (e.g. "
"iSWAP, which needs its own templates)."
msgstr ""
"若 ``matrix`` 不是 ``4×4`` 酉矩阵，或不属于 CZ 类（例如 iSWAP，它需要自己的模"
"板）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler.oriented:1
msgid "Return ``(matrix, dressing)`` of the gate applied as ``(q1, q0)``."
msgstr "返回该门以 ``(q1, q0)`` 作用时的 ``(matrix, dressing)``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler.oriented:3
msgid "If False, return this entangler unchanged."
msgstr "若为 False，原样返回该纠缠门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.Entangler.oriented:5
msgid ""
"The ``4×4`` matrix on ``(q0, q1)`` and an entangler whose ``before``/"
"``after`` are expressed on ``(q0, q1)``."
msgstr ""
"``(q0, q1)`` 上的 ``4×4`` 矩阵，以及一个 ``before``/``after`` 均以 ``(q0, "
"q1)`` 表示的纠缠门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitBasis:1
msgid "Target gate set of the two-qubit synthesis."
msgstr "两比特综合的目标门集。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitBasis:5
msgid "Name of the native entangler (see :func:`entangler`)."
msgstr "原生纠缠门的名称（见 :func:`entangler`）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitBasis:11
msgid "Single-qubit Euler basis (a key of :data:`EULER_BASES`)."
msgstr "单量子比特欧拉基（:data:`EULER_BASES` 的键）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.TwoQubitBasis.gates:1
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitBasis.gates:1
msgid "Names of all gates the synthesis may emit in this basis."
msgstr "该基下综合可能输出的全部门名。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitBasis.from_gates:1
msgid "Pick a synthesis basis contained in a native gate set."
msgstr "在原生门集中选出一个综合基。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitBasis.from_gates:3
msgid ""
"The entangler is ``cz`` if available, else ``cx``, else any other registered "
"entangler (alphabetically); the Euler basis is ``\"zxz\"`` if ``{rz, h, x}`` "
"is available, else ``\"zsx\"``."
msgstr ""
"纠缠门优先选 ``cz``，其次 ``cx``，再其次按字母序选其他已注册的纠缠门；欧拉基"
"在 ``{rz, h, x}`` 可用时为 ``\"zxz\"``，否则为 ``\"zsx\"``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitBasis.from_gates:7
msgid "Native gate names."
msgstr "原生门名。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitBasis.from_gates:9
msgid "The basis, or ``None`` if the set lacks an entangler or an Euler basis."
msgstr "综合基；若门集缺少纠缠门或欧拉基则为 ``None``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitKAK:1
msgid "Result of a two-qubit KAK decomposition."
msgstr "两比特 KAK 分解的结果。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitKAK:3
msgid ""
"The represented unitary is ``exp(i*global_phase) * K1 · Can(a, b, c) · K2`` "
"with ``K1 = k1l ⊗ k1r`` and ``K2 = k2l ⊗ k2r`` (``l`` acts on the most "
"significant qubit). When produced by :func:`kak_decompose` the coordinates "
"lie in the Weyl chamber ``π/4 ≥ a ≥ b ≥ |c|``."
msgstr ""
"所表示的酉矩阵为 ``exp(i*global_phase) * K1 · Can(a, b, c) · K2``，其中 ``K1 "
"= k1l ⊗ k1r``、``K2 = k2l ⊗ k2r``\\ （``l`` 作用于最高有效位量子比特）。"
"由 :func:`kak_decompose` 生成时，坐标位于 Weyl 腔 ``π/4 ≥ a ≥ b ≥ |c|`` 内。"

