msgstr "满足 ``π/4 ≥ a ≥ b ≥ |c|`` 的 ``(a, b, c)``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit:1
msgid "Two-qubit unitary synthesis with a minimal number of CZ gates."
msgstr "使用最少 CZ 门数量的两比特酉矩阵综合。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit:3
msgid "Any ``U ∈ U(4)`` admits a KAK (Cartan) decomposition"
msgstr "任意 ``U ∈ U(4)`` 都存在 KAK（Cartan）分解"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit:5
msgid ""
"U = e^{i\\phi}\\,(K_{1l} \\otimes K_{1r})\\,\n"
"    \\exp\\!\\big(i(a\\,XX + b\\,YY + c\\,ZZ)\\big)\\,\n"
"    (K_{2l} \\otimes K_{2r}),"
msgstr ""
"U = e^{i\\phi}\\,(K_{1l} \\otimes K_{1r})\\,\n"
"    \\exp\\!\\big(i(a\\,XX + b\\,YY + c\\,ZZ)\\big)\\,\n"
"    (K_{2l} \\otimes K_{2r}),"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit:11
msgid ""
"where the *Weyl coordinates* ``(a, b, c)`` can be brought into the Weyl "
"chamber ``π/4 ≥ a ≥ b ≥ |c|`` by local Clifford corrections (Kraus & Cirac "
"2001; Zhang et al. 2003). The chamber point determines how many CZ gates are "
"needed (Vatan & Williams 2004; Shende, Markov & Bullock 2004):"
msgstr ""
"其中 *Weyl 坐标*\\ ``(a, b, c)`` 可以通过局部 Clifford 修正变换到 Weyl 腔 "
"``π/4 ≥ a ≥ b ≥ |c|`` 内（Kraus & Cirac 2001；Zhang 等 2003）。腔中的点决定了"
"所需的 CZ 门数量（Vatan & Williams 2004；Shende、Markov & Bullock 2004）："

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit:16
msgid "0 CZ — ``(0, 0, 0)`` (the unitary is local);"
msgstr "0 个 CZ —— ``(0, 0, 0)``\\ （该酉矩阵是局部的）；"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit:17
msgid "1 CZ — ``(π/4, 0, 0)`` (CZ / CNOT equivalent);"
msgstr "1 个 CZ —— ``(π/4, 0, 0)``\\ （与 CZ / CNOT 等价）；"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit:18
msgid "2 CZ — ``c = 0``;"
msgstr "2 个 CZ —— ``c = 0``；"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit:19
msgid "3 CZ — otherwise."
msgstr "3 个 CZ —— 其他情况。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit:21
msgid ""
"The decomposition is computed in the magic (Bell) basis, where local gates "
"become real orthogonal matrices and the canonical gate becomes diagonal. The "
"simultaneous real-orthogonal diagonalisation of the complex-symmetric matrix "
"``M = U_B^T U_B`` follows the randomized approach of Qiskit's "
"``TwoQubitWeylDecomposition`` (diagonalise a random real combination of ``Re "
"M`` and ``Im M`` and verify), which is robust for degenerate spectra. This "
"is an independent implementation; no Qiskit code is reused."
msgstr ""
"分解在魔法（Bell）基下进行：局部门在该基下变为实正交矩阵，标准门变为对角矩"
"阵。复对称矩阵 ``M = U_B^T U_B`` 的同时实正交对角化沿用 Qiskit "
"``TwoQubitWeylDecomposition`` 的随机化方法（对 ``Re M`` 与 ``Im M`` 的随机实"
"线性组合做对角化并验证），对简并谱也很稳健。这是独立实现，未复用任何 Qiskit "
"代码。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit:29
msgid ""
"Single-qubit parts are emitted as a ZXZ Euler sequence ``rz · h · rz · h · "
"rz`` (with identity rotations dropped and the ``θ = π`` case shortened to "
"``rz · x``), so the output only contains gates from ``{cz, h, rz, x}``."
msgstr ""
"单量子比特部分以 ZXZ 欧拉序列 ``rz · h · rz · h · rz`` 输出（丢弃恒等旋转，"
"``θ = π`` 的情形缩短为 ``rz · x``），因此输出只包含 ``{cz, h, rz, x}`` 中的"
"门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit:34
msgid ""
"Other targets are described by a :class:`TwoQubitBasis`: the native "
"entangler (any registered gate locally equivalent to CZ, "
"see :class:`Entangler`; ``cz`` and ``cx`` are built in) and the single-qubit "
"Euler basis (``\"zxz\"`` = ``{rz, h, x}``, ``\"zsx\"`` = ``{rz, sx, x}`` for "
"IBM-style devices).  The KAK templates are always CZ templates; every CZ is "
"rewritten as ``CZ = (A₀⊗A₁) · E · (B₀⊗B₁)`` for the entangler ``E`` and the "
"local dressings are folded into the neighbouring single-qubit layers before "
"their Euler synthesis, so the entangler count is the CZ count and the single-"
"qubit layers stay at most one Euler sequence each (for CX the dressing is a "
"Hadamard on the target).  An asymmetric entangler is tried in both "
"orientations per gate and the shortest result is kept.  Entanglers outside "
"the CZ class (iSWAP, √iSWAP, …) need their own templates and are rejected "
"by :meth:`Entangler.from_matrix` for now."
msgstr ""
"其他目标由 :class:`TwoQubitBasis` 描述：原生纠缠门（任何已注册、与 CZ 局部等"
"价的门，见 :class:`Entangler`；内置 ``cz`` 与 ``cx``）以及单量子比特欧拉基"
"（``\"zxz\"`` = ``{rz, h, x}``，面向 IBM 风格设备的 ``\"zsx\"`` = ``{rz, sx, "
"x}``）。KAK 模板始终是 CZ 模板；每个 CZ 被改写为 ``CZ = (A₀⊗A₁) · E · "
"(B₀⊗B₁)``\\ （``E`` 为纠缠门），局部修饰门在欧拉综合之前并入相邻的单量子比特"
"层，因此纠缠门数等于 CZ 数，每个单量子比特层仍至多是一个欧拉序列（CX 的修饰门"
"是目标比特上的 Hadamard）。非对称纠缠门对每个门尝试两种朝向，保留最短的结果。"
"CZ 类之外的纠缠门（iSWAP、√iSWAP 等）需要专门的模板，目前会"
"被 :meth:`Entangler.from_matrix` 拒绝。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit:48
msgid ""
"Accuracy: every synthesized circuit ``V`` is verified against the input "
"``U`` with the phase-aligned element-wise distance ``max|U - e^{iφ}V|``, "
"which is linear in any dropped angle, and accepted only below ``verify_atol "
"= 1e-9``. Reduced CZ counts proposed by the Weyl coordinates (within ``atol "
"= 1e-9`` of a chamber face) are thus only used when the dropped interaction "
"really costs less than ``1e-9``; otherwise more CZ gates are used. Error "
"budget: an element-wise deviation ``ε`` of a ``4×4`` block is at most ``4ε`` "
"in operator norm and such errors add at most linearly, so ``10⁴`` blocks "
"keep ``1 - F ≤ (4·10⁴·ε)² ≈ 1.6·10⁻⁹`` in the worst case."
msgstr ""
"精度：每个综合出的线路 ``V`` 都用相位对齐的逐元素距离 ``max|U - e^{iφ}V|`` 与"
"输入 ``U`` 比较验证（该距离对任何被丢弃的角度都是线性的），仅当其低于 "
"``verify_atol = 1e-9`` 时才被接受。因此，由 Weyl 坐标提出的更少 CZ 数量（与腔"
"面距离在 ``atol = 1e-9`` 以内）只有在被丢弃的相互作用的代价确实小于 ``1e-9`` "
"时才会采用；否则使用更多 CZ 门。误差预算：``4×4`` 块的逐元素偏差 ``ε`` 在算子"
"范数下至多为 ``4ε``，且此类误差至多线性累加，因此 ``10⁴`` 个块在最坏情况下仍"
"满足 ``1 - F ≤ (4·10⁴·ε)² ≈ 1.6·10⁻⁹``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit:58
msgid ""
"Qubit convention: for a two-qubit matrix acting on ``(q0, q1)``, ``q0`` is "
"the most significant bit (``|q0 q1⟩``), matching :mod:`quspect.gates`."
msgstr ""
"量子比特约定：对作用于 ``(q0, q1)`` 的两比特矩阵，``q0`` 为最高有效位（``|q0 "
"q1⟩``），与 :mod:`quspect.gates` 一致。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.EULER_BASES:1
msgid "name → gates it emits."
msgstr "名称 → 其输出的门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.EULER_BASES:3
msgid "Single-qubit Euler bases of the KAK synthesis"
msgstr "KAK 综合的单量子比特欧拉基"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.ApproximationError:1
msgid "How far an approximate implementation ``V`` is from a target ``U``."
msgstr "近似实现 ``V`` 与目标 ``U`` 之间的差距。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.ApproximationError:5
msgid ""
"Average gate infidelity ``1 - F̄(U, V)`` with ``F̄ = (1 + d·F_pro) / (1 + d)`` "
"and the process fidelity ``F_pro = |tr(U^† V)|² / d²`` (``d`` = dimension).  "
"This is the quantity Qiskit's ``RemoveIdentityEquivalent`` and approximate "
"synthesis compare against ``1 - approximation_degree``."
msgstr ""
"平均门不保真度 ``1 - F̄(U, V)``，其中 ``F̄ = (1 + d·F_pro) / (1 + d)``，过程保"
"真度 ``F_pro = |tr(U^† V)|² / d²``\\ （``d`` 为维数）。Qiskit 的 "
"``RemoveIdentityEquivalent`` 与近似综合正是拿这个量与 ``1 - "
"approximation_degree`` 比较。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.ApproximationError:15
msgid ""
"Upper bound on the operator-norm distance up to global phase, ``min_φ ‖U - "
"e^{iφ} V‖₂``.  Unlike the infidelity it adds up along a circuit: replacing "
"operations ``U_i`` by ``V_i`` changes the whole circuit by at most ``Σ "
"distance_i`` (up to global phase), and a circuit-level distance ``δ`` "
"implies a process infidelity of at most ``δ²``."
msgstr ""
"相差一个全局相位意义下的算子范数距离上界 ``min_φ ‖U - e^{iφ} V‖₂``。与不保真"
"度不同，它沿线路可加：把操作 ``U_i`` 换成 ``V_i`` 后，整条线路的变化（相差全"
"局相位）至多为 ``Σ distance_i``；线路级距离 ``δ`` 意味着过程不保真度至多为 "
"``δ²``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.approximation_error:1
msgid ""
"Return the :class:`ApproximationError` of ``v`` as an implementation of "
"``u``."
msgstr "返回把 ``v`` 作为 ``u`` 的实现时的 :class:`ApproximationError`。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.approximation_error:3
msgid ""
"The distance bound comes from the eigenphases of ``W = U^† V``: if they lie "
"on an arc of length ``L ≤ π``, choosing the phase at the arc centre gives "
"``‖U - e^{iφ}V‖₂ = max_k |e^{iλ_k} - e^{iφ}| = 2 sin(L/4)``."
msgstr ""
"距离上界由 ``W = U^† V`` 的本征相位给出：若它们落在长度 ``L ≤ π`` 的一段弧"
"上，取弧中点处的相位即得 ``‖U - e^{iφ}V‖₂ = max_k |e^{iλ_k} - e^{iφ}| = 2 "
"sin(L/4)``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.approximation_error:7
msgid "Target unitary (``d×d``)."
msgstr "目标酉矩阵（``d×d``）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.approximation_error:8
