#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.approximation_error:10
msgid ""
"The average gate infidelity and the phase-optimal operator-norm distance "
"bound (``2.0``, the trivial bound, if the eigenphases are spread over more "
"than half the circle)."
msgstr ""
"平均门不保真度与相位最优的算子范数距离上界（若本征相位分布超过半个圆周，则取"
"平凡上界 ``2.0``）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
