msgstr "将单量子比特酉矩阵综合为 ``rz · sx · rz · sx · rz``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.euler_zsx_ops:3
msgid ""
"The IBM-style counterpart of :func:`euler_zxz_ops`: with ``U = e^{iγ} Rz(φ) "
"Rx(θ) Rz(λ)`` and ``Rx(θ) ∝ Rz(π/2)·SX·Rz(θ+π)·SX· Rz(π/2)``, the circuit is "
"``rz(λ+π/2), sx, rz(θ+π), sx, rz(φ+π/2)``. Identity rotations are dropped, "
"``θ ≈ 0`` collapses to one ``rz``, ``θ ≈ π/2`` to ``rz · sx · rz`` and ``θ ≈ "
"π`` to ``rz · x``.  The output uses only ``rz``, ``sx`` and ``x`` and is "
"exact up to global phase."
msgstr ""
":func:`euler_zxz_ops` 的 IBM 风格对应版本：由 ``U = e^{iγ} Rz(φ) Rx(θ) "
"Rz(λ)`` 和 ``Rx(θ) ∝ Rz(π/2)·SX·Rz(θ+π)·SX· Rz(π/2)``，线路为 ``rz(λ+π/2), "
"sx, rz(θ+π), sx, rz(φ+π/2)``。恒等旋转会被丢弃，``θ ≈ 0`` 时化为一个 ``rz``，"
"``θ ≈ π/2`` 时化为 ``rz · sx · rz``，``θ ≈ π`` 时化为 ``rz · x``。输出只使用 "
"``rz``、``sx`` 和 ``x``，在相差全局相位的意义下是精确的。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.euler_zxz_ops:1
msgid "Synthesize a single-qubit unitary as ``rz · h · rz · h · rz``."
msgstr "将单量子比特酉矩阵综合为 ``rz · h · rz · h · rz``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.euler_zxz_ops:3
msgid ""
"Uses ``U = e^{iγ} Rz(φ) Rx(θ) Rz(λ)`` with ``Rx(θ) = H Rz(θ) H``. Identity "
"rotations are dropped, ``θ ≈ 0`` collapses to one ``rz``, ``θ ≈ π/2`` to "
"``rz · h · rz`` and ``θ ≈ π`` to ``rz · x``. The result is exact up to "
"global phase."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``U = e^{iγ} Rz(φ) Rx(θ) Rz(λ)`` 以及 ``Rx(θ) = H Rz(θ) H``。恒等旋转会"
"被丢弃，``θ ≈ 0`` 时化为一个 ``rz``，``θ ≈ π/2`` 时化为 ``rz · h · rz``，``θ "
"≈ π`` 时化为 ``rz · x``。结果在相差全局相位的意义下是精确的。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
