#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_two_qubit_approx:1
msgid "Approximate two-qubit synthesis with an explicit error report."
msgstr "带显式误差报告的近似两比特综合。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_two_qubit_approx:3
msgid ""
"Tries the entangler counts below the exact one "
"(from :func:`num_cz_required`) in increasing order.  For each count ``k`` "
"the Weyl point ``(a, b, c)`` of ``unitary`` is projected onto the points "
"reachable with ``k`` CZ gates (``(0, 0, 0)``, ``(π/4, 0, 0)``, ``(a, b, "
"0)``) keeping the local KAK factors; a projection whose predicted average "
"gate infidelity exceeds ``max_infidelity`` is skipped without synthesis.  "
"Otherwise the ``k``-entangler circuit is emitted and its *actual* error (of "
"the emitted gates, Euler snapping included) is measured "
"with :func:`approximation_error`; it is accepted when the infidelity is at "
"most ``max_infidelity``.  If no reduced count qualifies, the exact synthesis "
"of :func:`synthesize_two_qubit_ops` is returned."
msgstr ""
"按从小到大的顺序尝试低于精确值（来自 :func:`num_cz_required`）的纠缠门数。对"
"每个门数 ``k``，把 ``unitary`` 的 Weyl 点 ``(a, b, c)`` 投影到 ``k`` 个 CZ 可"
"达的点（``(0, 0, 0)``、``(π/4, 0, 0)``、``(a, b, 0)``），并保留 KAK 局部因"
"子；预测的平均门不保真度超过 ``max_infidelity`` 的投影直接跳过、不做综合。否"
"则发出 ``k`` 个纠缠门的线路，并用 :func:`approximation_error` 测量其\\ *实际"
"*\\ 误差（针对发出的门，含 Euler 角吸附）；不保真度至多为 ``max_infidelity`` "
"时接受。若没有可用的更少门数，返回 :func:`synthesize_two_qubit_ops` 的精确综"
"合。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
