msgstr "在一个作用域内用 SWAP 形模板综合 SWAP 面上的块。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.swap_face_templates:3
msgid ""
"Inside the context :func:`synthesize_two_qubit_ops` (and the exact fallback "
"of :func:`synthesize_two_qubit_approx`) writes blocks on the SWAP face ``a = "
"b = π/4`` as ``SWAP·exp(-iθ/2·ZZ) = CX·CX'·Rz(θ)·CX`` dressed with outer "
"layers (see :func:`synthesize_swap_face_block`). The setting is module-wide "
"(not thread-local)."
msgstr ""
"在该上下文中，:func:`synthesize_two_qubit_ops`\\ （以"
"及 :func:`synthesize_two_qubit_approx` 的精确回退）把位于 SWAP 面 ``a = b = "
"π/4`` 上的块写成 ``SWAP·exp(-iθ/2·ZZ) = CX·CX'·Rz(θ)·CX`` 再配上外层单量子比"
"特门（见 :func:`synthesize_swap_face_block`）。该设置是模块级的（不是线程局部"
"的）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
