msgstr "上下文内的设置。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_swap_face_block:1
msgid "Synthesize a SWAP-face block with the SWAP-shaped 3-entangler template."
msgstr "用 SWAP 形的三纠缠门模板综合一个 SWAP 面上的块。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_swap_face_block:3
msgid ""
"Blocks whose Weyl point is ``(π/4, π/4, c)`` — a SWAP fused with a ZZ / CP / "
"CX interaction, as routing produces them — are written as ``SWAP·exp(-iθ/"
"2·ZZ) = CX·CX'·Rz(θ)·CX`` dressed with outer single-qubit layers: the inner "
"layers hold one ``rz`` (plus Hadamards for a CZ entangler) instead of two "
"general rotations."
msgstr ""
"Weyl 点为 ``(π/4, π/4, c)`` 的块——路由产生的、与 ZZ / CP / CX 相互作用融合的 "
"SWAP——写成 ``SWAP·exp(-iθ/2·ZZ) = CX·CX'·Rz(θ)·CX`` 再配上外层单量子比特门："
"内层只有一个 ``rz``\\ （CZ 纠缠门时另加 Hadamard），而不是两个一般旋转。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_swap_face_block:9
msgid "A ``4×4`` unitary (``q0`` most significant)."
msgstr "一个 ``4×4`` 酉矩阵（``q0`` 为最高有效位）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_swap_face_block:10
msgid "Target :class:`TwoQubitBasis`."
msgstr "目标 :class:`TwoQubitBasis`。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_swap_face_block:11
msgid "Acceptance tolerance of the emitted circuit."
msgstr "所发出线路的接受容差。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_swap_face_block:13
msgid ""
"The gate tuples (three entanglers), or ``None`` if the block is not on the "
"SWAP face, needs fewer than three entanglers, or the template does not "
"verify."
msgstr ""
"门元组（三个纠缠门）；若块不在 SWAP 面上、少于三个纠缠门即可、或模板未通过校"
"验，则为 ``None``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_two_qubit_ops:1
msgid "Synthesize a two-qubit unitary into time-ordered gate tuples."
msgstr "将两比特酉矩阵综合为按时间顺序排列的门元组。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_two_qubit_ops:3
msgid ""
"This is the allocation-light core used "
"by :class:`~quspect.transpiler.ConsolidateBlocksPass`; "
"see :func:`synthesize_two_qubit` for the circuit-returning wrapper."
msgstr ""
"这是 :class:`~quspect.transpiler.ConsolidateBlocksPass` 所用的低内存分配核"
"心；返回线路的封装请参见 :func:`synthesize_two_qubit`。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_two_qubit_ops:7
msgid ""
"The Weyl coordinates only propose the smallest CZ count ``k`` (a coordinate "
"within ``atol`` of a chamber face is treated as lying on it). Every "
"candidate is then verified on the unitary of the emitted gates with the "
"phase-aligned element-wise distance ``max|U - e^{iφ}V| ≤ verify_atol``, "
"which is linear in any dropped angle. A candidate that fails is retried with "
"exact Euler angles (no small rotations dropped), and then with ``k + 1`` CZ "
"gates. Hence a weak interaction is only removed when doing so costs less "
"than ``verify_atol``: e.g. ``CP(θ)`` (Weyl point ``(θ/4, 0, 0)``) is written "
"without CZ only for ``θ < 4e-9``, where the dropped ``exp(iθ/4·ZZ)`` costs "
"``≤ 1e-9`` (its local ``rz(θ/2)`` parts are kept when dropping them too "
"would exceed the tolerance); ``CP(1e-6)`` keeps two CZ gates and is "
"reproduced to ~1e-15."
msgstr ""
"Weyl 坐标只用于提出最小的 CZ 数量 ``k``\\ （与腔面距离在 ``atol`` 以内的坐标"
"视为位于该面上）。随后，每个候选都在所输出门的酉矩阵上用相位对齐的逐元素距离 "
"``max|U - e^{iφ}V| ≤ verify_atol`` 进行验证，该距离对任何被丢弃的角度都是线性"
"的。验证失败的候选先以精确欧拉角（不丢弃任何小旋转）重试，再改用 ``k + 1`` "
"个 CZ 门。因此，只有当去掉一个弱相互作用的代价小于 ``verify_atol`` 时才会去掉"
"它：例如 ``CP(θ)``\\ （Weyl 点 ``(θ/4, 0, 0)``）仅在 ``θ < 4e-9`` 时不用 CZ "
"门实现，此时被丢弃的 ``exp(iθ/4·ZZ)`` 代价 ``≤ 1e-9``\\ （若连其局部 ``rz(θ/"
"2)`` 部分也丢弃会超出容差，则保留这些部分）；``CP(1e-6)`` 保留两个 CZ 门，重"
"建误差约为 1e-15。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_two_qubit_ops:24
msgid ""
"Acceptance tolerance of the synthesized circuit (see the error budget in the "
"module documentation)."
msgstr "综合线路的接受容差（误差预算参见模块文档）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_two_qubit_ops:26
msgid ""
"Target :class:`TwoQubitBasis` (default: ``cz`` with the ``{rz, h, x}`` Euler "
"basis).  The entangler count does not depend on the basis."
msgstr ""
"目标 :class:`TwoQubitBasis`\\ （默认：``cz`` 加 ``{rz, h, x}`` 欧拉基）。纠缠"
"门数量与基无关。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_two_qubit_ops:29
msgid ""
"Approximation budget (default ``0``: exact).  When positive, the circuit "
"with the fewest entanglers whose average gate infidelity to ``unitary`` "
"(see :func:`approximation_error`) is at most ``max_infidelity`` is returned: "
"the weak part of the interaction is dropped (Weyl point projected onto ``(0, "
"0, 0)``, ``(π/4, 0, 0)`` or the ``c = 0`` face) while the local parts are "
"kept, e.g. ``CP(θ)`` becomes ``rz(θ/2) ⊗ rz(θ/2)`` with infidelity ``θ²/"
"20``.  See :func:`synthesize_two_qubit_approx` for the error of the result."
msgstr ""
"近似预算（默认 ``0``：精确）。为正时，返回与 ``unitary`` 的平均门不保真度"
"（见 :func:`approximation_error`）不超过 ``max_infidelity`` 且纠缠门最少的线"
"路：丢掉相互作用中较弱的部分（Weyl 点投影到 ``(0, 0, 0)``、``(π/4, 0, 0)`` "
"或 ``c = 0`` 面），保留局部部分，例如 ``CP(θ)`` 变成 ``rz(θ/2) ⊗ rz(θ/2)``，"
"不保真度为 ``θ²/20``。结果的误差见 :func:`synthesize_two_qubit_approx`。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_two_qubit_ops:39
msgid ""
"A list of ``(name, qubits, params)`` tuples on local qubits 0 and 1, using "
"only the gates of ``basis`` (by default ``cz``, ``h``, ``rz`` and ``x``)."
msgstr ""
"局部量子比特 0 和 1 上的 ``(name, qubits, params)`` 元组列表，只使用 "
"``basis`` 中的门（默认 ``cz``、``h``、``rz`` 和 ``x``）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/synthesis/two_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_two_qubit_ops:44
msgid ""
"If no template reproduces the unitary (should not     happen for valid "
"input)."
msgstr "若没有模板能重现该酉矩阵（对合法输入不应发生）。"

#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:146
msgid "Transpiler: Block Consolidation"
msgstr "转译器：块合并"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate:1
msgid "Two-qubit block consolidation and KAK resynthesis."
msgstr "两比特块合并与 KAK 重综合。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate:3
msgid ""
":class:`ConsolidateBlocksPass` collects maximal runs of gates acting on the "
"same pair of qubits (including interleaved single-qubit gates on those "
"qubits), multiplies them into a ``4×4`` unitary and resynthesizes it "
"with :func:`quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_two_qubit_ops`, which "
"uses the minimal number (0–3) of CZ gates — or of the target's native "
"entangler (e.g. CX), "
"see :class:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitBasis`. A block is replaced "
"only when the new circuit has fewer two-qubit gates (ties broken by total "
"gate count)."
msgstr ""
":class:`ConsolidateBlocksPass` 收集作用于同一对量子比特的最长门序列（包括这两"
"个量子比特上穿插的单量子比特门），将其相乘得到 ``4×4`` 酉矩阵，并"
"用 :func:`quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_two_qubit_ops` 重新综合，后"
"者使用最少数量（0–3 个）的 CZ 门——或目标的原生纠缠门（例如 CX），"
"见 :class:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitBasis`。只有当新线路的两比特"
"门更少时（数量相同时比较总门数）才替换该块。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate:12
msgid ""
"The pass works directly on the flat instruction list of "
"a :class:`~quspect.circuit.circuit.QuantumCircuit` in a single linear sweep, "
"so it does not depend on :class:`~quspect.dag.DAGCircuit` internals."
msgstr ""
"该 pass 在单次线性扫描中直接处"
"理 :class:`~quspect.circuit.circuit.QuantumCircuit` 的扁平指令列表，因此不依"
"赖 :class:`~quspect.dag.DAGCircuit` 的内部实现。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass:1
msgid "Resynthesize two-qubit blocks with the minimal number of CZ gates."
msgstr "用最少数量的 CZ 门重新综合两比特块。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass:3
msgid ""
"The pass sweeps the instruction list once. Each qubit is either *free* or "
"owned by one open block on a qubit pair. A two-qubit gate on the block's "
"pair (or a single-qubit gate on one of its qubits) joins the block; any "
"other operation touching one of the qubits closes it. Single-qubit gates "
"seen on a free qubit are held back and absorbed into the next block that "
"starts on that qubit. Measurements, barriers, noise channels, gates with "
"symbolic parameters, gates of three or more qubits and gates without a known "
"matrix act as block boundaries."
msgstr ""
"该 pass 对指令列表只扫描一遍。每个量子比特要么是\\ *空闲*\\ 的，要么归属于某"
"个量子比特对上的一个开放块。作用于该块量子比特对的两比特门（或作用于其中一个"
"量子比特的单量子比特门）会加入该块；任何其他涉及这些量子比特的操作都会关闭该"
"块。在空闲量子比特上遇到的单量子比特门会被暂存，并吸收到之后在该量子比特上开"
"始的下一个块中。测量、屏障、噪声信道、带符号参数的门、三量子比特及以上的门以"
"及没有已知矩阵的门都作为块边界。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass:12
msgid ""
"A closed block whose CZ-equivalent cost (``cz``/``cx`` = 1, ``swap`` = 3, "
"other two-qubit gates = their KAK CZ count) is at least 2 is multiplied out "
"and resynthesized; the replacement is kept only if it has fewer CZ gates, or "
"the same number and fewer gates overall. Replacements use the ``{cz, h, rz, "
"x}`` gates by default; for a target the synthesis basis is picked from its "
"native gates "
"by :meth:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitBasis.from_gates` (``cz`` or "
"``cx`` as entangler, ``{rz, h, x}`` or ``{rz, sx, x}`` for the single-qubit "
"layers), with the same entangler counts. Routed ``SWAP`` gates (or their "
"three-CNOT expansion) adjacent to other gates on the same pair are therefore "
"absorbed into a single block of at most three entanglers."
msgstr ""
"对已关闭且 CZ 等价代价（``cz``/``cx`` = 1、``swap`` = 3，其他两比特门 = 其 "
"KAK CZ 数量）至少为 2 的块，将其相乘并重新综合；仅当替换结果的 CZ 门更少，或 "
"CZ 数量相同但总门数更少时才保留替换。替换默认使用 ``{cz, h, rz, x}`` 中的门；"
"给定目标时，综合基"
"由 :meth:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitBasis.from_gates` 从其原生门中"
"选出（纠缠门为 ``cz`` 或 ``cx``，单量子比特层为 ``{rz, h, x}`` 或 ``{rz, sx, "
"x}``），纠缠门数量相同。因此，路由插入的 ``SWAP`` 门（或其三 CNOT 展开）若与"
"同一量子比特对上的其他门相邻，会被吸收进一个至多含三个纠缠门的块。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass:25
msgid ""
"The sweep is linear in the circuit size (each block costs a constant amount "
"of ``4×4`` linear algebra)."
msgstr ""
"扫描的耗时与线路规模呈线性关系（每个块只需常数量的 ``4×4`` 线性代数运算）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass:28
msgid ""
"Optional compilation target. When it declares native gates, they must "
"contain a synthesis basis: ``cz`` or ``cx`` plus ``{rz, h, x}`` or ``{rz, "
"sx, x}``."
msgstr ""
"可选的编译目标。若其声明了原生门，则必须包含一个综合基：``cz`` 或 ``cx``，加"
"上 ``{rz, h, x}`` 或 ``{rz, sx, x}``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass:31
msgid ""
"Tolerance on Weyl coordinates used to detect when fewer CZ gates suffice."
msgstr "用于判断何时可以使用更少 CZ 门的 Weyl 坐标容差。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass:33
msgid ""
"If True (default), finish with a linear sweep that re-synthesizes every run "
"of two or more adjacent single-qubit gates on a wire as a ZXZ Euler sequence "
"when that is shorter (this merges the outer layers of neighbouring blocks)."
msgstr ""
"若为 True（默认），最后再做一次线性扫描：当更短时，把线上每段两个及以上相邻的"
"单量子比特门重新综合为 ZXZ 欧拉序列（这会合并相邻块的外层）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass:37
msgid "Explicit synthesis basis; overrides the one derived from ``target``."
msgstr "显式指定的综合基；覆盖由 ``target`` 推导出的基。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass:39
msgid ""
"Per-block approximation budget (default ``0``: exact).  When positive, a "
"block may be replaced by a circuit with fewer entanglers whose average gate "
"infidelity to the block is at most ``max_infidelity`` "
"(see :func:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_two_qubit_approx`); :attr:`ConsolidationStats.approximation_error` "
"then bounds the total change of the circuit."
msgstr ""
"每块的近似预算（默认 ``0``：精确）。为正时，块可被替换为纠缠门更少、与原块的"
"平均门不保真度至多为 ``max_infidelity`` 的线路"
"（见 :func:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_two_qubit_approx`）；此"
"时 :attr:`ConsolidationStats.approximation_error` 给出整条线路变化的上界。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass:46
msgid ""
"Approximations keep at most this many entanglers per block (default ``2``: "
"any reduction; ``0``: only blocks whose interaction is dropped entirely, "
"which removes a qubit-pair interaction from the circuit)."
msgstr ""
"近似后每块至多保留这么多纠缠门（默认 ``2``：任意减少；``0``：只近似相互作用被"
"整个丢掉的块，这会从线路中去掉一对比特之间的相互作用）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass:51
msgid ""
"If the target's native gate set contains no synthesis     basis, or "
"``max_infidelity`` is negative."
msgstr "目标原生门集中没有综合基，或 ``max_infidelity`` 为负时。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass.approximate_gates:1
msgid "Replace individual weak two-qubit gates by cheaper approximations."
msgstr "把单个弱两比特门替换为更便宜的近似。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass.approximate_gates:3
msgid ""
"Every parametrized two-qubit gate with a known matrix (``cp``, ``crz``, "
"``rzz``, ...) is resynthesized with fewer entanglers when that changes it by "
"at most the pass's ``max_infidelity`` (average gate infidelity); e.g. "
"``CP(θ)`` with ``θ²/20 ≤ max_infidelity`` becomes ``rz(θ/2) ⊗ rz(θ/2)``.  "
"Unlike :meth:`run`, no blocks are formed, so the rest of the circuit (and "
"its gate names) is left untouched.  :attr:`stats` is reset and records the "
"replaced gates as approximated blocks.  Without an approximation budget the "
"circuit is returned unchanged."
msgstr ""
"矩阵已知的每个含参两比特门（``cp``、``crz``、``rzz`` 等），若用更少纠缠门重综"
"合带来的变化至多为本 pass 的 ``max_infidelity``\\ （平均门不保真度），就做替"
"换；例如满足 ``θ²/20 ≤ max_infidelity`` 的 ``CP(θ)`` 变成 ``rz(θ/2) ⊗ rz(θ/"
"2)``。与 :meth:`run` 不同，这里不组块，线路其余部分（及门名）保持不"
"变。:attr:`stats` 会被重置，被替换的门记为近似块。没有近似预算时原样返回线"
"路。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass.approximate_gates:13
msgid "The circuit to approximate. It is not modified."
msgstr "要近似的线路，不会被修改。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass.approximate_gates:15
msgid "The approximated circuit (``circuit`` itself if nothing changed)."
msgstr "近似后的线路（若无变化则为 ``circuit`` 本身）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass.run:1
msgid "Consolidate and resynthesize two-qubit blocks of *circuit*."
msgstr "合并并重新综合 *circuit* 中的两比特块。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass.run:3
msgid "The circuit to optimize. It is not modified."
msgstr "待优化的线路。它不会被修改。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidateBlocksPass.run:5
msgid ""
"A new circuit, equivalent to *circuit* up to global phase, whose two-qubit "
"gate count is never larger than the input's."
msgstr ""
"一个新线路，在相差全局相位的意义下与 *circuit* 等价，且其两比特门数量绝不多于"
"输入线路。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidationStats:1
msgid ""
"Counters describing what the last :meth:`ConsolidateBlocksPass.run` did."
msgstr "描述上一次 :meth:`ConsolidateBlocksPass.run` 所做工作的计数器。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidationStats:5
msgid "Blocks with at least two CZ-equivalent gates."
msgstr "至少包含两个 CZ 等价门的块。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidationStats:11
#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit.ThreeQubitBlockStats:11
msgid "Blocks that were resynthesized."
msgstr "被重新综合的块。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidationStats:17
msgid "CZ-equivalent cost of the examined blocks."
msgstr "被检查块的 CZ 等价代价。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidationStats:23
msgid "CZ cost of the examined blocks after the pass."
msgstr "该 pass 执行后被检查块的 CZ 代价。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidationStats:29
msgid "Blocks replaced by an approximation (only with ``max_infidelity > 0``)."
msgstr "被近似替换的块数（仅当 ``max_infidelity > 0``）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidationStats:36
msgid ""
"Sum of the operator-norm distance bounds "
"(:attr:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.ApproximationError.distance`) of the "
"approximated blocks: the output differs from the input by at most this much "
"in operator norm, up to global phase (plus the ``1e-9`` element-wise "
"verification of the exact resyntheses)."
msgstr ""
"被近似块的算子范数距离上界"
"（:attr:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.ApproximationError.distance`）之和：输"
"出与输入在相差全局相位意义下的算子范数距离至多为此值（另加精确重综合 "
"``1e-9`` 的逐元素校验误差）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_consolidate.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._consolidate.ConsolidationStats:46
msgid "Largest average gate infidelity of an approximated block."
msgstr "被近似块的最大平均门不保真度。"

#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:152
msgid "Transpiler: Target Basis"
msgstr "Transpiler：目标门集"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_basis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._basis:1
msgid "Target-basis handling of :func:`~quspect.transpiler.transpile`."
msgstr ":func:`~quspect.transpiler.transpile` 对目标门集的处理。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_basis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._basis:3
msgid ""
"The optimizing pipeline (block resynthesis, three-qubit and Toffoli "
"templates, phase folding, mirror-gate costs, SABRE's cost estimates) works "
"in a *working basis* built around CZ: the target's single-qubit gates plus "
"``{cz, h, rz, x}``.  CZ, CX and every other CZ-class entangler differ only "
"by single-qubit gates, so all two-qubit counts computed there are exact for "
"any such target.  The last step, :func:`translate_to_target`, rewrites each "
"CZ into the target's entangler — for CX ``CZ(a, b) = H(b)·CX(a, b)·H(b)``, "
"the target qubit chosen per gate so that the Hadamards merge best into the "
"neighbouring single-qubit runs — and resynthesizes every touched single-"
"qubit run in the target's own single-qubit gates (e.g. ``{rz, sx, x}`` for "
"IBM devices).  The two-qubit count is therefore identical to the CZ-target "
"result; single-qubit runs stay at most one Euler sequence long."
msgstr ""
"优化流水线（块重综合、三比特与 Toffoli 模板、相位折叠、镜像门代价、SABRE 的代"
"价估计）在以 CZ 为中心的 *工作门集* 上进行：目标的单量子比特门加上 ``{cz, h, "
"rz, x}``。CZ、CX 以及其他所有 CZ 类纠缠门只相差单量子比特门，因此在其中算出的"
"所有两比特门数对任何此类目标都是精确的。最后一步 :func:`translate_to_target` "
"把每个 CZ 改写为目标的纠缠门——对 CX 为 ``CZ(a, b) = H(b)·CX(a, b)·H(b)``，目"
"标比特按门选择，使 Hadamard 与相邻单量子比特门段合并得最好——并把每个被改动的"
"单量子比特门段用目标自己的单量子比特门（例如 IBM 设备的 ``{rz, sx, x}``）重新"
"综合。因此两比特门数与 CZ 目标的结果相同；单量子比特门段至多是一个欧拉序列。"

