msgstr "把工作门集上的线路改写为目标的原生门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_basis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._basis.translate_to_target:3
msgid ""
"Every ``cz`` becomes the plan's entangler with its local dressing (for CX a "
"Hadamard on the target qubit, the target picked per gate so that the "
"Hadamards cancel or merge best with the adjacent single-qubit runs); every "
"single-qubit run that received a dressing or contains a non-native gate is "
"resynthesized with :func:`~quspect.gates.synthesis.synthesize_one_qubit` in "
"the target's single-qubit gates (verified to ``1e-9``, phase-aligned).  "
"Untouched native runs are kept as they are."
msgstr ""
"每个 ``cz`` 变为计划中的纠缠门及其局部修饰门（对 CX 为目标比特上的 Hadamard，"
"目标比特按门选择，使 Hadamard 与相邻单量子比特门段抵消或合并得最好）；每个收"
"到修饰门或含非原生门的单量子比特门段都"
"用 :func:`~quspect.gates.synthesis.synthesize_one_qubit` 在目标的单量子比特门"
"中重新综合（按相位对齐校验到 ``1e-9``）。未改动的原生门段保持原样。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_basis.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._basis.translate_to_target:12
