msgstr "若某个门既不能保留也无法翻译（例如带符号参数的非原生单量子比特门）。"

#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:158
msgid "Transpiler: Single-Qubit Minimization"
msgstr "转译器：单量子比特门最小化"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge:1
msgid "Single-qubit gate minimization around two-qubit gates (CX, CZ, …)."
msgstr "围绕两比特门（CX、CZ 等）的单量子比特门最小化。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge:3
msgid ""
"A rotation about an axis that commutes with a two-qubit gate on one of its "
"qubits can be moved through that gate: ``RZ`` through the control of a CX "
"(or either qubit of a CZ), ``RX`` through the target of a CX.  Moving a "
"rotation from the end of one single-qubit run to the start of the next "
"changes neither the unitary nor the two-qubit gates, only how the single-"
"qubit gates are distributed over the runs — and therefore how many gates "
"each run needs in the target's single-qubit basis.  In addition a CX can be "
"reversed, ``CX(a, b) = (H⊗H)·CX(b, a)·(H⊗H)``, the Hadamards being absorbed "
"into the four neighbouring runs."
msgstr ""
"若某个轴上的旋转在两比特门的某一个量子比特上与该门对易，就可以把它移过这个"
"门：``RZ`` 可穿过 CX 的控制比特（或 CZ 的任一比特），``RX`` 可穿过 CX 的目标"
"比特。把一个旋转从一段单量子比特门的末尾移到下一段的开头，既不改变酉矩阵也不"
"改变两比特门，只改变单量子比特门在各段之间的分布——因而改变每段在目标单量子比"
"特门集中所需的门数。此外 CX 可以反向，``CX(a, b) = (H⊗H)·CX(b, a)·(H⊗H)``，所"
"需的 Hadamard 被吸收进相邻的四段。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge:13
msgid ""
"The rotations commute with a gate *on one qubit*, independently of the other "
"qubit, so for fixed CX orientations the problem splits into one chain per "
"wire: runs ``R0, g1, R1, g2, …`` where each ``g`` lets a rotation about a "
"fixed axis (or none) through.  :func:`minimize_single_qubit_gates` solves "
"each chain with a small beam search over the rotation angle carried into the "
"next run (candidates: nothing, or the leading rotation of one of the run's "
"Euler decompositions about that axis), then improves the CX orientations by "
"local search (a reversal is kept when re-solving the runs next to it on both "
"wires, with the angles carried in and out fixed, scores better), and finally "
"resynthesizes every changed run in the target basis.  A wire's score is two "
"per single-qubit gate plus one per non-empty run, so a rotation is only "
"split off into a new run when that saves gates. Run lengths are scored with "
"a fast model of :func:`~quspect.gates.synthesis.synthesize_one_qubit`; the "
"emitted runs are synthesized and verified for real.  This generalizes "
"Qiskit's ``CommutativeCancellation`` + ``Optimize1qGatesDecomposition`` pair."
msgstr ""
"这些旋转只在 *一个量子比特上* 与门对易，与另一个比特无关，因此在 CX 朝向固定"
"时，问题分解为每条线上的一条链：门段 ``R0, g1, R1, g2, …``，其中每个 ``g`` 允"
"许绕某个固定轴的旋转（或不允许任何旋转）穿"
"过。:func:`minimize_single_qubit_gates` 对每条链在“带入下一段的旋转角”上做小"
"规模束搜索（候选：不带入，或该段绕此轴的某个欧拉分解的首个旋转），然后用局部"
"搜索改进 CX 朝向（在两条线上重新求解与该门相邻的门段、并固定带入 / 带出的角"
"度，若得分更优则保留反向），最后用目标门集重新综合所有改动过的门段。一条线的"
"得分为每个单量子比特门计 2 分、每个非空门段计 1 分，因此只有在能省门时才会把"
"旋转拆成新的门段。门段长度"
"用 :func:`~quspect.gates.synthesis.synthesize_one_qubit` 的快速模型计分；实际"
"输出的门段都真正综合并校验。这推广了 Qiskit 的 ``CommutativeCancellation`` + "
"``Optimize1qGatesDecomposition`` 组合。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge:30
msgid ""
"When the C++ extension is built, the search runs on native kernels "
"(environment variable ``QUSPECT_GAUGE_BACKEND``: ``auto``, ``native`` or "
"``python``): all wires advance layer by layer with the 2×2 products batched "
"in numpy, the orientation sweep evaluates every CX at once against the state "
"at the start of the sweep and commits the results in gate order (re-"
"evaluating the few gates next to an accepted reversal), and every kernel "
"reproduces the arithmetic of the Python search bit for bit, so both backends "
"return identical circuits."
msgstr ""
"C++ 扩展已构建时，搜索在原生内核上运行（环境变量 ``QUSPECT_GAUGE_BACKEND``："
"``auto``、``native`` 或 ``python``）：所有线逐层同时推进，2×2 矩阵乘法在 "
"numpy 中批量完成；朝向扫描以扫描开始时的状态一次性评估所有 CX，再按门的顺序提"
"交结果（被接受的反向附近的少数门重新评估）；每个内核都与 Python 搜索的运算逐"
"位一致，因此两种后端给出完全相同的线路。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge.minimize_single_qubit_gates:1
msgid "Minimize single-qubit gates around commuting / reversible 2q gates."
msgstr "在可对易 / 可反向的两比特门周围最小化单量子比特门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge.minimize_single_qubit_gates:3
msgid ""
"Rotations are moved through two-qubit gates they commute with (on one qubit) "
"and CX gates are reversed (``CX(a, b) = (H⊗H)·CX(b, a)·(H⊗H)``) where that "
"lowers the number of single-qubit gates needed in ``one_qubit``; changed "
"runs are resynthesized "
"with :func:`~quspect.gates.synthesis.synthesize_one_qubit` (verified to "
"``1e-9``, phase-aligned).  The two-qubit gates stay the same gates on the "
"same qubit pairs and in the same order.  The result never has more single-"
"qubit gates than the input."
msgstr ""
"在能减少 ``one_qubit`` 中所需单量子比特门数的地方，把旋转移过（在一个比特上）"
"与之对易的两比特门，并反向 CX 门（``CX(a, b) = (H⊗H)·CX(b, a)·(H⊗H)``）；改动"
"过的门段用 :func:`~quspect.gates.synthesis.synthesize_one_qubit` 重新综合（校"
"验到 ``1e-9``，相位对齐）。两比特门保持为相同量子比特对上的相同门，顺序不变。"
"结果的单量子比特门数从不多于输入。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge.minimize_single_qubit_gates:12
msgid ""
"With ``global_orientation`` the CX orientations are first chosen for the "
"whole circuit at once (:func:`orient_cx_gates`, a dual decomposition over "
"the wires) and the minimization is run from that orientation as well; the "
"result with fewer single-qubit gates is returned (the plain one on a tie).  "
"The local orientation search alone cannot leave a minimum where a whole "
"region has to be reversed together (e.g. ZZ interactions emitted in the X "
"frame)."
msgstr ""
"指定 ``global_orientation`` 时，先对整条线路一次性选定 CX 朝向"
"（:func:`orient_cx_gates`，按线做对偶分解），再从该朝向出发也做一遍最小化；返"
"回单量子比特门更少的结果（相同时返回普通结果）。仅靠局部朝向搜索无法离开需要"
"整片区域一起反向的局部极小（例如在 X 坐标系中发出的 ZZ 相互作用）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge.minimize_single_qubit_gates:20
msgid ""
"Circuit whose single-qubit gates have known matrices or are native (symbolic "
"gates are kept and block movement)."
msgstr ""
"单量子比特门矩阵已知或为原生门的线路（符号门保留不动，并阻止旋转穿过）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge.minimize_single_qubit_gates:23
msgid ""
"Also start from the globally chosen CX orientation (needs the C++ extension "
"and an ``rz`` basis with ``h`` or ``sx``; ignored otherwise)."
msgstr ""
"同时从全局选定的 CX 朝向出发（需要 C++ 扩展，且门集为含 ``h`` 或 ``sx`` 的 "
"``rz`` 门集；否则忽略）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge.minimize_single_qubit_gates:27
msgid "An equivalent circuit (up to global phase)."
msgstr "等价的线路（相差全局相位）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge.orient_cx_gates:1
msgid "Choose the orientation of every CX for the whole circuit at once."
msgstr "对整条线路一次性选定每个 CX 的朝向。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge.orient_cx_gates:3
msgid ""
"``CX(a, b) = (H⊗H)·CX(b, a)·(H⊗H)``: each CX can be reversed, the Hadamards "
"joining the four single-qubit runs around it.  With one binary variable per "
"CX, the single-qubit cost of a wire depends only on the orientations of the "
"CX gates on that wire (and on the rotations moved through them: ``RZ`` "
"through a control, ``RX`` through a target), so the total is a sum of chain "
"problems in which every CX appears on exactly two chains.  The orientations "
"are found by *dual decomposition*: every CX variable is duplicated, each "
"wire's chain is solved by dynamic programming (orientation × beam of moved "
"rotation angles, the run cost of :func:`minimize_single_qubit_gates`) under "
"Lagrange multipliers that price the disagreement of the two copies, and the "
"multipliers follow a subgradient (Polyak) step.  Every iteration turns both "
"copies into a primal orientation; the cheapest is kept (never worse than the "
"input orientation)."
msgstr ""
"``CX(a, b) = (H⊗H)·CX(b, a)·(H⊗H)``：每个 CX 都可以反向，Hadamard 并入其周围"
"的四个单量子比特门段。每个 CX 一个二值变量时，一条线上的单量子比特门代价只依"
"赖这条线上 CX 的朝向（以及穿过它们推移的旋转：``RZ`` 穿过控制比特，``RX`` 穿"
"过目标比特），因此总代价是若干条链问题之和，且每个 CX 恰好出现在两条链上。朝"
"向由\\ *对偶分解*\\ 求得：每个 CX 变量复制成两份，每条线的链在给两份副本的分"
"歧定价的 Lagrange 乘子下用动态规划求解（朝向 × 推移旋转角的束，门段代价"
"与 :func:`minimize_single_qubit_gates` 相同），乘子按次梯度（Polyak）步长更"
"新。每次迭代都把两份副本变成原问题的朝向，保留代价最低者（不会比输入朝向更"
"差）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge.orient_cx_gates:18
msgid ""
"The returned circuit has the chosen CX gates reversed with explicit ``h`` "
"gates around them (the same unitary); it is meant as the start "
"of :func:`minimize_single_qubit_gates`, which merges the Hadamards."
msgstr ""
"返回的线路把选中的 CX 反向，并在其两侧写出显式的 ``h`` 门（酉矩阵不变）；它用"
"作 :func:`minimize_single_qubit_gates` 的起点，由后者合并这些 Hadamard。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge.orient_cx_gates:22
msgid "A circuit of ``cx`` gates and single-qubit gates with known matrices."
msgstr "由 ``cx`` 门与矩阵已知的单量子比特门组成的线路。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge.orient_cx_gates:24
msgid "The target's single-qubit gate names (the cost model)."
msgstr "目标的单量子比特门名（代价模型）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge.orient_cx_gates:25
msgid "Maximum number of subgradient iterations."
msgstr "次梯度迭代的最大次数。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_gauge.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._gauge.orient_cx_gates:27
msgid ""
"The re-oriented circuit, or ``circuit`` itself when nothing is reversed or "
"the circuit / basis is not supported (other gates, no C++ extension, a basis "
"without ``rz`` and ``h`` / ``sx``)."
msgstr ""
"重新定向后的线路；若没有任何 CX 反向，或线路 / 门集不受支持（含其他门、没有 "
"C++ 扩展、门集不含 ``rz`` 和 ``h`` / ``sx``），则返回 ``circuit`` 本身。"

#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:164
msgid "Transpiler: SWAP-Face Blocks"
msgstr "转译器：SWAP 面上的块"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_swap_face.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._swap_face:1
msgid "Late resynthesis of SWAP-face two-qubit blocks."
msgstr "SWAP 面上两比特块的后期重综合。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_swap_face.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._swap_face:3
msgid ""
"Routing fuses SWAPs into the neighbouring two-qubit interactions; the fused "
"blocks sit on the SWAP face ``a = b = π/4`` of the Weyl chamber (``SWAP·exp(-"
"iθ/2·ZZ)`` up to single-qubit gates).  The generic 3-entangler KAK template "
"writes them with two general inner rotations, while ``SWAP·exp(-iθ/2·ZZ) = "
"CX·CX'·Rz(θ)·CX`` needs a single inner ``rz``."
msgstr ""
"路由会把 SWAP 并进相邻的两比特相互作用；融合后的块位于 Weyl 室的 SWAP 面 ``a "
"= b = π/4`` 上（在单量子比特门意义下为 ``SWAP·exp(-iθ/2·ZZ)``）。通用的三纠缠"
"门 KAK 模板用两个一般的内层旋转写出它们，而 ``SWAP·exp(-iθ/2·ZZ) = "
"CX·CX'·Rz(θ)·CX`` 只需要一个内层 ``rz``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_swap_face.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._swap_face:9
msgid ""
"The pipeline keeps the generic template (its final CX cancellation sometimes "
"finds more pairs on it).  :func:`resynthesize_swap_face_blocks` rewrites the "
"SWAP-face blocks of the *final* circuit: every maximal block of exactly "
"three entanglers on one qubit pair (only single-qubit gates on the pair in "
"between) whose unitary is on the SWAP face is resynthesized "
"with :func:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_swap_face_block`.  The "
"entanglers stay three per block, on the same pairs; the outer single-qubit "
"layers are left for the single-qubit minimization to merge.  From level 2 "
"on :func:`~quspect.transpiler.transpile` finishes three versions of the "
"selected routing — as is, rewritten here, and its post-routing pipeline "
"rerun under :func:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.swap_face_templates` (if "
"that has no more two-qubit gates) — and keeps the best by (two-qubit gates, "
"depth, two-qubit depth, gates)."
msgstr ""
"流水线保留通用模板（最后的 CX 抵消在它上面有时能找到更多的门"
"对）。:func:`resynthesize_swap_face_blocks` 改写\\ *最终*\\ 线路中 SWAP 面上"
"的块：每个恰含三个纠缠门、位于同一对比特上（其间这对比特上只有单量子比特"
"门）、酉矩阵位于 SWAP 面上的极大块，都"
"用 :func:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.synthesize_swap_face_block` 重新综合。"
"每个块仍是三个纠缠门、位于同一对比特上；外层单量子比特门留给单量子比特门最小"
"化去合并。从第 2 级起，:func:`~quspect.transpiler.transpile` 对选中的路由完成"
"三个版本——原样、在此改写、以及"
"在 :func:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.swap_face_templates` 下重跑路由后流程"
"（若其两比特门不更多）——按（两比特门数、深度、两比特门深度、门数）取最优。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_swap_face.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._swap_face.resynthesize_swap_face_blocks:1
msgid "Rewrite the 3-entangler SWAP-face blocks with the SWAP-shaped template."
msgstr "用 SWAP 形模板改写三纠缠门的 SWAP 面块。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_swap_face.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._swap_face.resynthesize_swap_face_blocks:3
msgid "A circuit in the target's native gates."
msgstr "目标原生门上的线路。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_swap_face.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._swap_face.resynthesize_swap_face_blocks:4
msgid ""
"The target's native gate names (they choose the synthesis basis, "
"see :meth:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitBasis.from_gates`)."
msgstr ""
"目标的原生门名（据此选择综合门集，"
"见 :meth:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.TwoQubitBasis.from_gates`）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_swap_face.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._swap_face.resynthesize_swap_face_blocks:7
msgid ""
"An equivalent circuit (up to global phase) with the same entanglers on the "
"same pairs (and in the same number), or ``circuit`` itself when no block was "
"rewritten."
msgstr ""
"等价的线路（相差全局相位），纠缠门位于相同的比特对上（且数量相同）；若没有改"
"写任何块，则返回 ``circuit`` 本身。"

#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:170
msgid "Transpiler: Depth-Oriented Scheduling"
msgstr "Transpiler：面向深度的调度"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule:1
msgid ""
"Depth-oriented rescheduling of commuting gates (trace-monoid list "
"scheduling)."
msgstr "面向深度的对易门重排（迹幺半群上的列表调度）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule:3
msgid ""
"Two gates *commute on a qubit* when both are rotations about the same Pauli "
"axis there — diagonal gates (``rz``, ``s``, ``t``, ``cz``, the control of a "
"``cx``…) about Z, ``x``/``sx``/``rx`` and the target of a ``cx`` about X.  "
"An operator that commutes with ``P`` on qubit ``q`` lies in the algebra "
"spanned by ``{I, P}`` on ``q`` (tensored with anything elsewhere), so two "
"gates whose axes agree on *every* qubit they share commute exactly.  "
"Reordering a gate sequence while keeping the relative order of every non-"
"commuting pair gives the same unitary: the circuit is a word in a *trace "
"monoid* (Cartier–Foata, Mazurkiewicz) and every linear extension of its "
"dependence order is an equivalent circuit."
msgstr ""
"两个门在某个比特上 *对易*，当它们在该比特上都是绕同一 Pauli 轴的旋转——对角门"
"（``rz``、``s``、``t``、``cz``、``cx`` 的控制位……）绕 Z，``x``/``sx``/``rx`` "
"与 ``cx`` 的目标位绕 X。在比特 ``q`` 上与 ``P`` 对易的算符属于 ``q`` 上由 "
"``{I, P}`` 张成的代数（与其他比特上的任意算符作张量积），因此在 *所有* 共享比"
"特上轴都一致的两个门严格对易。重排门序列时只要保持每一对不对易门的相对顺序，"
"酉矩阵就不变：线路是 *迹幺半群*\\ （Cartier–Foata、Mazurkiewicz）中的一个字，"
"其依赖序的每个线性扩展都是等价线路。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule:14
msgid ""
"On each qubit the gates therefore fall into *commutation groups* — maximal "
"runs of consecutive gates with the same axis (a gate with no axis is a group "
"of its own).  Members of a group may run in any order, each group starts "
"after the previous one on that qubit has finished, and two gates sharing a "
"qubit never run in the same layer.  Minimizing the depth over all equivalent "
"orders is a resource-constrained project scheduling problem (RCPSP) with "
"unit-time jobs and dedicated resources (the qubits); for one group of "
"mutually commuting two-qubit gates it reduces to edge-colouring their "
"interaction graph (Vizing: Δ or Δ + 1 layers)."
msgstr ""
"因此每个比特上的门分成若干 *对易组*\\ ——轴相同的极大连续门段（没有轴的门单独"
"成组）。组内成员可任意排序，每组须在该比特上前一组全部完成后才开始，共享比特"
"的两个门不能在同一层。在所有等价顺序中最小化深度是一个资源受限项目调度问题"
"（RCPSP），作业为单位时长、资源（比特）专用；对一组相互对易的两比特门，它退化"
"为其相互作用图的边着色（Vizing：Δ 或 Δ + 1 层）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule:24
msgid ""
":func:`schedule_for_depth` solves it heuristically with the classic RCPSP "
"machinery:"
msgstr ":func:`schedule_for_depth` 用经典的 RCPSP 方法启发式求解："

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule:27
msgid ""
"a *serial schedule-generation scheme* with insertion: gates are taken by "
"priority among those whose predecessors are scheduled, and each is put in "
"the earliest layer at or after its predecessors where all its qubits are "
"free (gaps left earlier can be filled later);"
msgstr ""
"带插入的 *串行调度生成方案*：在前驱都已排定的门中按优先级选取，每个门放在不早"
"于其前驱、且其所有比特都空闲的最早一层（之前留下的空隙之后可以填上）；"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule:31
msgid ""
"critical-path priorities (Hu's bottom levels, extended by a per-qubit "
"resource bound for the groups);"
msgstr "关键路径优先级（Hu 的底层值，并对组加上逐比特的资源下界）；"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule:33
msgid ""
"*double justification* (Valls, Ballestín & Quintanilla 2005): the schedule "
"is shifted right (scheduling the reversed circuit by latest finish time) and "
"then left again (by earliest start time), which never lengthens it and "
"usually closes gaps."
msgstr ""
"*双向调整*\\ （double justification，Valls、Ballestín 与 Quintanilla 2005）："
"先把调度右移（按最晚完成时间调度反向线路），再左移（按最早开始时间），这不会"
"使调度变长，通常还能消除空隙。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule:38
msgid ""
"Total depth and two-qubit depth are different objectives (a long single-"
"qubit run on one qubit may be better placed where it delays a two-qubit "
"gate).  Three schedules are built — one for total depth, one that keeps the "
"per-qubit order of the two-qubit gates (so the two-qubit depth is unchanged, "
"since it only depends on that order) and one that first minimizes the two-"
"qubit depth (single-qubit gates taking no time) and then the total depth "
"with that two-qubit order fixed.  The result is the one with the smallest "
"depth among those whose two-qubit depth does not exceed the input's.  Only "
"the order of the instructions changes: the gates, their count and the "
"unitary are exactly those of the input."
msgstr ""
"总深度与两比特门深度是不同的目标（某比特上一长段单比特门，放在会推迟某个两比"
"特门的位置反而可能更好）。共构造三种调度——一种针对总深度；一种保持每个比特上"
"两比特门的顺序（两比特门深度只取决于这一顺序，因此不变）；一种先最小化两比特"
"门深度（单比特门不占时间），再在固定该两比特门顺序的前提下最小化总深度。结果"
"取两比特门深度不超过输入者中深度最小的一个。改变的只有指令顺序：门、门数和酉"
"矩阵都与输入完全相同。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule:49
msgid ""
"Commutation is also used one level up: a maximal two-qubit block (the gates "
"on one pair with the single-qubit gates between them) gets, on each of its "
"qubits, the Pauli axis its 4×4 unitary commutes with, and the blocks are "
"scheduled like gates.  ``cx·rz·cx`` (a ZZ rotation) is diagonal, so a chain "
"of ZZ rotations — sequential gate by gate, because CX targets do not commute "
"with CX controls — becomes two layers of blocks (an edge-colouring of the "
"chain)."
msgstr ""
"对易关系还在高一层上使用：极大两比特块（同一比特对上的门及其间的单比特门）在"
"其每个比特上取其 4×4 酉矩阵与之对易的 Pauli 轴，块像门一样参与调度。"
"``cx·rz·cx``\\ （一个 ZZ 旋转）是对角的，因此一串 ZZ 旋转——逐门看是串行的，因"
"为 CX 目标位与 CX 控制位不对易——变成两层块（对这条链的边着色）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule.schedule_for_depth:1
msgid "Reorder commuting gates to minimize the depth of a circuit."
msgstr "按对易关系重排门，使线路深度最小。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule.schedule_for_depth:3
msgid ""
"Gates that act on disjoint qubits, or that are rotations about the same "
"Pauli axis on every qubit they share (diagonal gates and CX controls about "
"Z; ``x``, ``sx``, ``rx`` and CX targets about X), may be swapped; every "
"other pair keeps its order (measurements, barriers and channels commute with "
"nothing on their qubits and classical bits).  Among the equivalent orders a "
"list scheduler with double justification (see the module docstring) picks "
"one with the smallest depth whose two-qubit depth is not larger than the "
"input's."
msgstr ""
"作用在不相交比特上的门，或在所有共享比特上都是绕同一 Pauli 轴旋转的门（对角门"
"与 CX 控制位绕 Z；``x``、``sx``、``rx`` 与 CX 目标位绕 X）可以交换；其余每对"
"门保持原顺序（测量、屏障与信道在其比特和经典比特上与任何门都不对易）。列表调"
"度器加双向调整（见模块说明）在所有等价顺序中选出两比特门深度不超过输入、且深"
"度最小的一个。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule.schedule_for_depth:12
msgid ""
"With ``blocks`` the same scheduler also runs one level up, on the maximal "
"two-qubit blocks (the gates on one pair with the single-qubit gates between "
"them): a block whose unitary commutes with a Pauli on one of its qubits gets "
"that axis there, so e.g. ``cx·rz·cx`` (a ZZ rotation) commutes with every "
"diagonal gate or block on either qubit although its CX gates do not.  The "
"block order is then refined on the gate level, and the better of the two "
"results is kept."
msgstr ""
"``blocks`` 为真时，同一调度器还在高一层上运行，即在极大两比特块（同一比特对上"
"的门及其间的单比特门）上：若块的酉矩阵在某个比特上与某个 Pauli 对易，该比特上"
"就取这个轴，例如 ``cx·rz·cx``\\ （一个 ZZ 旋转）与两个比特上的任何对角门或对"
"角块都对易，尽管其中的 CX 门并不对易。块的顺序随后再在门的层面上细化，取两种"
"结果中更好的一个。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule.schedule_for_depth:20
msgid ""
"The gates themselves are unchanged, so the result is exactly equivalent and "
"has the same gate counts; if no order is better, ``circuit`` is returned as "
"is."
msgstr ""
"门本身不变，因此结果严格等价、门数相同；若没有更好的顺序，原样返回 "
"``circuit``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule.schedule_for_depth:24
msgid "Any circuit."
msgstr "任意线路。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule.schedule_for_depth:25
msgid "Also reorder whole two-qubit blocks (see above)."
msgstr "同时重排整个两比特块（见上）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule.schedule_for_depth:27
msgid ""
"A circuit with the same instructions in a possibly different order, with "
"``(depth, two-qubit depth)`` lexicographically no larger."
msgstr ""
"指令相同、顺序可能不同的线路，其 ``(深度, 两比特门深度)`` 按字典序不更大。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule.schedule_for_depth:37
msgid ""
"``cx(0, 3)`` commutes with ``cx(0, 1)`` and ``rz(0)`` (all diagonal on qubit "
"0) and now runs next to ``cx(1, 2)``: depth 4 → 3.  On the block level, two "
"ZZ rotations sharing a qubit commute:"
msgstr ""
"``cx(0, 3)`` 与 ``cx(0, 1)``、``rz(0)`` 对易（在比特 0 上都是对角的），现在"
"与 ``cx(1, 2)`` 并行：深度 4 → 3。在块的层面上，共享一个比特的两个 ZZ 旋转对"
"易："

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_schedule.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._schedule.schedule_for_depth:47
msgid "``ZZ(3, 2)`` now runs next to ``ZZ(0, 1)``: depth 9 → 6."
msgstr "``ZZ(3, 2)`` 现在与 ``ZZ(0, 1)`` 并行：深度 9 → 6。"

#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:176
msgid "Transpiler: One-Call Transpile"
msgstr "Transpiler：一键编译"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile:1
msgid ""
"One-call, quality-first ``transpile()`` built from the transpiler passes."
msgstr "由各编译 pass 组装、以质量优先的一键 ``transpile()``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile:3
msgid "The pipeline for ``optimization_level=2`` (the default) is::"
msgstr "``optimization_level=2``\\ （默认）时的流水线为::"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile:12
msgid ""
"Before routing, three-qubit blocks are resynthesized when a Shannon "
"decomposition is cheaper (e.g. the repeated controlled-``U`` of phase "
"estimation collapse to at most 10 two-qubit gates each), diagonal rotations "
"on the same parity are merged on the CX level (phase folding, which also "
"unlocks CX cancellations), and SABRE absorbs the SWAP part of two-qubit "
"blocks ``U`` with a cheaper ``SWAP · U`` into the output permutation.  All "
"rewrites are exact up to global phase."
msgstr ""
"在路由之前，若 Shannon 分解更便宜，则对三比特块进行重综合（例如相位估计中重复"
"的受控 ``U`` 每个至多折叠为 10 个双比特门）；在 CX 层面合并作用于同一奇偶性的"
"对角旋转（相位折叠，它还能促成 CX 抵消）；并且对于存在更便宜的 ``SWAP · U`` "
"的双比特块 ``U``，SABRE 会把其中的 SWAP 部分吸收进输出置换。所有改写在相差全"
"局相位的意义下都是精确的。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile:20
msgid ""
"From level 2 on SABRE routes on whole two-qubit blocks (consecutive gates on "
"one pair form a single routing node, so the lookahead counts blocks, as when "
"routing consolidated ``unitary`` blocks) and is mirror-gate aware (MIRAGE): "
"after the last gate of a block ``U`` it may insert a SWAP on the same pair, "
"which the post-routing consolidation merges into ``U · SWAP`` — free for a "
"generic SU(4) block."
msgstr ""
"从第 2 级起，SABRE 按整个两比特块路由（同一比特对上的连续门构成单个路由节点，"
"因此前瞻按块计数，与路由合并后的 ``unitary`` 块时一致），并且感知镜像门"
"（MIRAGE）：在块 ``U`` 的最后一个门之后，它可以在同一比特对上插入一个 SWAP，"
"路由后的合并会把它并入 ``U · SWAP``——对通用 SU(4) 块不增加代价。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile:27
msgid ""
"Toffolis are kept through the pre-routing decomposition: SABRE routes each "
"``ccx`` as a three-qubit unit and synthesizes it for the coupling it lands "
"on (six CX on a triangle, eight nearest-neighbour CX on a path), which is "
"much cheaper than routing its fifteen-gate textbook decomposition."
msgstr ""
"路由前的分解保留 Toffoli：SABRE 把每个 ``ccx`` 当作三比特单元路由，并按其最终"
"所在的耦合结构综合（三角形上 6 个 CX，路径上 8 个最近邻 CX），这比路由其 15 "
"门的教科书分解便宜得多。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile:32
msgid ""
"Level 3 replaces the single SABRE result by a candidate search: SABRE routes "
"the circuit many ways (layout trials × routing seeds, "
"see :meth:`SABRE.route_candidates`), the candidates are ranked by a cheap "
"estimate of their two-qubit count after block resynthesis, the best few "
"(plus the one level 2 would use) go through the full post-routing pipeline, "
"and the winner is chosen by ``(two-qubit gates, two-qubit depth, total "
"gates)``.  A second candidate family routes the CX-level circuit (``cx``, "
"``cp``, ``crz``, ``rzz`` kept whole) on a commutation-aware DAG with a bonus "
"for SWAPs that merge with the gate just executed on their pair; this is what "
"turns QAOA-like and CX-ladder circuits into swap-network-like routings.  A "
"third family routes on block nodes without mirror gates (mirror decisions "
"are greedy and occasionally hurt, e.g. 2-D Trotter circuits on a line); all "
"families are merged by estimated two-qubit count.  Because the level-2 "
"routing is always among the fully evaluated candidates, level 3 never "
"produces more two-qubit gates than level 2 for the same seed."
msgstr ""
"第 3 级把单一的 SABRE 结果换成候选搜索：SABRE 以多种方式路由线路（布局试验 × "
"路由种子，见 :meth:`SABRE.route_candidates`），按块重综合后双比特门数的廉价估"
"计给候选排序，排名最前的少数候选（加上第 2 级会使用的那个）经过完整的路由后优"
"化流水线，再按 ``(双比特门数, 双比特深度, 总门数)`` 选出最优者。第二类候选在"
"对易感知的 DAG 上路由 CX 层面的线路（``cx``、``cp``、``crz``、``rzz`` 保持完"
"整），并对能与其比特对上刚执行的门合并的 SWAP 给予奖励；正是这一点让类 QAOA "
"线路和 CX 阶梯线路得到类似交换网络（swap network）的路由。第三类候选在不使用"
"镜像门的块节点上路由（镜像决策是贪心的，偶尔有害，例如直线拓扑上的二维 "
"Trotter 线路）；所有候选族按估计双比特门数合并。由于第 2 级的路由结果总在完整"
"评估的候选之中，相同种子下第 3 级的双比特门数绝不会多于第 2 级。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile:49
msgid ""
"From level 2 on the selected routings are refined by a large-neighbourhood "
"search: windows of consecutive SWAPs are re-routed exactly (A* with an "
"admissible bound, see :mod:`quspect.transpiler._route_lns`) and replaced "
"when the SWAP cost, counting SWAPs merged into neighbouring blocks at their "
"mirror cost, drops; equally cheap but shallower windows are offered as "
"additional candidates.  Circuits made of generic SU(4) blocks are also "
"routed layer by layer on paths and rings, and by a truncated rollout of "
"SABRE's greedy policy on other coupling graphs "
"(:mod:`quspect.transpiler._layer_route`)."
msgstr ""
"从第 2 级起，选中的路由还要经过大邻域搜索的精炼：连续若干个 SWAP 组成的窗口被"
"精确地重新路由（带可采纳下界的 A*，"
"见 :mod:`quspect.transpiler._route_lns`），若 SWAP 代价（与相邻块合并的 SWAP "
"按其镜像代价计）下降就替换；代价相同但更浅的窗口作为额外候选提供。由一般 "
"SU(4) 块组成的线路在路径和环上还会逐层路由，在其他耦合图上还会用 SABRE 贪心策"
"略的截断 rollout 路由（:mod:`quspect.transpiler._layer_route`）。"

