msgstr ""
"所用的每操作近似预算（平均门不保真度，见 :func:`transpile` 的 "
"``approximation_degree``；``0.0`` 表示不做有意近似）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileStats:102
msgid ""
"Gates and two-qubit blocks replaced by an approximation with fewer two-qubit "
"gates."
msgstr "被替换为双比特门更少的近似的门与两比特块的数量。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileStats:109
msgid ""
"Upper bound on the operator-norm distance, up to global phase, between the "
"output and the input caused by these approximations (the sum of their "
"individual distances). The output's process infidelity with the input is at "
"most ``approximation_error²`` plus the numerical error of the exact rewrites "
"(each verified to ``1e-9`` element-wise)."
msgstr ""
"这些近似导致的输出与输入之间（相差全局相位）算子范数距离的上界（各近似距离之"
"和）。输出相对输入的过程不保真度至多为 ``approximation_error²``，再加上精确改"
"写的数值误差（每次按 ``1e-9`` 逐元素校验）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:1
msgid "Output of :func:`transpile`."
msgstr ":func:`transpile` 的输出。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:3
msgid "Two equivalent views of the compiled circuit are provided:"
msgstr "提供编译后电路的两种等价视图："

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:5
msgid ""
"``circuit`` is in **physical-qubit space**: qubit index = physical qubit of "
"the target, and every two-qubit gate acts on a coupling edge.  Logical qubit "
"``q`` of the input starts on physical ``initial_layout[q]`` and ends on "
"physical ``final_layout[q]``."
msgstr ""
"``circuit`` 位于**物理比特空间**：比特编号即目标设备的物理比特，每个双比特门"
"都作用在耦合边上。输入的逻辑比特 ``q`` 开始时位于物理比特 "
"``initial_layout[q]``，结束时位于物理比特 ``final_layout[q]``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:9
msgid ""
"``wire_circuit`` is in SABRE's **wire space**: wire ``w`` is pinned to "
"physical ``wire_layout[w]`` (logical wires first, then workspace wires "
"borrowed by routing), as returned by :meth:`SABRE.solve`. ``circuit`` is "
"``wire_circuit`` with wire ``w`` renamed to ``wire_layout[w]``."
msgstr ""
"``wire_circuit`` 位于 SABRE 的**线空间**：线 ``w`` 固定在物理比特 "
"``wire_layout[w]`` 上（先是逻辑线，然后是路由借用的工作线），"
"与 :meth:`SABRE.solve` 的返回值相同。把 ``wire_circuit`` 的线 ``w`` 重命名为 "
"``wire_layout[w]`` 即得到 ``circuit``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:15
msgid ""
"Semantics: applying ``circuit`` to a state where logical qubit ``q`` sits on "
"physical ``initial_layout[q]`` (other physical qubits in ``|0⟩``) equals "
"applying the input circuit and then moving logical ``q`` to physical "
"``final_layout[q]``, up to global phase."
msgstr ""
"语义：在逻辑比特 ``q`` 位于物理比特 ``initial_layout[q]``\\ （其他物理比特为 "
"``|0⟩``）的状态上执行 ``circuit``，等价于执行输入电路后再把逻辑比特 ``q`` 移"
"到物理比特 ``final_layout[q]``，相差一个全局相位。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:22
msgid "Compiled circuit indexed by physical qubits."
msgstr "按物理比特编号的编译后电路。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.RoutingCandidate:13
#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:24
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:42
msgid "QuantumCircuit"
msgstr "QuantumCircuit"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:28
msgid "``initial_layout[logical] = physical`` at the start."
msgstr "开始时的 ``initial_layout[logical] = physical``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.RoutingCandidate:21
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.RoutingCandidate:29
#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns.ExactRouting:45
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns.RefinedRouting:7
#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:30
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:36
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:49
msgid "list[int]"
msgstr "list[int]"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:34
msgid "``final_layout[logical] = physical`` at the end."
msgstr "结束时的 ``final_layout[logical] = physical``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:40
msgid "Compiled circuit in wire space."
msgstr "线空间中的编译后电路。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:46
msgid "``wire_layout[wire] = physical`` (length ≥ number of logical qubits)."
msgstr "``wire_layout[wire] = physical``\\ （长度 ≥ 逻辑比特数）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:53
msgid "Run statistics."
msgstr "运行统计信息。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.TranspileResult:55
msgid "TranspileStats"
msgstr "TranspileStats"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:1
msgid "Compile a circuit to a target's gate set and coupling graph."
msgstr "把电路编译到目标设备的门集与耦合图。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:3
msgid "Optimization levels:"
msgstr "优化级别："

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:5
msgid "``0``: decompose → SABRE → decompose.  No optimization."
msgstr "``0``：分解 → SABRE → 分解。不做优化。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:6
msgid ""
"``1``: :class:`HighLevelOptimizePass` (cancel self-inverse ``ccx``/``cx``/"
"``cz``/``swap`` pairs) → decompose → consolidate two-qubit blocks → SABRE → "
"decompose → consolidate → decompose (no DAG optimization; fast).  From this "
"level on SABRE's layout search also starts from a low-dilation embedding of "
"the interaction graph (see ``dilation_layouts`` "
"of :class:`~quspect.transpiler.SABRE`), which routes e.g. a 50-qubit CX "
"chain on a 57-qubit heavy-hex lattice with one SWAP."
msgstr ""
"``1``：:class:`HighLevelOptimizePass` （消去自逆的 ``ccx``/``cx``/``cz``/"
"``swap`` 门对）→ 分解 → 合并双比特块 → SABRE → 分解 → 合并 → 分解（不做 DAG "
"优化，速度快）。从这一级开始，SABRE 的布局搜索还会从交互图的低伸缩嵌入出发"
"（见 :class:`~quspect.transpiler.SABRE` 的 ``dilation_layouts``），例如 57 比"
"特 heavy-hex 晶格上的 50 比特 CX 链只需一个 SWAP。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:14
msgid ""
"``2`` (default): level 1 plus, before routing, :class:`ThreeQubitBlockPass` "
"(Shannon resynthesis of three-qubit blocks), :class:`PhaseFoldingPass` on "
"the CX level followed by another :class:`HighLevelOptimizePass`, and "
"permutation-aware block synthesis and mirror-gate-aware block routing in "
"SABRE; after routing :class:`OptimizePass` and another consolidate/decompose "
"sweep.  When the pre-routing approximation (see ``approximation_degree``) "
"changed the circuit, the exact circuit is routed as well and the routing "
"with the smaller estimated routing overhead is kept (both are fully "
"optimized and compared when the estimates are within 10 %); "
"``stats.selected`` is then ``\"exact-routing\"``.  The three-qubit and "
"folding passes need declared native gates."
msgstr ""
"``2``\\ （默认）：在第 1 级基础上，于路由前加"
"入 :class:`ThreeQubitBlockPass`\\ （三比特块的 Shannon 重综合）、CX 层面"
"的 :class:`PhaseFoldingPass` 及其后的又一次 :class:`HighLevelOptimizePass`，"
"以及 SABRE 中的置换感知块综合与镜像门感知的块路由；路由后加"
"入 :class:`OptimizePass` 以及又一轮合并/分解。若路由前的近似（见 "
"``approximation_degree``）改变了线路，精确线路也会路由一次，保留估计路由开销"
"较小的那个路由（两者估计相差不超过 10% 时都做完整优化后再比较）；选中精确线路"
"时 ``stats.selected`` 为 ``\"exact-routing\"``。三比特 pass 与相位折叠 pass "
"需要已声明的原生门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:27
msgid ""
"``3``: level 2 with a candidate search over many SABRE routings (layout "
"trials × routing seeds, plus commutation-aware routings of the CX-level "
"circuit with a SWAP-fusion bonus, and block routings without mirror gates) "
"and selection by the final ``(two-qubit gates, two-qubit depth, total "
"gates)``.  Never worse than level 2 in two-qubit count for the same ``seed``."
msgstr ""
"``3``：在第 2 级基础上，对多个 SABRE 路由结果（布局试验 × 路由种子，外加对 "
"CX 层面线路、带 SWAP 融合奖励的对易感知路由，以及不使用镜像门的块路由）做候选"
"搜索，并按最终的 ``(双比特门数, 双比特深度, 总门数)`` 选优。相同 ``seed`` 下"
"双比特门数绝不多于第 2 级。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:34
msgid ""
"From level 2 on the routing is refined by a large-neighbourhood search "
"(:mod:`quspect.transpiler._route_lns`): windows of 1–4 consecutive SWAPs are "
"re-routed exactly by A* with their entry layout and the exit positions of "
"the qubits used later fixed, and replaced when the merged SWAP cost drops.  "
"Level 2 keeps the better of the original and the refined routing after the "
"post-routing pipeline (very large circuits are not refined at level 2); "
"level 3 refines every fully evaluated candidate this way, the best one also "
"with windows of 6, 8 and 12 SWAPs, and evaluates the refinements alongside "
"the originals (large non-default candidates are replaced by their "
"refinement)."
msgstr ""
"从第 2 级起，路由还要经过大邻域搜索的精炼"
"（:mod:`quspect.transpiler._route_lns`）：由 1–4 个连续 SWAP 组成的窗口在固定"
"入口布局与之后仍要用到的比特的出口位置的前提下，用 A* 精确地重新路由，合并感"
"知的 SWAP 代价下降时替换。第 2 级在路由后流程之后保留原路由与精炼路由中更好的"
"一个（第 2 级不精炼极大的线路）；第 3 级对每个完整评估的候选都这样精炼，估计"
"最好的一个还用 6、8、12 个 SWAP 的窗口再精炼一次，精炼结果与原候选一起评估"
"（较大的非默认候选由其精炼结果代替）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:45
msgid ""
"Depth is the secondary objective of the search: equal-cost depth sweeps "
"(``lnsd/`` candidates) replace windows by routings with a shorter two-qubit "
"critical path and are evaluated next to the routings they refine, so they "
"never add two-qubit gates."
msgstr ""
"深度是搜索的次级目标：代价相同的深度扫描（``lnsd/`` 候选）用双比特门关键路径"
"更短的路由替换窗口，并与它们所精炼的路由一起评估，因此从不增加双比特门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:50
msgid ""
"For circuits whose two-qubit blocks are all generic SU(4) (quantum volume), "
"level 2 and 3 widen SABRE's lookahead to two layers of blocks and also route "
"by the methods of :mod:`quspect.transpiler._layer_route`: on a line by the "
"layered ordered-partition method (about 30 % fewer CZ on QV-100), on a ring "
"by its cyclic analogue, and on every other graph by a truncated rollout of "
"SABRE's greedy policy (5-6 % fewer CZ on QV-100 on a 10x10 grid and on heavy-"
"hex)."
msgstr ""
"对于两比特块全是一般 SU(4) 的线路（量子体积），第 2、3 级把 SABRE 的前瞻放宽"
"到两层块，并且还用 :mod:`quspect.transpiler._layer_route` 中的方法路由：在 "
"line 上用分层有序划分方法（QV-100 上约少 30 % 的 CZ），在环上用它的循环版本，"
"在其他所有耦合图上用 SABRE 贪心策略的截断 rollout（QV-100 在 10x10 网格与 "
"heavy-hex 上少 5–6 % 的 CZ）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:58
msgid ""
"At every level the pre-routing decomposition keeps ``ccx``: SABRE routes "
"each Toffoli as a three-qubit unit and synthesizes it for its final "
"placement (see :meth:`SABRE.solve`); the post-routing decomposition lowers "
"everything to the native gates."
msgstr ""
"各级别的路由前分解都保留 ``ccx``：SABRE 把每个 Toffoli 当作三比特单元路由，并"
"按其最终落点综合（见 :meth:`SABRE.solve`）；路由后的分解再把所有门降到原生"
"门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:63
msgid ""
"Target basis: any native gate set with a CZ-class entangler (``cz``, ``cx`` "
"or one registered "
"with :func:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.register_entangler`) and a "
"universal single-qubit set (e.g. ``{rz, h}``, ``{rz, sx}`` as on IBM devices "
"``{cx, rz, sx, x}``, ``{rz, rx}``, ``{u3}``).  The whole pipeline runs in a "
"CZ-centred *working basis* (the target's single-qubit gates plus ``{cz, h, "
"rz, x}``) and the result is translated at the end: each CZ becomes the "
"target entangler (for CX a Hadamard pair on the target qubit, oriented per "
"gate so that the Hadamards merge into the neighbouring single-qubit runs) "
"and the touched single-qubit runs are resynthesized in the target's gates; "
"from level 2 on, :class:`OptimizePass` then runs once more in the target's "
"gates.  From level 1 on, the selected result finally gets a single-qubit "
"minimization (any basis, CZ included): rotations are moved through the two-"
"qubit gates they commute with (``rz`` through a CX control or either CZ "
"qubit, ``rx`` through a CX target) and CX gates are reversed when the "
"Hadamard pairs this costs are absorbed, chosen per wire (beam search) so "
"that the runs need the fewest target gates; the two-qubit gates are "
"unchanged.  From level 2 on it also starts from CX orientations chosen for "
"the whole circuit at once "
"(:func:`~quspect.transpiler._gauge.orient_cx_gates`, a dual decomposition "
"over the wires) and, after the depth reordering below, keeps the shallower "
"result; blocks on the SWAP face of the Weyl chamber (routing SWAPs fused "
"with an interaction) also get the SWAP-shaped template with a single inner "
"``rz`` (see :mod:`quspect.transpiler._swap_face`).  Its gates are then "
"reordered for depth "
"by :func:`~quspect.transpiler._schedule.schedule_for_depth` (commuting gates "
"and two-qubit blocks are list-scheduled; the two-qubit depth never grows and "
"the gates stay the same; when reordering the two-qubit blocks first lowers "
"the two-qubit depth, the single-qubit minimization is also run on that order "
"and the shallower result is kept; above 20 000 instructions only that order "
"is used). CX and CZ differ only by single-qubit gates, so layout and routing "
"are identical for a CZ and a CX target and the two-qubit count is the same "
"or (rarely, after the final optimization) lower "
"(see :mod:`quspect.transpiler._basis`).  With no declared native gates, "
"decomposition is skipped and single-qubit runs fuse into ``u3``."
msgstr ""
"目标门集：任何含 CZ 类纠缠门（``cz``、``cx`` 或"
"用 :func:`~quspect.synthesis.two_qubit.register_entangler` 注册的门）和通用单"
"量子比特门集（例如 ``{rz, h}``、IBM 设备 ``{cx, rz, sx, x}`` 中的 ``{rz, sx}"
"``、``{rz, rx}``、``{u3}``）的原生门集。整个流水线在以 CZ 为中心的 *工作门集"
"*\\ （目标的单量子比特门加 ``{cz, h, rz, x}``）上运行，结果在最后翻译：每个 "
"CZ 变为目标纠缠门（对 CX 为目标比特上的一对 Hadamard，按门选择朝向，使 "
"Hadamard 并入相邻单量子比特门段），被改动的单量子比特门段用目标的门重新综合；"
"从第 2 级起，随后再在目标门集中运行一次 :class:`OptimizePass`。从第 1 级起，"
"最终选出的结果还要做一次单量子比特门最小化（任何门集，包括 CZ）：把旋转移过与"
"之对易的两比特门（``rz`` 穿过 CX 控制比特或 CZ 的任一比特，``rx`` 穿过 CX 目"
"标比特），并在所需的 Hadamard 对能被吸收时反向 CX 门，逐线（束搜索）选择使各"
"门段所需目标门最少的方案；两比特门不变。从第 2 级起，它还从对整条线路一次性选"
"定的 CX 朝向（:func:`~quspect.transpiler._gauge.orient_cx_gates`，按线做对偶"
"分解）出发再最小化一遍，并在下述深度重排之后保留更浅的结果；位于 Weyl 室 "
"SWAP 面上的块（路由 SWAP 与相互作用融合而成）还会改用内层只有一个 ``rz`` 的 "
"SWAP 形模板（见 :mod:`quspect.transpiler._swap_face`）。随后"
"用 :func:`~quspect.transpiler._schedule.schedule_for_depth` 按深度重排其中的"
"门（对易门与两比特块做列表调度；两比特门深度不会增加，门保持不变；若先重排两"
"比特块能降低两比特门深度，则在该顺序上也做一次单量子比特门最小化，保留更浅的"
"结果；超过 20 000 条指令时只用该顺序）。CX 与 CZ 只相差单量子比特门，因此 CZ "
"目标与 CX 目标的布局和路由完全相同，两比特门数相同或（极少数情况下，经最后的"
"优化）更少（见 :mod:`quspect.transpiler._basis`）。未声明原生门时跳过分解，单"
"量子比特门段融合为 ``u3``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:103
msgid ""
"Level 3 re-routes every refined layout ``swap_trials - 1`` more times with "
"other tie-breaking seeds and scores only the two routings with the fewest "
"SWAPs per layout (routing is cheap with the native core, scoring a candidate "
"is not).  Its work is bounded deterministically: routing stops once "
"``work_limit`` units (DAG nodes + SWAPs per routing pass, plus the scoring "
"work of every candidate) are spent, and extra full evaluations stop once "
"their estimated two-qubit count exceeds a fixed budget, so large circuits "
"get fewer trials and a fixed ``seed`` still gives a reproducible result.  "
"``time_limit`` adds a wall-clock cap on the routing trials, at the cost of "
"reproducibility."
msgstr ""
"第 3 级会用其他平局打破种子把每个精化布局再路由 ``swap_trials - 1`` 次，每个"
"布局只对 SWAP 最少的两个路由结果打分（原生核心下路由很便宜，候选打分则不"
"然）。其工作量有确定性上限：路由在用完 ``work_limit`` 个单位（每遍路由的 DAG "
"节点数 + SWAP 数，加上每个候选的打分工作量）后停止，额外的完整评估在其估计双"
"比特门总数超过固定预算后停止。因此大电路的试验更少，而固定 ``seed`` 仍给出可"
"复现的结果。``time_limit`` 再给路由试验加一个墙钟上限，代价是失去可复现性。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:114
msgid "Logical circuit to compile.  Qubit ``q`` is logical ``q``."
msgstr "要编译的逻辑电路。比特 ``q`` 即逻辑比特 ``q``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:115
msgid "Compilation target (coupling graph and native gates)."
msgstr "编译目标（耦合图与原生门）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:116
msgid "0, 1, 2 or 3 (see above)."
msgstr "0、1、2 或 3（见上文）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:117
msgid "Random seed for SABRE; the same seed gives the same output."
msgstr "SABRE 的随机种子；相同种子给出相同输出。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:118
msgid ""
"Optional fixed ``initial_layout[logical] = physical``; disables the layout "
"search (level 3 still tries several routing seeds from it)."
msgstr ""
"可选的固定布局 ``initial_layout[logical] = physical``；会关闭布局搜索（第 3 "
"级仍从它出发尝试多个路由种子）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:121
msgid "SABRE forward/backward refinement iterations per trial."
msgstr "每个试验的 SABRE 前向/反向精化迭代次数。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:122
msgid ""
"Random layout trials.  Default: the SABRE default (6) below level 3, 20 at "
"level 3 (subject to ``work_limit``)."
msgstr ""
"随机布局试验数。默认：第 3 级以下用 SABRE 默认值（6），第 3 级用 20（受 "
"``work_limit`` 限制）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:124
msgid ""
"Level 3 only: routing passes per refined layout (default 12; the two with "
"the fewest SWAPs per layout are scored)."
msgstr ""
"仅第 3 级：每个精化布局的路由遍数（默认 12；每个布局只对 SWAP 最少的两个打"
"分）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:127
msgid ""
"Level 3 only: number of best-ranked candidates fully optimized (the level-2 "
"candidate is evaluated in addition, and so are the LNS refinements of the "
"evaluated candidates).  Default: 1, or 2 for small circuits."
msgstr ""
"仅第 3 级：完整优化的排名最前候选数（另外还会评估第 2 级的候选，以及被评估候"
"选的 LNS 精炼结果）。默认：1，小线路为 2。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:131
msgid ""
"Level 3 only: routing work budget passed to :meth:`SABRE.route_candidates` "
"(default 3 000 000, about 1–3 s with the native routing core, 10–20 times "
"more in pure Python); the commutation-aware candidate search gets a budget "
"of the same size."
msgstr ""
"仅第 3 级：传给 :meth:`SABRE.route_candidates` 的路由工作量预算（默认 3 000 "
"000，原生路由核心下约 1–3 s，纯 Python 约慢 10–20 倍）；对易感知候选搜索也获"
"得同样大小的预算。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:136
msgid ""
"Level 3 only: optional wall-clock budget in seconds for the routing trials."
msgstr "仅第 3 级：路由试验可选的墙钟预算（秒）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:138
msgid ""
"Level 3 only: trade two-qubit gates for two-qubit depth in the candidate "
"selection, which then minimizes ``two-qubit gates + depth_weight · two-qubit "
"depth`` (ties by the default key).  ``0`` (default) selects by the fewest "
"two-qubit gates; a positive weight may select a candidate with more two-"
"qubit gates than level 2 (e.g. ``0.5`` prefers a routing with 7 % more gates "
"and a third of the two-qubit depth). Must be non-negative."
msgstr ""
"仅第 3 级：在候选选择中用两比特门数换两比特门深度，此时最小化 ``两比特门数 + "
"depth_weight · 两比特门深度``\\ （相同时按默认键）。``0``\\ （默认）按最少两"
"比特门选择；正的权重可能选中两比特门比第 2 级更多的候选（例如 ``0.5`` 会选择"
"门数多 7 %、两比特门深度只有三分之一的路由）。必须非负。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:146
msgid "Try a SWAP-free VF2++ layout first."
msgstr "先尝试无需 SWAP 的 VF2++ 布局。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:147
msgid ""
"Absorb SWAP-equivalent blocks and trailing routing SWAPs into "
"``final_layout`` (see :meth:`SABRE.solve`)."
msgstr ""
"把等价于 SWAP 的块和末尾的路由 SWAP 吸收进 ``final_layout``\\ "
"（见 :meth:`SABRE.solve`）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:149
msgid ""
"How much the output may deviate from the input, with Qiskit's convention "
"(``1.0`` = no approximation beyond a numerical floor, lower = more).  From "
"level 1 on, two-qubit gates and consolidated two-qubit blocks are replaced "
"by circuits with fewer two-qubit gates when each replacement's average gate "
"infidelity ``1 - F̄(U, V)`` is at most ``max(1 - approximation_degree, "
"1e-12)`` (see :func:`approximation_tolerance`): before routing only when the "
"whole interaction can be dropped (the gate or block becomes single-qubit "
"gates, so routing no longer needs to connect the pair), after routing any "
"reduction (e.g. 3 → 2 CZ).  The weak part of the interaction is dropped and "
"the local part kept, e.g. a ``CP(θ)`` with ``θ²/20 ≤ 1e-12`` (``|θ| ≤ "
"4.47e-6``) becomes two ``rz(θ/2)``.  The default ``1.0`` is at least as "
"strict as Qiskit's default (whose ``RemoveIdentityEquivalent`` drops whole "
"gates up to the same ``1e-12`` and whose ``CommutativeCancellation`` drops "
"merged rotations below ``1e-5`` rad).  ``None`` disables deliberate "
"approximation. Guarantee: the output differs from the input, up to global "
"phase, by at most ``stats.approximation_error`` in operator norm (the sum of "
"the replacements' distances), so its process infidelity is at most "
"``stats.approximation_error²`` plus the numerical error of the exact "
"rewrites."
msgstr ""
"输出可以偏离输入多少，沿用 Qiskit 的约定（``1.0`` = 除数值下限外不做近似，越"
"小近似越多）。从第 1 级起，当替换的平均门不保真度 ``1 - F̄(U, V)`` 至多为 "
"``max(1 - approximation_degree, 1e-12)``\\ "
"（见 :func:`approximation_tolerance`）时，两比特门与合并后的两比特块会被替换"
"为双比特门更少的线路：路由前只在整个相互作用可以丢掉时替换（门或块变成单比特"
"门，路由不再需要连接这对比特），路由后允许任意减少（例如 3 → 2 个 CZ）。丢掉"
"相互作用中较弱的部分并保留局部部分，例如满足 ``θ²/20 ≤ 1e-12``\\ （``|θ| ≤ "
"4.47e-6``）的 ``CP(θ)`` 变成两个 ``rz(θ/2)``。默认值 ``1.0`` 至少与 Qiskit 默"
"认行为同样严格（Qiskit 的 ``RemoveIdentityEquivalent`` 以同样的 ``1e-12`` 删"
"除整个门，其 ``CommutativeCancellation`` 删除合并后小于 ``1e-5`` rad 的旋"
"转）。``None`` 关闭有意近似。保证：输出与输入（相差全局相位）的算子范数距离至"
"多为 ``stats.approximation_error``\\ （各替换距离之和），因此其过程不保真度至"
"多为 ``stats.approximation_error²`` 加上精确改写的数值误差。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:173
msgid "A :class:`TranspileResult`."
msgstr "一个 :class:`TranspileResult`。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.transpile:175
msgid ""
"If ``optimization_level`` is not 0–3, if     ``approximation_degree`` is not "
"``None`` or in ``[0, 1]``, if     ``depth_weight`` is negative, if the "
"circuit does not fit the     target, for invalid SABRE arguments, or if the "
"target's native     gates cannot express the circuit (single-qubit set "
"not     universal, or no supported entangler for a circuit with     multi-"
"qubit gates)."
msgstr ""
"``optimization_level`` 不是 0–3、``approximation_degree`` 既不是 ``None`` 也"
"不在 ``[0, 1]`` 内、``depth_weight`` 为负、线路放不进目标、SABRE 参数无效，或"
"目标原生门无法表达该线路（单比特门集不通用，或线路含多比特门但没有受支持的纠"
"缠门）时。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.APPROXIMATION_FLOOR:1
msgid ""
"Per-operation approximation floor (average gate infidelity) at "
"``approximation_degree=1.0``: the cutoff of Qiskit's "
"``RemoveIdentityEquivalent`` at its default ``approximation_degree=1.0``."
msgstr ""
"``approximation_degree=1.0`` 时每个操作的近似下限（平均门不保真度）：即 "
"Qiskit 的 ``RemoveIdentityEquivalent`` 在默认 ``approximation_degree=1.0`` 下"
"的截断值。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.approximation_tolerance:1
msgid "Per-operation approximation budget of :func:`transpile`."
msgstr ":func:`transpile` 的每操作近似预算。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.approximation_tolerance:3
msgid ""
"``None`` disables deliberate approximation (``0.0``); otherwise the budget "
"is ``max(1 - approximation_degree, APPROXIMATION_FLOOR)``, an average gate "
"infidelity ``1 - F̄`` with ``F̄ = (1 + d·|tr(U^† V)|²/d²) / (1 + d)``."
msgstr ""
"``None`` 关闭有意近似（``0.0``）；否则预算为 ``max(1 - approximation_degree, "
"APPROXIMATION_FLOOR)``，是平均门不保真度 ``1 - F̄``，其中 ``F̄ = (1 + d·|"
"tr(U^† V)|²/d²) / (1 + d)``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.approximation_tolerance:8
msgid "``None`` or a number in ``[0, 1]``."
msgstr "``None`` 或 ``[0, 1]`` 内的数。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.approximation_tolerance:10
msgid ""
"The largest accepted average gate infidelity of one approximated gate or two-"
"qubit block."
msgstr "单个被近似的门或两比特块允许的最大平均门不保真度。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_transpile.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._transpile.approximation_tolerance:13
msgid "If ``approximation_degree`` is not ``None`` and not in     ``[0, 1]``."
msgstr "``approximation_degree`` 不是 ``None`` 且不在 ``[0, 1]`` 内时。"

#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:182
msgid "Transpiler: SABRE Routing Candidates"
msgstr "Transpiler：SABRE 路由候选"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.RoutingCandidate:1
msgid ""
"One routed version of a circuit produced by :meth:`SABRE.route_candidates`."
msgstr "由 :meth:`SABRE.route_candidates` 产生的电路的一个路由版本。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.RoutingCandidate:3
msgid ""
"The circuit is in *wire space*, exactly like the output "
"of :meth:`SABRE.solve`: wire ``w`` sits on physical qubit "
"``initial_mapping[w]`` for the whole circuit and SWAPs move state between "
"wires."
msgstr ""
"电路位于*线空间*，与 :meth:`SABRE.solve` 的输出完全一致：线 ``w`` 在整个电路"
"中都位于物理比特 ``initial_mapping[w]`` 上，SWAP 在线之间移动状态。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.RoutingCandidate:11
msgid "Routed circuit (wire space, SWAPs not yet decomposed)."
msgstr "路由后的电路（线空间，SWAP 尚未分解）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.RoutingCandidate:18
msgid ""
"``initial_mapping[wire] = physical``; logical wires first, then workspace "
"wires."
msgstr "``initial_mapping[wire] = physical``；先是逻辑线，然后是工作线。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.RoutingCandidate:26
msgid ""
"``final_mapping[wire] = physical`` where the state of the wire ends "
"(includes elided permutations)."
msgstr ""
"``final_mapping[wire] = physical``，即该线状态最终所在的位置（包含被消去的置"
"换）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.RoutingCandidate:34
msgid "Routing SWAPs inserted by the router (before trailing SWAP elision)."
msgstr "路由器插入的路由 SWAP 数（在消去末尾 SWAP 之前）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.RoutingCandidate:42
msgid "Two-qubit depth of the routed circuit (SWAP = 1 layer)."
msgstr "路由后电路的双比特深度（SWAP 计 1 层）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.RoutingCandidate:49
msgid ""
"Cheap estimate of the CZ count after the routed circuit is decomposed and "
"its two-qubit blocks are resynthesized (see :func:`estimate_two_qubit_cost`)."
msgstr ""
"对路由后电路分解并重综合其双比特块之后 CZ 数的廉价估计"
"（见 :func:`estimate_two_qubit_cost`）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.RoutingCandidate:58
msgid "Human-readable origin, e.g. ``\"exact\"`` or ``\"trial3/swap1\"``."
msgstr "便于阅读的来源标签，例如 ``\"exact\"`` 或 ``\"trial3/swap1\"``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.RoutingCandidate:65
msgid ""
"True for the candidate :meth:`SABRE.solve` returns with the same arguments "
"(fewest SWAPs, then smallest depth, then lowest trial index; see "
"``reference_trials``)."
msgstr ""
"对于 :meth:`SABRE.solve` 在相同参数下会返回的候选为 True（SWAP 最少，其次深度"
"最小，再次试验编号最小；见 ``reference_trials``）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:1
msgid "Route a circuit several ways and return the ranked candidates."
msgstr "以多种方式路由电路并返回排好序的候选。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:3
msgid ""
"Runs the same layout search as :meth:`solve` (same seeds, same refinement), "
"but instead of keeping only the trial with the fewest SWAPs it keeps every "
"routed trial.  With ``swap_trials > 1`` the refined layouts (all, or the "
"``swap_layouts`` best ranked) are then re-routed ``swap_trials - 1`` more "
"times with different tie-breaking seeds (Qiskit's ``swap_trials``).  "
"Duplicate routings are dropped."
msgstr ""
"执行与 :meth:`solve` 相同的布局搜索（相同的种子与精化），但不再只保留 SWAP 最"
"少的试验，而是保留每个路由过的试验。当 ``swap_trials > 1`` 时，精化后的布局"
"（全部，或排名最前的 ``swap_layouts`` 个）会再用不同的平局决胜种子路由 "
"``swap_trials - 1`` 次（即 Qiskit 的 ``swap_trials``）。重复的路由结果会被去"
"掉。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:11
msgid ""
"Candidates are ranked by ``(estimated_two_qubit_gates, num_swaps, depth, "
"generation order)``: the estimate accounts for SWAPs that merge with a "
"neighbouring gate on the same pair (``SWAP · CZ`` needs 2 CZ instead of 4), "
"which a raw SWAP count ignores.  The candidate :meth:`solve` would return "
"(with ``reference_trials`` layout trials) is flagged ``is_default`` and is "
"always included, even when it falls outside ``top_k``.  When an exact (SWAP-"
"free) layout exists, it is the only candidate."
msgstr ""
"候选按 ``(estimated_two_qubit_gates, num_swaps, depth, 生成顺序)`` 排序：该估"
"计考虑了与同一比特对上相邻门合并的 SWAP（``SWAP · CZ`` 只需 2 个 CZ 而非 4 "
"个），这是单纯数 SWAP 所忽略的。:meth:`solve` 会返回的候选（使用 "
"``reference_trials`` 个布局试验）被标记为 ``is_default`` 并总是包含在结果中，"
"即使它落在 ``top_k`` 之外。存在精确（无 SWAP）布局时，它是唯一的候选。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:20
msgid ""
"Logical circuit (gates on at most two qubits, plus ``ccx`` routed as a three-"
"qubit unit as in :meth:`solve`; every candidate has its Toffolis synthesized "
"for their placement before it is scored)."
msgstr ""
"逻辑电路（门至多作用于两个比特，另外 ``ccx`` 与 :meth:`solve` 中一样作为三比"
"特单元路由；每个候选在评分前都已把其中的 Toffoli 按落点综合）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:24
msgid "Forward+backward refinement iterations per trial."
msgstr "每个试验的前向+反向精化迭代次数。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:25
msgid ""
"Random seed; the same seed yields identical candidates (unless "
"``time_limit`` cuts the search short)."
msgstr "随机种子；相同种子给出相同的候选（除非 ``time_limit`` 提前截断搜索）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:27
msgid ""
"Optional fixed ``initial_mapping[logical] = physical``.  No layout search is "
"done; the circuit is routed from it ``swap_trials`` times (the first routing "
"equals :meth:`solve` with the same arguments)."
msgstr ""
"可选的固定映射 ``initial_mapping[logical] = physical``。不做布局搜索，电路从"
"它出发路由 ``swap_trials`` 次（第一次路由与相同参数下的 :meth:`solve` 相"
"同）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:31
msgid "Number of random layout trials (at least 1)."
msgstr "随机布局试验数（至少 1）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:32
msgid ""
"Routing passes per refined layout (at least 1); the first one is the "
"routing :meth:`solve` uses."
msgstr "每个精化布局的路由遍数（至少 1）；第一遍即 :meth:`solve` 使用的路由。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:34
msgid "Try a SWAP-free exact layout first."
msgstr "先尝试无需 SWAP 的精确布局。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:35
msgid "State budget of the VF2++ search."
msgstr "VF2++ 搜索的状态预算。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:36
msgid "Optional wall-clock limit of the VF2++ search."
msgstr "VF2++ 搜索可选的墙钟上限。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:37
msgid "Absorb permutations into the final mapping (see :meth:`solve`)."
msgstr "把置换吸收进最终映射（见 :meth:`solve`）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:39
msgid ""
"Re-route only this many refined layouts (the best ranked after their first "
"routing) ``swap_trials - 1`` more times.  ``None`` re-routes all of them."
msgstr ""
"只对这么多个精化布局（按首次路由后的排名取最前者）再路由 ``swap_trials - 1`` "
"次。``None`` 表示对全部布局再路由。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:42
msgid ""
"The default candidate (``is_default``) is the result of :meth:`solve` with "
"``layout_trials = reference_trials`` (default: ``layout_trials``).  Because "
"trial seeds are drawn in order, those trials are a prefix of this search; "
"they are always run, whatever the budget."
msgstr ""
"默认候选（``is_default``）是 :meth:`solve` 在 ``layout_trials = "
"reference_trials``\\ （默认：``layout_trials``）时的结果。由于试验种子按顺序"
"抽取，这些试验是本次搜索的前缀；无论预算如何它们都会运行。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:47
msgid ""
"Return at most this many best-ranked candidates (plus the default one).  "
"``None`` returns all of them."
msgstr ""
"最多返回这么多个排名最前的候选（外加默认候选）。``None`` 返回全部候选。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:49
msgid ""
"Optional deterministic budget on the total routing work: DAG nodes plus "
"inserted SWAPs summed over all routing passes (about 1 µs each with the "
"native routing core, 10–20 µs in CPython), plus, for every scored candidate, "
"its input gates and SWAPs and ``150`` per routed Toffoli (replay, Toffoli "
"synthesis and cost estimate).  Three quarters of it may go to the layout "
"trials, the rest to the extra routings; once spent, no further trial starts "
"(at least one trial is always routed)."
msgstr ""
"可选的确定性路由工作量预算：所有路由遍的 DAG 节点数加插入的 SWAP 数（原生路由"
"核心下每单位约 1 µs，CPython 中约 10–20 µs），再加上每个被打分候选的输入门数"
"与 SWAP 数，以及每个整体路由的 Toffoli 计 ``150`` （回放、Toffoli 综合与代价"
"估计）。其中至多四分之三用于布局试验，其余用于额外路由；预算用完后不再开始新"
"的试验（至少路由一个试验）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:58
msgid ""
"Optional wall-clock budget in seconds for the trials; once spent, no further "
"trial is started (at least one is always routed).  Results then depend on "
"machine speed, so leave it ``None`` for reproducibility."
msgstr ""
"试验可选的墙钟预算（秒）；用完后不再开始新的试验（至少路由一个）。此时结果依"
"赖于机器速度，需要可复现性时请保持 ``None``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:62
msgid ""
"Of the ``swap_trials - 1`` extra routings of each layout, keep (replay and "
"score) only the ``swap_keep`` with the fewest SWAPs (then the smallest "
"depth, then the earliest), as Qiskit selects among its swap trials. Routing "
"is far cheaper than replaying and scoring a candidate, so many swap trials "
"stay affordable.  ``None`` keeps every routing."
msgstr ""
"每个布局的 ``swap_trials - 1`` 次额外路由中，只保留（回放并打分）SWAP 最少"
"（其次深度最小、再次最早）的 ``swap_keep`` 个，与 Qiskit 在 swap trial 之间的"
"选择方式相同。路由远比回放和打分便宜，因此可以负担大量 swap trial。``None`` "
"保留全部路由。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:70
msgid "Candidates sorted best first."
msgstr "按优劣排序（最优在前）的候选。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:72
msgid ""
"For the same reasons as :meth:`solve`, or if     ``swap_trials``, "
"``swap_layouts``, ``top_k``,     ``work_limit`` or ``swap_keep`` is smaller "
"than 1, or     ``reference_trials`` is outside ``[1, layout_trials]``."
msgstr ""
"与 :meth:`solve` 相同的原因；或 ``swap_trials``、``swap_layouts``、"
"``top_k``、``work_limit`` 或 ``swap_keep`` 小于 1；或 ``reference_trials`` 不"
"在 ``[1, layout_trials]`` 内。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.SABRE.route_candidates:73
msgid "If ``layout_trials`` is not an int."
msgstr "``layout_trials`` 不是 int 时抛出。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.estimate_two_qubit_cost:1
msgid "Estimate the CZ count of routed gates after block resynthesis."
msgstr "估计路由后的门在块重综合之后的 CZ 数。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.estimate_two_qubit_cost:3
msgid ""
"Gates are grouped into maximal runs on one physical pair "
"(like :class:`~quspect.transpiler.ConsolidateBlocksPass`); a measurement or "
"a two-qubit gate on another pair closes the run.  A SWAP costs 3, a "
"controlled rotation or ``rzz``-type gate 2, any other two-qubit gate 1. A "
"run costs ``min(3, total)``, except a SWAP with a single other gate, which "
"costs 2 (``SWAP · CZ`` ~ iSWAP).  This ignores cancellations found by later "
"optimization, so it is a ranking heuristic, not an exact count."
msgstr ""
"门被分组为同一物理比特对上的最长连续段"
"（与 :class:`~quspect.transpiler.ConsolidateBlocksPass` 相同）；测量或作用于"
"其他比特对的双比特门会结束该段。SWAP 计 3，受控旋转或 ``rzz`` 类门计 2，其他"
"双比特门计 1。一段的代价为 ``min(3, total)``，但 SWAP 加单个其他门的段计 2"
"（``SWAP · CZ`` ~ iSWAP）。这里忽略了后续优化能找到的抵消，因此它是排序用的启"
"发式，而不是精确计数。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.estimate_two_qubit_cost:12
msgid ""
":meth:`SABRE.route_candidates` scores the gates *after* routed Toffolis were "
"synthesized for their placement, so their CX gates are counted like any "
"other two-qubit gate.  A still unexpanded three-qubit ``ccx`` closes the "
"runs on its qubits and costs 6 (its cheapest synthesis)."
msgstr ""
":meth:`SABRE.route_candidates` 在路由后的 Toffoli 按落点综合 *之后* 才对门评"
"分，因此其中的 CX 与其他双比特门一样计数。仍未展开的三比特 ``ccx`` 会结束其所"
"在比特上的块，并计为 6（其最便宜的综合）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.estimate_two_qubit_cost:17
msgid "Routed gates on physical qubits."
msgstr "物理比特上的路由后门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.estimate_two_qubit_cost:18
msgid "Number of physical qubits."
msgstr "物理比特数。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_mapping.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._mapping.estimate_two_qubit_cost:20
msgid "The estimated number of two-qubit gates."
msgstr "估计的双比特门数。"

#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:195
msgid "Transpiler: Low-Dilation Layouts"
msgstr "转译器：低伸缩布局"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding:1
msgid ""
"Low-dilation initial layouts: the interaction graph embedded in the device."
msgstr "低伸缩初始布局：把交互图嵌入设备。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding:3
msgid ""
"SABRE's layout search starts from random permutations and improves them by "
"forward/backward routing.  That works well for dense, time-varying "
"interaction patterns, but it is poor at *embedding* a large sparse "
"interaction graph — a CX chain (GHZ preparation), a nearest-neighbour "
"Trotter chain, an adder's ladder — into a sparse device when no exact (SWAP-"
"free) embedding exists: the refinement only moves qubits locally, so a "
"random start keeps its long-range defects (a 50-qubit chain on a 57-qubit "
"heavy-hex lattice routes with ~35 SWAPs from the best of 26 SABRE starts, "
"while one SWAP suffices)."
msgstr ""
"SABRE 的布局搜索从随机置换出发，再用正向/反向路由改进。这对稠密、随时间变化的"
"相互作用模式效果很好，但当不存在精确（无 SWAP）嵌入时，它不擅长把大的稀疏交互"
"图——CX 链（GHZ 制备）、最近邻 Trotter 链、加法器的梯形结构——\\ *嵌入*\\ 稀疏"
"设备：精炼只在局部移动比特，随机起点的长程缺陷会一直保留（57 比特 heavy-hex "
"晶格上的 50 比特链，26 个 SABRE 起点中最好的也要约 35 个 SWAP，而一个 SWAP 就"
"够了）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding:13
msgid ""
"This module computes starting layouts that minimize the **weighted "
"dilation** of the interaction graph ``H`` (edge weight ``w_ij`` = number of "
"routing nodes on the pair) in the coupling graph ``G``::"
msgstr ""
"本模块计算使交互图 ``H``\\ （边权 ``w_ij`` = 该比特对上的路由节点数）在耦合"
"图 ``G`` 中的\\ **加权伸缩**\\ 最小的起始布局::"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding:19
msgid ""
"— every unit of dilation of an edge is (at least) one SWAP that a static "
"layout forces on that pair.  Minimizing it is a Koopmans–Beckmann quadratic "
"assignment problem (flow ``W``, distance ``D − 1``) and contains subgraph "
"isomorphism / Hamiltonian path as the zero-cost case, so it is NP-hard; two "
"classical ideas give good solutions fast:"
msgstr ""
"——一条边每多一单位伸缩，静态布局就（至少）要在这一对上付出一个 SWAP。最小化它"
"是 Koopmans–Beckmann 二次分配问题（流量 ``W``，距离 ``D − 1``），零代价情形即"
"子图同构 / 哈密顿路径，因此是 NP 难的；两个经典思想可以快速给出好解："

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding:25
msgid ""
"**Greedy growth with Warnsdorff's rule.**  Logical qubits are placed in "
"*maximum-adjacency order* (the next qubit is the one most strongly connected "
"to the placed ones, as in Prim's algorithm or a weighted Cuthill–McKee "
"ordering), each on the free physical qubit with the smallest added "
"dilation.  Ties go to the physical qubit with the *fewest* free neighbours — "
"Warnsdorff's rule, the classic heuristic for Hamiltonian paths (knight's "
"tours): it walks along the boundary of the free region instead of cutting it "
"into pieces — unless that leaves fewer free neighbours than the qubit has "
"unplaced partners (a capacity penalty that keeps room for the branches of "
"trees and stars).  Several starts (peripheral / low-degree / central qubits "
"of ``H`` and of ``G``, found by a double BFS sweep as in the Gibbs–Poole–"
"Stockmeyer bandwidth heuristic) are tried."
msgstr ""
"**带 Warnsdorff 规则的贪心生长。**\\ 逻辑比特按\\ *最大邻接序*\\ 放置（下一个"
"比特是与已放置比特连接最强的那个，如 Prim 算法或加权 Cuthill–McKee 排序），每"
"个放到使新增伸缩最小的空闲物理比特上。平局时选\\ *空闲邻居最少*\\ 的物理比特"
"——即 Warnsdorff 规则，哈密顿路径（骑士巡游）的经典启发式：它沿空闲区域的边界"
"前进，而不是把空闲区域切碎——除非这样剩下的空闲邻居少于该比特尚未放置的伙伴数"
"（容量惩罚，为树和星形的分支留出空间）。会尝试多个起点（``H`` 与 ``G`` 的外"
"围 / 低度 / 中心比特，外围点用 Gibbs–Poole–Stockmeyer 带宽启发式中的两次 BFS "
"扫描求得）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding:38
msgid ""
"**Simulated annealing on the QAP.**  The best greedy layouts are improved by "
"2-exchange moves (a logical qubit trades places with whatever occupies a "
"physical qubit — another logical qubit or a free one), proposed mostly next "
"to one of the qubit's partners, evaluated in ``O(degree)`` and accepted by "
"the Metropolis rule under a linearly cooling temperature."
msgstr ""
"**二次分配问题上的模拟退火。**\\ 最好的几个贪心布局再用二交换移动改进（一个逻"
"辑比特与某个物理比特上的占用者——另一个逻辑比特或空位——交换位置），移动目标多"
"数取在该比特某个伙伴的旁边，以 ``O(度数)`` 求值，并在线性降温下按 Metropolis "
"准则接受。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding:45
msgid ""
"The layouts are *starts*: SABRE routes each one unrefined and refined, and "
"its usual selection (fewest SWAPs) decides, so a poor embedding (e.g. for a "
"dense, time-varying circuit) only costs its routing time."
msgstr ""
"这些布局只是\\ *起点*：SABRE 对每个布局分别不精炼和精炼后路由，并按通常的规则"
"（SWAP 最少）选择，因此不好的嵌入（例如对稠密、随时间变化的线路）只多花它的路"
"由时间。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding:49
msgid ""
"Everything is integer arithmetic plus a SplitMix64 random source, and a C++ "
"implementation (``cpp/src/transpiler/dilation_layout.cpp``) gives bit-"
"identical results; :func:`dilation_layouts` uses it when the native "
"extension is built."
msgstr ""
"全部为整数运算加 SplitMix64 随机源，C++ 实现（``cpp/src/transpiler/"
"dilation_layout.cpp``）给出逐位相同的结果；原生扩展已构建"
"时 :func:`dilation_layouts` 会使用它。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding.dilation_layouts_python:1
msgid "Pure-Python reference implementation of :func:`dilation_layouts`."
msgstr ":func:`dilation_layouts` 的纯 Python 参考实现。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding.dilation_layouts:1
msgid "Layouts of small weighted dilation of an interaction graph."
msgstr "交互图的小加权伸缩布局。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding.dilation_layouts:3
msgid "Number of logical qubits."
msgstr "逻辑比特数。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding.dilation_layouts:4
msgid ""
"Interaction graph as ``(a, b, weight)`` with ``a < b``, distinct pairs and "
"positive integer weights."
msgstr ""
"交互图，形如 ``(a, b, weight)``，``a < b``，比特对互不相同，权重为正整数。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding.dilation_layouts:6
msgid "Coupling graph adjacency lists (sorted), connected."
msgstr "耦合图的邻接表（已排序），须连通。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding.dilation_layouts:7
msgid "All-pairs shortest-path distances of the coupling graph."
msgstr "耦合图的全源最短路径距离。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding.dilation_layouts:8
msgid "Seed of the annealing random source."
msgstr "退火随机源的种子。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding.dilation_layouts:9
msgid "Number of distinct layouts to return (best first)."
msgstr "返回的互不相同布局个数（最好的在前）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding.dilation_layouts:11
msgid ""
"``layout[q]`` is the physical qubit of interacting logical qubit ``q`` and "
"``-1`` for logical qubits without interactions; ``cost`` is the weighted "
"dilation ``Σ w · (d − 1)``.  Empty without edges."
msgstr ""
"``layout[q]`` 为有相互作用的逻辑比特 ``q`` 的物理比特，无相互作用的逻辑比特"
"为 ``-1``；``cost`` 为加权伸缩 ``Σ w · (d − 1)``。没有边时为空。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_embedding.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._embedding.dilation_layouts:15
msgid "``(cost, layout)`` pairs, best first"
msgstr "``(cost, layout)`` 对，最好的在前"

#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:201
msgid "Transpiler: Exact Window Re-Routing (LNS)"
msgstr "Transpiler：窗口精确重路由（LNS）"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns:1
msgid ""
"Exact window re-routing and large-neighbourhood search over SABRE routings."
msgstr "SABRE 路由的窗口精确重路由与大邻域搜索。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns:3
msgid ""
"A routing is a sequence of *events*: executions of routing-DAG nodes and "
"physical SWAPs.  Its SWAP cost is measured in CZ gates with the block-merge "
"model of the mirror-gate router: a SWAP costs 3, unless the operation right "
"before or after it on both of its physical qubits is the same two-qubit "
"block on that pair, in which case block resynthesis merges them and the SWAP "
"costs only the block's *mirror cost* ``cz(U · SWAP) - cz(U)`` (0 for a "
"generic SU(4) block, 1 for a lone CZ).  The cheaper side counts."
msgstr ""
"一次路由是一个*事件*序列：路由 DAG 节点的执行与物理 SWAP。其 SWAP 代价以 CZ "
"门计，采用镜像门路由器的块合并模型：一个 SWAP 计 3，除非它两个物理比特上紧邻"
"的前一个或后一个操作是落在这对比特上的同一个两比特块——此时块重综合会把二者合"
"并，SWAP 只计该块的*镜像代价* ``cz(U · SWAP) - cz(U)``（通用 SU(4) 块为 0，单"
"个 CZ 为 1）。取较便宜的一侧。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns:12
msgid "Exact search (A*)"
msgstr "精确搜索（A*）"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns:14
msgid ""
":func:`exact_route` finds a routing of a whole DAG from a fixed initial "
"layout with the minimum cost (or minimum SWAP count with "
"``merge_costs=False``).  The search state is the permutation of the logical "
"qubits, the set of executed nodes and the open merge opportunities; nodes "
"are executed as soon as they are executable.  The lower bound is admissible "
"and built from *movement*: a SWAP moves two logical qubits by one step each."
msgstr ""
":func:`exact_route` 从固定的初始布局出发，求整个 DAG 代价最小的路由"
"（``merge_costs=False`` 时为 SWAP 数最少）。搜索状态是逻辑比特的排列、已执行"
"节点的集合以及开放的合并机会；节点一旦可执行就立即执行。下界是可采纳的，基于*"
"移动量*：一个 SWAP 把两个逻辑比特各移动一步。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns:21
msgid ""
"Meeting and exit: the qubits ``a, b`` of a pending node must meet on some "
"coupling edge ``(m, m')``, and a qubit that is used after the window must "
"then reach its exit position ``e``, so together they move at least ``min "
"over edges of D(a, m) + D(m, e_a) + D(b, m') + D(m', e_b)``. Requirements of "
"qubit-disjoint nodes add up (chosen greedily, largest first), as do the exit "
"distances of the remaining constrained qubits."
msgstr ""
"相遇与出口：待执行节点的两个比特 ``a, b`` 必须在某条耦合边 ``(m, m')`` 上相"
"遇，而窗口之后还要用到的比特之后还必须到达其出口位置 ``e``，因此二者合计至少"
"移动 ``min over edges of D(a, m) + D(m, e_a) + D(b, m') + D(m', e_b)``。比特"
"互不相交的节点的需求可以相加（按从大到小贪心选取），其余受约束比特到出口的距"
"离也可以相加。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns:27
msgid ""
"Hub chain: the qubit with the most pending nodes meets its partners in a "
"fixed order.  A dynamic program over its position, ``f_i(x) = min_u [f_{i-1}"
"(u) + D(u, x)] + min_{y ∈ N(x)} [D(p_b, y) + D(y, e_b)]`` (the first term is "
"a min-plus distance transform, i.e. a multi-source BFS), bounds the movement "
"of the hub and its distinct partners together."
msgstr ""
"枢纽链：待执行节点最多的比特按固定顺序与其伙伴相遇。对其位置做动态规划 "
"``f_i(x) = min_u [f_{i-1}(u) + D(u, x)] + min_{y ∈ N(x)} [D(p_b, y) + D(y, "
"e_b)]``（第一项是 min-plus 距离变换，即多源 BFS），给出枢纽与其各个不同伙伴的"
"总移动量下界。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns:33
msgid ""
"Cost: half of a SWAP's cost is charged to each qubit it moves.  A qubit can "
"make a cheap (merged) step at most once per node it is part of, at that "
"node's mirror cost; every other step costs ``3 / 2``.  SWAPs needed ``>= "
"ceil(movement / 2)`` also bound the cost with the cheapest merge "
"opportunities."
msgstr ""
"代价：一个 SWAP 的代价一半记在它移动的每个比特上。一个比特在其所属的每个节点"
"上至多走一次便宜的（合并的）一步，代价为该节点的镜像代价；其余每一步代价 "
"``3 / 2``。所需 SWAP 数 ``>= ceil(移动量 / 2)`` 与最便宜的合并机会一起也给出"
"代价下界。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns:39
msgid ""
"The expensive parts (meeting/exit and hub chain) are evaluated lazily, when "
"a state is popped (Lazy A*).  Commuting SWAPs on disjoint edges are only "
"tried in one order (partial-order reduction).  For the pure SWAP count the "
"search is exact; with merge costs the greedy execution of executable nodes "
"can, in rare cases, miss a merge."
msgstr ""
"昂贵的部分（相遇/出口与枢纽链）惰性计算：状态出队时才算（Lazy A*）。不相交边"
"上相互对易的 SWAP 只按一种顺序尝试（偏序归约）。对纯 SWAP 数，该搜索是精确"
"的；对合并代价，可执行节点的贪心执行在极少数情况下会错过一次合并。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns:45
msgid ""
"On small circuits (at most ten qubits) where A* proves optimality from the "
"level-3 initial layout, the SWAP count of the level-3 routing is typically "
"15–30 % above the minimum, but its merge-aware cost is within a few CZ of "
"the optimum: the merges, not the SWAP count, are what matter."
msgstr ""
"在 A* 能从第 3 级初始布局证明最优的小线路（至多十个比特）上，第 3 级路由的 "
"SWAP 数通常比最小值多 15–30 %，但其合并感知代价与最优只差几个 CZ：关键在合"
"并，而不是 SWAP 数。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns:51
msgid "Large-neighbourhood search"
msgstr "大邻域搜索"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns:53
msgid ""
":func:`refine_routing` takes a SABRE routing and repeatedly cuts out a "
"*window* — ``k`` consecutive SWAPs together with the nodes executed between "
"them (from the previous SWAP to the next one).  The layout entering the "
"window is fixed, and so is the exit position of every logical qubit that is "
"still used after the window; qubits without later nodes (idle and finished "
"qubits, workspace ancillas) may end anywhere, since their placement is "
"absorbed into the final mapping.  The window is re-routed by the same A* "
"with the original window cost as upper bound (branch and bound: the search "
"only explores routings that are strictly cheaper) and a budget of A* "
"expansions, including the merges with the operations just before and after "
"the window.  Improvements are spliced in immediately; the window sizes are "
"swept left to right, twice.  The result executes the same nodes, so it is "
"exactly equivalent; its cost never increases."
msgstr ""
":func:`refine_routing` 以一个 SABRE 路由为起点，反复切出一个*窗口*——``k`` 个"
"连续 SWAP 以及它们之间执行的节点（从前一个 SWAP 到后一个 SWAP）。进入窗口的布"
"局固定，窗口之后仍要用到的每个逻辑比特的出口位置也固定；之后没有节点的比特"
"（空闲和已完成的比特、工作区辅助比特）可以停在任何位置，因为其位置会被吸收进"
"最终映射。窗口用同一个 A* 重新路由，以原窗口代价为上界（分支定界：只搜索严格"
"更便宜的路由），并有 A* 展开次数预算，窗口前后紧邻操作的合并也计入。改进立即"
"拼接进去；各窗口大小从左到右扫描两遍。结果执行相同的节点，因此精确等价，代价"
"也不会增加。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns:68
msgid "Depth as secondary objective"
msgstr "深度作为次级目标"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns:70
msgid ""
"Every physical qubit carries the time (in CZ layers) at which it becomes "
"free: a SWAP adds its cost, a node its weight (:func:`node_weights`), and a "
"node merged into the SWAP before it only the part the merge adds.  The rest "
"of the routing is fixed around a window, so the depth proxy of the whole "
"routing is exactly ``max_q (exit time[q] + tail[q])``, where ``tail[q]`` is "
"the longest path from the first operation after the window on ``q``.  The "
"window A* then orders by ``(cost, depth)`` lexicographically: the cost bound "
"is unchanged (the primary objective keeps its optimality) and the depth part "
"only uses the current times, which never decrease (admissible).  With "
"``depth_ties`` the cost sweeps take the shallowest of the cheapest window "
"routings; ``depth_passes`` adds sweeps that also replace a window by an "
"equally cheap, shallower routing (:func:`deepen_plan`)."
msgstr ""
"每个物理比特带一个\"忙到何时\"的时间（以 CZ 层计）：SWAP 加上它的代价，节点加"
"上它的权重（:func:`node_weights`），与之前 SWAP 合并的节点只加合并多出的部"
"分。窗口之外的路由是固定的，所以整条路由的深度代理恰为 ``max_q (exit time[q] "
"+ tail[q])``，其中 ``tail[q]`` 是从窗口之后 ``q`` 上的首个操作起的最长路径。"
"窗口 A* 于是按 ``(代价, 深度)`` 字典序搜索：代价下界不变（主目标保持最优），"
"深度部分只用当前时间，而时间只增不减（可采纳）。开启 ``depth_ties`` 时，代价"
"扫描在最便宜的窗口路由中取最浅的；``depth_passes`` 再追加若干轮扫描，用代价相"
"同、更浅的路由替换窗口（:func:`deepen_plan`）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring of
