#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns.node_cost_model:3
msgid ""
"The mirror cost of a node is taken from the DAG's mirror annotation when "
"present, else computed the same way (cached on ``prep``).  On a DAG whose "
"nodes are single gates of a longer pair block, the first / last node of the "
"block carries the block's cost; inner nodes get ``-1``."
msgstr ""
"节点的镜像代价取自 DAG 的镜像标注（若有），否则按同样的方法计算（缓存在 "
"``prep`` 上）。在节点为更长比特对块中单个门的 DAG 上，块的首 / 末节点带有块的"
"代价，中间节点为 ``-1``。"

