#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_route_lns.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._route_lns.node_weights:3
msgid ""
"A node's weight is the number of CZ layers it contributes to the two-qubit "
"depth: its CZ count, where every maximal pair block is capped at 3 (it is "
"resynthesized into at most three CZ), so later gates of a long block weigh "
"0.  A routed ``ccx`` weighs ``6``; measurements ``0``. Cached on ``prep``."
msgstr ""
"节点的权重是它对双比特门深度贡献的 CZ 层数：即它的 CZ 数，但每个极大比特对块"
"至多计 3（重综合后至多三个 CZ），所以长块中靠后的门权重为 0。路由的 ``ccx`` "
"计 ``6``，测量计 ``0``。结果缓存在 ``prep`` 上。"

