#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:209
msgid "Transpiler: Routing of SU(4)-Block Circuits"
msgstr "Transpiler：SU(4) 块线路的路由"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route:1
msgid ""
"Layered routing of SU(4)-block circuits on a path (quantum-volume style)."
msgstr "路径上 SU(4) 块线路的分层路由（量子体积类线路）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route:3
msgid ""
"When every two-qubit block of a circuit is a generic SU(4) (its mirror cost "
"``cz(U · SWAP) - cz(U)`` is 0), a SWAP right before or after a block on the "
"same pair is free: block and SWAP resynthesize into one two-qubit unitary. "
"On a path (line coupling graph) the routing problem then has an exact "
"combinatorial form.  Split the blocks into dependency layers (each a "
"matching of the qubits).  If all blocks of layer ``l`` execute while their "
"qubits sit next to each other, the arrangement ``σ_l`` is determined by the "
"*order of the blocks* only (the order inside a block is free), and the "
"fewest paid SWAPs between consecutive layers is their Kendall-τ distance "
"(inversion count, the bubble-sort distance)::"
msgstr ""
"当线路的每个两比特块都是一般 SU(4)（镜像代价 ``cz(U · SWAP) - cz(U)`` 为 0）"
"时，紧挨在同一比特对上某个块之前或之后的 SWAP 是免费的：块与 SWAP 重综合为一"
"个两比特酉。于是在路径（line 耦合图）上，路由问题有精确的组合形式。把块按依赖"
"分层（每层是比特的一个匹配）。若第 ``l`` 层的所有块都在其两个比特相邻时执行，"
"排列 ``σ_l`` 就只由*块的顺序*决定（块内顺序免费），相邻两层之间最少的付费 "
"SWAP 数就是它们的 Kendall-τ 距离（逆序数，即冒泡排序距离）::"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route:17
msgid ""
"Exhaustive search on small instances shows that this *aligned* schedule "
"loses nothing against arbitrary asynchronous routings, so routing becomes "
"the optimization of a chain of ordered partitions, ``min Σ_l d(σ_{l-1}, "
"σ_l)`` — a Kemeny-median-like problem.  With both neighbours fixed, re-"
"ordering one layer is a linear ordering problem (LOP) with weights ``w(A, "
"B)`` = inversions against both neighbours if block ``A`` precedes ``B``; it "
"is solved by insertion local search inside block coordinate descent over the "
"chain, followed by iterated local search (random kicks of a few consecutive "
"layers, local descent, keep if better). The SWAPs between layers come from "
"odd-even transposition sort, which swaps only inverted neighbours (so the "
"count is exactly the inversion number) in at most ``n`` rounds; the free "
"flips inside the previous layer's blocks are emitted right after those "
"blocks, where block consolidation absorbs them."
msgstr ""
"小规模穷举表明，这种*对齐*调度相对任意异步路由不损失任何东西，于是路由化为一"
"条有序划分链的优化 ``min Σ_l d(σ_{l-1}, σ_l)``——类似 Kemeny 中位排列问题。固"
"定两侧邻居时，重排一层是线性排序问题（LOP），权 ``w(A, B)`` 为块 ``A`` 排在 "
"``B`` 之前时与两侧邻居的逆序对数；在整条链上的块坐标下降中用插入式局部搜索求"
"解，之后再做迭代局部搜索（随机扰动几个连续层、局部下降、变好则保留）。层间的 "
"SWAP 由奇偶换位排序生成，它只交换逆序的相邻对（因此 SWAP 数恰为逆序数），至"
"多 ``n`` 轮；上一层块内的免费翻转紧跟在这些块之后发出，由块合并吸收。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route:31
msgid ""
"On QV-100 on a 100-qubit line this needs about 30 % fewer CZ than SABRE."
msgstr "在 100 比特 line 上的 QV-100 中，这比 SABRE 约少 30 % 的 CZ。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route:33
msgid ""
"On a *ring* the same chain model holds with the cyclic analogue of the "
"Kendall-τ distance: lift the ring to its universal cover (the integer line, "
"qubit ``t`` has a copy at ``x_t + k·n`` for every ``k``) and give every "
"qubit a lifted displacement ``δ_t ≡ y_t - x_t (mod n)`` with ``Σ δ_t = 0`` "
"(a SWAP moves one qubit by +1 and one by -1).  For given lifts the fewest "
"adjacent transpositions is the number of crossings of lifted copies (Jerrum "
"1985)::"
msgstr ""
"在 *环* 上同样的链模型成立，只是换成 Kendall-τ 距离的循环版本：把环提升到它的"
"万有覆盖（整数直线，比特 ``t`` 对每个 ``k`` 在 ``x_t + k·n`` 处各有一个副"
"本），给每个比特一个提升位移 ``δ_t ≡ y_t - x_t (mod n)``，满足 ``Σ δ_t = 0``"
"（一个 SWAP 让一个比特 +1、另一个 −1）。给定提升时，最少相邻交换数就是提升副"
"本之间的交叉数（Jerrum 1985）::"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route:42
msgid ""
"realized exactly by a periodic odd-even transposition sort.  With the "
"orientations inside the blocks fixed, the optimal lifts follow a threshold "
"rule (the ``K = Σ d_t / n`` qubits of largest forward displacement ``d_t`` "
"go backwards); the orientations and each layer's cyclic block order and "
"rotation are chosen by local search (see :func:`layer_route_events`)."
msgstr ""
"并由周期性的奇偶换位排序精确实现。块内朝向固定时，最优提升服从阈值规则（前向"
"位移 ``d_t`` 最大的 ``K = Σ d_t / n`` 个比特反向走）；朝向以及每层的循环块序"
"与旋转由局部搜索选择（见 :func:`layer_route_events`）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route:48
msgid ""
"On every other coupling graph (grids, heavy-hex, ...) no such exact chain "
"model is known: the aligned schedule turns each transition into a token "
"swapping problem, and on QV-100 / grid 10x10 even good token-swapping "
"heuristics need about 1.7 times the half total displacement D/2 of good "
"placement chains, more SWAPs than SABRE.  Instead :func:`su4_route_events` "
"routes asynchronously with a *truncated rollout* of SABRE's greedy policy "
"(approximate dynamic programming): every candidate SWAP is scored by its "
"SABRE cost plus the best SABRE cost one more SWAP ahead (ties go to the SWAP "
"whose qubits are free earliest, which keeps the routing shallow), and the "
"free SWAP of every executed block is used when it brings the qubits closer "
"to their next partners.  On QV-100 / grid 10x10 this needs about 6 % fewer "
"paid SWAPs than SABRE."
msgstr ""
"在其他耦合图（网格、heavy-hex 等）上没有这样精确的链模型：对齐调度把每次层间"
"转移变成一个 token swapping 问题，而在 QV-100 / 10x10 网格上，即使好的 token "
"swapping 启发式也需要好的布局链总位移之半 D/2 的约 1.7 倍，比 SABRE 用的 "
"SWAP 更多。因此 :func:`su4_route_events` 改用 SABRE 贪心策略的 *截断 "
"rollout* （近似动态规划）做异步路由：每个候选 SWAP 的分数是它的 SABRE 代价加"
"上再走一步 SWAP 后的最好 SABRE 代价（分数并列时取两个比特最早空闲的 SWAP，使"
"路由保持较浅）；每个块执行后，若交换其两个比特能让它们更接近下一个伙伴，就使"
"用这个免费的 SWAP。在 QV-100 / 10x10 网格上这比 SABRE 约少 6 % 的付费 SWAP。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route:61
msgid ""
"The routings are offered as extra candidates (:func:`layer_route_plan`); "
"they are only built when the circuit has no three-qubit nodes and every two-"
"qubit node is a generic SU(4) block."
msgstr ""
"这些路由作为额外候选提供（:func:`layer_route_plan`）；只有当线路没有三比特节"
"点且每个两比特节点都是一般 SU(4) 块时才构造。"

