msgstr "每层的迭代局部搜索扰动次数（上限为 ``MAX_PERTURBATIONS``）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.MAX_PERTURBATIONS:1
