msgid "Widths of the rollout's second-level expansion (1 means plain greedy)."
msgstr "rollout 第二层展开的宽度（1 表示普通贪心）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.ROLLOUT_WORK:1
msgid ""
"Random restarts of the rollout routing per width, ``ROLLOUT_WORK // blocks`` "
"clamped to ``[1, ROLLOUT_MAX_SEEDS]``."
msgstr ""
"每个宽度下 rollout 路由的随机重启次数：``ROLLOUT_WORK // blocks``，截断到 "
"``[1, ROLLOUT_MAX_SEEDS]``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.ROLLOUT_LAYOUT_ITERS:1
msgid "Forward/backward layout iterations of each rollout routing."
msgstr "每次 rollout 路由的前向 / 反向布局迭代次数。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.ROLLOUT_DEPTH_WEIGHT:1
msgid ""
"Restarts are ranked by ``paid SWAPs + ROLLOUT_DEPTH_WEIGHT * depth`` (depth "
"proxy: blocks and paid SWAPs one layer each)."
msgstr ""
"rollout 的各次重启按 ``付费 SWAP 数 + ROLLOUT_DEPTH_WEIGHT * 深度`` 排序（深"
"度代理：块与付费 SWAP 各占一层）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.ROLLOUT_MAX_BLOCKS:1
msgid "Largest circuit (blocks) routed by the rollout router."
msgstr "rollout 路由器处理的最大线路（块数）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.path_order:1
msgid "The vertices of a path graph in path order, or ``None``."
msgstr "路径图的顶点（按路径顺序），否则为 ``None``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.cycle_order:3
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.path_order:3
msgid "Neighbour sets of an undirected graph."
msgstr "无向图的邻居集合。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.path_order:5
msgid ""
"``[v_0, …, v_{n-1}]`` with ``v_i`` adjacent to ``v_{i+1}`` if the graph is a "
"single path (one vertex counts), else ``None``."
msgstr ""
"若图是一条路径（单个顶点也算），返回 ``[v_0, …, v_{n-1}]``，其中 ``v_i`` 与 "
"``v_{i+1}`` 相邻；否则为 ``None``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.cycle_order:1
msgid "The vertices of a cycle graph in cyclic order, or ``None``."
msgstr "环图的顶点（按循环顺序），否则为 ``None``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.cycle_order:5
msgid ""
"``[v_0, …, v_{n-1}]`` with ``v_i`` adjacent to ``v_{i+1 mod n}`` if the "
"graph is a single cycle of at least 3 vertices, else ``None``."
msgstr ""
"若图是一个至少 3 个顶点的单环，返回 ``[v_0, …, v_{n-1}]``，其中 ``v_i`` 与 "
"``v_{i+1 mod n}`` 相邻；否则为 ``None``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.block_layers:1
msgid "Dependency layers of the two-qubit nodes if layered routing applies."
msgstr "分层路由适用时两比特节点的依赖层。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.block_layers:3
msgid "Prepared routing input (block-node DAG with mirror costs)."
msgstr "准备好的路由输入（带镜像代价的块节点 DAG）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.block_layers:5
msgid ""
"``layers[l]`` = the two-qubit DAG nodes of layer ``l`` (longest path from "
"the inputs), or ``None`` if the DAG has three-qubit nodes, no two-qubit "
"node, or a two-qubit node that is not a generic SU(4) block (mirror cost "
"other than 0)."
msgstr ""
"``layers[l]`` 为第 ``l`` 层的两比特 DAG 节点（从输入起的最长路径）；若 DAG 含"
"三比特节点、没有两比特节点，或有不是一般 SU(4) 块的两比特节点（镜像代价不为 "
"0），则为 ``None``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.layer_route_events:1
msgid ""
"Layered routing of a prepared circuit on a path or a ring (module docs)."
msgstr "准备好的线路在路径或环上的分层路由（见模块文档）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.layer_route_events:3
msgid ""
"Router of the target (its coupling graph must be a path or a cycle of at "
"most ``RING_MAX_QUBITS`` vertices)."
msgstr ""
"目标的路由器（其耦合图必须是路径，或至多 ``RING_MAX_QUBITS`` 个顶点的环）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.layer_route_events:5
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.su4_route_events:8
msgid "Prepared routing input."
msgstr "准备好的路由输入。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.layer_route_events:6
msgid "Seed of the iterated local search."
msgstr "迭代局部搜索的种子。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.layer_route_events:7
msgid ""
"Kicks of the iterated local search (default ``PERTURBATIONS_PER_LAYER`` per "
"layer, at most ``MAX_PERTURBATIONS``; on rings "
"``RING_PERTURBATIONS_PER_LAYER`` and ``RING_MAX_PERTURBATIONS``)."
msgstr ""
"迭代局部搜索的扰动次数（默认每层 ``PERTURBATIONS_PER_LAYER`` 次，至多 "
"``MAX_PERTURBATIONS``；环上为 ``RING_PERTURBATIONS_PER_LAYER`` 与 "
"``RING_MAX_PERTURBATIONS``）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.layer_route_events:12
msgid ""
"``(layout, events, paid_swaps)`` — full start permutation ``layout[token] = "
"physical``, routing events, and the number of SWAPs not absorbed by a block "
"— or ``None`` if layered routing does not apply or the native core is "
"missing."
msgstr ""
"``(layout, events, paid_swaps)``——完整的起始置换 ``layout[token] = "
"physical``、路由事件，以及未被块吸收的 SWAP 数；若分层路由不适用或缺少原生核"
"心，则为 ``None``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.su4_route_events:1
msgid "Truncated-rollout routing of an SU(4)-block circuit (see module docs)."
msgstr "SU(4) 块线路的截断 rollout 路由（见模块文档）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.su4_route_events:3
msgid ""
"Applies to any connected coupling graph.  The routing starts from ``layout`` "
"and from ``layout_iters`` forward/backward refinements of it and keeps the "
"start with the fewest paid SWAPs."
msgstr ""
"适用于任意连通耦合图。路由分别从 ``layout`` 及其 ``layout_iters`` 次前向 / 反"
"向精化出发，保留付费 SWAP 最少的起点。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.su4_route_events:10
msgid "Seed of the tie-breaking."
msgstr "打破平局用的随机种子。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.su4_route_events:11
msgid "Candidates expanded one SWAP further (``1``: plain greedy)."
msgstr "再向前展开一个 SWAP 的候选数（``1``：普通贪心）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.su4_route_events:12
msgid "Forward/backward layout iterations (default ``ROLLOUT_LAYOUT_ITERS``)."
msgstr "前向 / 反向布局迭代次数（默认 ``ROLLOUT_LAYOUT_ITERS``）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.su4_route_events:15
msgid ""
"``(layout, events, paid_swaps)`` as :func:`layer_route_events`, or ``None`` "
"if the circuit is not an SU(4)-block circuit (or too large) or the native "
"core is missing."
msgstr ""
"与 :func:`layer_route_events` 相同的 ``(layout, events, paid_swaps)``；若线路"
"不是 SU(4) 块线路（或过大）或缺少原生核心，则为 ``None``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.layer_route_plan:1
msgid "Best layered / rollout routing of ``base``'s circuit as a candidate."
msgstr "把 ``base`` 线路最好的分层 / rollout 路由作为候选。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.layer_route_plan:3
msgid ""
"On a path or a ring the layered chain routing (:func:`layer_route_events`) "
"is built; on every topology except a path the truncated-rollout routing "
"(:func:`su4_route_events`, widths ``ROLLOUT_WIDTHS``, a few seeds depending "
"on the circuit size) starts from ``base``'s layout.  The plan with the "
"fewest estimated two-qubit gates is returned."
msgstr ""
"在路径或环上构造分层链路由（:func:`layer_route_events`）；在除路径以外的所有"
"拓扑上，截断 rollout 路由（:func:`su4_route_events`，宽度 "
"``ROLLOUT_WIDTHS``，随线路规模取若干个种子）从 ``base`` 的布局出发。返回估计"
"双比特门数最少的方案。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.layer_route_plan:10
msgid "Candidate whose preparation (block-node DAG) is routed."
msgstr "要路由其准备结果（块节点 DAG）的候选。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.layer_route_plan:11
msgid "Seed of the local searches."
msgstr "局部搜索的随机种子。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_layer_route.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._layer_route.layer_route_plan:13
msgid ""
"A plan labelled ``layers/<base label>`` or ``rollout/<base label>`` (never "
"the default), or ``None`` if no such routing applies."
msgstr ""
"标签为 ``layers/<base label>`` 或 ``rollout/<base label>`` 的方案（从不是默认"
"候选）；若没有适用的路由则为 ``None``。"

#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:216
msgid "Transpiler: SABRE Routing Core"
msgstr "Transpiler：SABRE 路由核心"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing:1
msgid ""
"Unified SABRE routing core (two- and three-qubit nodes, any routing DAG)."
msgstr "统一的 SABRE 路由核心（两比特与三比特节点，任意路由 DAG）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing:3
msgid ""
"One routing pass of :class:`~quspect.transpiler.SABRE` — front layer, "
"bounded extended set, decay, optional SWAP-fusion bonus, seeded random tie-"
"breaking and the release valve — is implemented once here, "
"in :func:`route_dag`, for every kind of routing DAG the mapper builds:"
msgstr ""
":class:`~quspect.transpiler.SABRE` 的一次路由遍历——前沿层、有界扩展集、衰减、"
"可选的 SWAP 融合奖励、带种子的随机打破平局以及释放阀——只在这里实现一次"
"（:func:`route_dag`），适用于映射器构建的所有路由 DAG："

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing:8
msgid "plain dependency DAGs of two-qubit gates and measurements;"
msgstr "由两比特门和测量组成的普通依赖 DAG；"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing:9
msgid ""
"DAGs with three-qubit ``ccx`` nodes (routed as one unit, "
"see :mod:`quspect.transpiler._toffoli`);"
msgstr ""
"含三比特 ``ccx`` 节点的 DAG（作为一个整体路由，"
"见 :mod:`quspect.transpiler._toffoli`）；"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing:11
msgid ""
"commutation-aware DAGs, where several front-layer nodes may share a qubit."
msgstr "对易感知 DAG：多个前沿层节点可以共享同一个比特。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing:15
msgid "Extension points"
msgstr "扩展点"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing:17
msgid ""
"The loop is written around a few small, separately documented pieces so that "
"new node kinds or scoring terms do not need another copy of it:"
msgstr ""
"主循环围绕几个小的、分别说明的部件编写，因此新的节点类型或计分项不需要再复制"
"一份循环："

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing:20
msgid ""
"**Node cost**: the distance term of a node.  A two-qubit node costs ``D[pa]"
"[pb]``; a three-qubit node costs the size of the smallest tree spanning its "
"three physical qubits minus one (:func:`cost3`), so a node is executable iff "
"its cost is ``1``.  Two-qubit nodes take an inlined fast path; a node with "
"``dag.nq3[n] >= 0`` goes through the generic three-qubit path (exact cost "
"change per candidate SWAP)."
msgstr ""
"**节点代价**：节点的距离项。两比特节点的代价为 ``D[pa][pb]``；三比特节点的代"
"价为连接其三个物理比特的最小生成树的大小减一（:func:`cost3`），因此节点可执行"
"当且仅当其代价为 ``1``。两比特节点走内联的快速路径；``dag.nq3[n] >= 0`` 的节"
"点走通用的三比特路径（对每个候选 SWAP 精确计算代价变化）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing:26
msgid ""
"**Front / lookahead bookkeeping**: per logical token, the front-layer two-"
"qubit nodes (``front2``) and three-qubit nodes (``front3``) on it, and the "
"other endpoints of its front-layer (``fpart``) and extended-set "
"(``partners``) two-qubit nodes.  Lists rather than single slots, so a "
"commutation-aware DAG may put several front nodes on one qubit."
msgstr ""
"**前沿 / 前瞻记录**：每个逻辑比特上的前沿层两比特节点（``front2``）与三比特节"
"点（``front3``），以及它的前沿层（``fpart``）和扩展集（``partners``）两比特节"
"点的另一端。使用列表而不是单个槽位，因此对易感知 DAG 可以在一个比特上放多个前"
"沿节点。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing:31
msgid ""
"**Candidate scoring**: candidate SWAPs come from a per-qubit table of "
"coupling edges (:func:`incident_edges`), merged in front-layer order. For "
"every token with two-qubit partners, a lazily built *delta table* holds, per "
"neighbouring physical qubit ``z``, the change of its front and extended-set "
"distance sums if it moved to ``z``; a table is dropped as soon as the token, "
"one of its partners, or its partner lists change, so most candidates are "
"scored with two table lookups."
msgstr ""
"**候选计分**：候选 SWAP 来自按物理比特预先建好的耦合边表"
"（:func:`incident_edges`），按前沿层顺序合并。对每个有两比特伙伴的逻辑比特，"
"惰性构建的 *增量表* 对每个相邻物理比特 ``z`` 记录该比特移到 ``z`` 时其前沿与"
"扩展集距离之和的变化；一旦该比特、它的某个伙伴或它的伙伴列表发生变化，表即失"
"效，因此大多数候选只需两次查表即可计分。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing:38
msgid ""
"**Score modifiers**: the raw lookahead score is multiplied by the decay "
"factor of the SWAP and, with a SWAP-fusion bonus, by ``1 - bonus`` when the "
"SWAP's pair just executed the same two-qubit node."
msgstr ""
"**计分修正**：原始前瞻分数乘以该 SWAP 的衰减因子；启用 SWAP 融合奖励时，若该 "
"SWAP 所在比特对刚执行过同一个两比特节点，再乘以 ``1 - bonus``。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing:41
msgid ""
"**Mirror gates** (``router.mirror_gates`` and a DAG annotated by "
"``_annotate_mirror_costs``): after a round of executions, every executed "
"node that ends its pair block (and is still the last node on both its "
"qubits) may be followed by a SWAP on the same pair for its *mirror cost* "
"``cz(U · SWAP) - cz(U)`` (0 for a generic SU(4) block).  The SWAP is "
"inserted when exchanging the two logical qubits lowers the front + extended-"
"set score (no decay) by more than ``mirror_threshold + mirror_cz_penalty * "
"cost``.  Search SWAPs on such a pair are counted at the mirror cost, and the "
"SWAP-fusion discount becomes ``bonus * (3 - cost) / 3``.  "
"``_RouteResult.swap_cost`` sums the CZ cost of all SWAPs (``3 * num_swaps`` "
"without mirror gates)."
msgstr ""
"**镜像门**\\ （``router.mirror_gates`` 以及经 ``_annotate_mirror_costs`` 标注"
"的 DAG）：每轮执行之后，每个结束其比特对块（且仍是其两个比特上最后一个节点）"
"的已执行节点之后都可以跟一个同对 SWAP，其代价为该块的\\ *镜像代价* ``cz(U · "
"SWAP) - cz(U)``\\ （通用 SU(4) 块为 0）。当交换这两个逻辑比特能使前沿 + 扩展"
"集分数（不含衰减）下降超过 ``mirror_threshold + mirror_cz_penalty * cost`` 时"
"插入该 SWAP。搜索中落在这类比特对上的 SWAP 按镜像代价计数，SWAP 融合折扣变为 "
"``bonus * (3 - cost) / 3``。``_RouteResult.swap_cost`` 累加所有 SWAP 的 CZ 代"
"价（不启用镜像门时为 ``3 * num_swaps``）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing:52
msgid ""
"**Release valve**: force-routes the cheapest front-layer node along shortest "
"paths (both ends of a two-qubit node walk towards each other; the two outer "
"qubits of a three-qubit node walk to the middle one)."
msgstr ""
"**释放阀**：沿最短路径强制路由代价最小的前沿层节点（两比特节点的两端相向移"
"动；三比特节点外侧的两个比特向中间比特移动）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing:56
msgid ""
"All arithmetic on distances is integer, so the order in which the per-node "
"contributions are summed never changes a score; the floating-point score "
"expression and the candidate order are fixed, and ties are broken with the "
"caller's random source.  The routing is therefore a deterministic function "
"of ``(layout, dag, direction, rng state)``."
msgstr ""
"所有距离运算都是整数运算，因此各节点贡献的求和顺序不会改变分数；浮点计分表达"
"式与候选顺序是固定的，平局用调用方提供的随机源打破。因此路由结果是 "
"``(layout, dag, 方向, 随机源状态)`` 的确定性函数。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing:63
msgid "Native core"
msgstr "原生核心"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing:65
msgid ""
"The same loop is implemented in C++ (``cpp/src/transpiler/"
"sabre_routing.cpp``, exposed by the ``quspect._core_*`` extension "
"module).  :func:`route_dag` uses it automatically when the extension is "
"built and falls back to the pure-Python reference implementation otherwise.  "
"The native core is bit-identical to the Python one: it walks the front layer "
"and candidate SWAPs in the same order, keeps the floating-point score "
"expression (no FMA contraction), and reproduces CPython's Mersenne Twister "
"and ``Random.choice`` exactly — the caller's :class:`random.Random` state is "
"handed to C++ and the advanced state written back, so later draws are "
"unchanged.  Set the environment variable ``QUSPECT_ROUTING_BACKEND`` to "
"``python`` to force the reference implementation, or to ``native`` to "
"require the native core (``auto``, the default, picks native when available)."
msgstr ""
"同一个主循环也用 C++ 实现（``cpp/src/transpiler/sabre_routing.cpp``，由扩展模"
"块 ``quspect._core_*`` 导出）。扩展模块已构建时 :func:`route_dag` 自动使用"
"它，否则回退到纯 Python 参考实现。原生核心与 Python 实现逐位一致：以相同顺序"
"遍历前沿层与候选 SWAP，保持浮点计分表达式不变（不做 FMA 合并），并精确复现 "
"CPython 的梅森旋转算法与 ``Random.choice``——调用方 :class:`random.Random` 的"
"状态传入 C++，推进后的状态再写回，因此之后的抽样不受影响。把环境变量 "
"``QUSPECT_ROUTING_BACKEND`` 设为 ``python`` 可强制使用参考实现，设为 "
"``native`` 则要求使用原生核心（默认 ``auto``：可用时选择原生核心）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing.ROUTING_BACKEND_ENV:1
msgid "Name of the environment variable that selects the routing core."
msgstr "选择路由核心的环境变量名。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing.ROUTING_BACKEND_ENV:3
msgid ""
"Values: ``auto`` (default; native when available), ``native`` or ``python``. "
"It is read on every :func:`route_dag` call."
msgstr ""
"取值：``auto`` （默认；可用时使用原生核心）、``native`` 或 ``python``。每次调"
"用 :func:`route_dag` 时读取。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing.cost3:1
msgid "Routing cost of a three-qubit node on physical qubits ``pa, pb, pc``."
msgstr "三比特节点位于物理比特 ``pa, pb, pc`` 时的路由代价。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing.cost3:3
msgid ""
"The smallest tree spanning three vertices of a graph whose shortest paths "
"meet is ``min`` over the middle vertex of the two distances to the others; "
"``1`` means the three qubits are connected (a path or a triangle), like the "
"distance of an executable two-qubit gate."
msgstr ""
"在最短路径相交的图上，连接三个顶点的最小树等于对中间顶点取到另外两点距离之和"
"的 ``min``；``1`` 表示三个比特连通（一条路径或一个三角形），与可执行两比特门"
"的距离含义相同。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing.cost3:8
msgid "All-pairs distance matrix."
msgstr "全源最短距离矩阵。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing.cost3:9
msgid "Physical qubit of the first control."
msgstr "第一个控制位所在的物理比特。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing.cost3:10
msgid "Physical qubit of the second control."
msgstr "第二个控制位所在的物理比特。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
