msgstr ""
"``out[p]`` 按邻居顺序把 ``p`` 的每条耦合边的 ``code = x * n + y`` 映射到 "
"``(x, y)`` （``x < y``）；:func:`route_dag` 通过合并这些字典构建有序的候选"
"集。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing.incident_edges:7
