msgid ""
"Every SWAP candidate touches a physical qubit of a front-layer node and is "
"scored by::"
msgstr "每个候选 SWAP 都涉及某个前沿层节点的物理比特，其分数为::"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing.route_dag:9
msgid ""
"where ``cost`` is the node cost (see the module documentation) and "
"``fusion`` is ``1 - bonus`` for a SWAP on a pair whose last operation was "
