msgstr "路由 DAG（``nq1[n] < 0``：测量；``nq3[n] >= 0``：三比特节点）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._routing.route_dag:24
msgid "Traverse the DAG forwards (``True``) or reversed."
msgstr "正向（``True``）或反向遍历 DAG。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_routing.py:docstring of
