#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:222
msgid "Transpiler: High-Level Optimization"
msgstr "转译器：高层优化"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_highlevel.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._highlevel:1
msgid "High-level (pre-decomposition) optimization of multi-qubit gates."
msgstr "多比特门的高层（分解前）优化。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_highlevel.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._highlevel:3
msgid ""
":class:`HighLevelOptimizePass` cancels pairs of identical self-inverse multi-"
"qubit gates (``ccx``, ``cx``, ``cz``, ``swap``) *before* they are "
"decomposed.  Once a Toffoli is lowered to CX and T gates, ``ccx · ccx`` no "
"longer looks like an identity to peephole passes (twelve CZ remain), while "
"at this level it is a plain cancellation."
msgstr ""
":class:`HighLevelOptimizePass` 在分解 *之前* 消去成对的相同自逆多比特门"
"（``ccx``、``cx``、``cz``、``swap``）。Toffoli 一旦被降为 CX 和 T 门，``ccx "
"· ccx`` 对窥孔优化来说就不再像恒等（仍剩十二个 CZ），而在这一层它只是一次简单"
"的消去。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_highlevel.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._highlevel:9
msgid ""
"The pair may be separated by gates that commute with it.  Commutation is "
"decided by a per-qubit rule that is exact (sufficient, never wrong): two "
"gates commute if, on every qubit they share, both act diagonally in the same "
"basis — ``Z`` (e.g. a control, ``rz``, ``t``, either qubit of ``cz``) or "
"``X`` (e.g. a CX/Toffoli target, ``x``, ``rx``).  For instance ``ccx(0, 1, "
"2) · t(0) · cx(3, 2) · ccx(0, 1, 2)`` reduces to ``t(0) · cx(3, 2)`` (``t`` "
"acts diagonally on the control, and qubit 2 is the target of both the "
"Toffoli and the CX)."
msgstr ""
"成对的门之间可以隔着与它们对易的门。对易性由逐比特规则判定，该规则是精确的"
"（充分条件，绝不会误判）：若两个门在每个共享比特上都在同一基下对角——``Z``\\ "
"（例如控制位、``rz``、``t``、``cz`` 的任一比特）或 ``X``\\ （例如 CX/Toffoli "
"的目标位、``x``、``rx``）——则二者对易。例如 ``ccx(0, 1, 2) · t(0) · cx(3, 2) "
"· ccx(0, 1, 2)`` 化简为 ``t(0) · cx(3, 2)``\\ （``t`` 在控制位上对角，而比特 "
"2 同时是 Toffoli 和 CX 的目标位）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_highlevel.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._highlevel.HighLevelOptimizePass:1
msgid "Cancel self-inverse multi-qubit gate pairs before decomposition."
msgstr "在分解前消去成对的自逆多比特门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_highlevel.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._highlevel.HighLevelOptimizePass:3
msgid ""
"For each ``ccx``, ``cx``, ``cz`` or ``swap`` the pass scans backwards (at "
"most ``window`` gates) over gates that commute with it — disjoint gates, or "
"gates diagonal in the same basis on every shared qubit — and removes it "
"together with an identical earlier gate (Toffoli controls and the ``cz``/"
"``swap`` operands may appear in either order).  A measurement, barrier, "
"channel or non-commuting gate on a shared qubit stops the scan.  Removals "
"cascade: ``ccx · cx · cx · ccx`` is removed completely."
msgstr ""
"对每个 ``ccx``、``cx``、``cz`` 或 ``swap``，该 pass 向前回溯（至多 "
"``window`` 个门），越过与之对易的门——不相交的门，或在每个共享比特上同基对角的"
"门——并将它与一个相同的更早的门一起删除（Toffoli 的控制位以及 ``cz``/``swap`` "
"的操作数顺序不限）。共享比特上的测量、屏障、噪声通道或不对易的门会终止扫描。"
"删除可以级联：``ccx · cx · cx · ccx`` 会被完全删除。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_highlevel.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._highlevel.HighLevelOptimizePass:12
msgid ""
"The rewrite is exact (the unitary is unchanged, global phase included) and "
"never increases the gate count.  Run it "
"before :class:`~quspect.transpiler._passes.DecomposePass`."
msgstr ""
"该改写是精确的（酉矩阵不变，包括全局相位），且不会增加门数。应"
"在 :class:`~quspect.transpiler._passes.DecomposePass` 之前运行。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_highlevel.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._highlevel.HighLevelOptimizePass:16
msgid ""
"Maximum number of instructions scanned backwards for a partner (at least 1)."
msgstr "为寻找配对门向前回溯扫描的最大指令数（至少为 1）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_highlevel.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._highlevel.HighLevelOptimizePass:19
msgid "If ``window`` is smaller than 1."
msgstr "``window`` 小于 1 时。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_highlevel.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._highlevel.HighLevelOptimizePass.run:1
msgid "Return a copy of ``circuit`` with cancelling pairs removed."
msgstr "返回删除了可消去门对的 ``circuit`` 副本。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_highlevel.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._highlevel.HighLevelOptimizePass.run:3
msgid ""
"Circuit to optimize (any gates; unknown gates simply block the scan on their "
"qubits)."
msgstr "待优化的线路（可含任意门；未知门只会在其比特上阻断扫描）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_highlevel.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._highlevel.HighLevelOptimizePass.run:6
msgid ""
"A new :class:`~quspect.circuit.circuit.QuantumCircuit` (the input is not "
"modified)."
msgstr ""
"新的 :class:`~quspect.circuit.circuit.QuantumCircuit`\\ （不修改输入）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_highlevel.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._highlevel.HighLevelStats:1
msgid "Statistics of the last :meth:`HighLevelOptimizePass.run` call."
msgstr "最近一次 :meth:`HighLevelOptimizePass.run` 调用的统计信息。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_highlevel.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._highlevel.HighLevelStats:5
msgid "Number of gate pairs removed, by gate name."
msgstr "按门名统计的已删除门对数。"

#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:228
msgid "Transpiler: Phase Folding"
msgstr "Transpiler：相位折叠"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold:1
msgid "Phase folding: merge diagonal rotations that act on the same parity."
msgstr "相位折叠：合并作用于同一奇偶性的对角旋转。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold:3
msgid ""
":class:`PhaseFoldingPass` is the rotation-merging step of phase-polynomial "
"optimization (Amy–Maslov–Mosca \"T-par\" phase folding; Nam et al. 2018, "
"arXiv:1710.07345, \"rotation merging\").  It tracks, for every qubit, the "
"affine Boolean function ``L(v) ⊕ c`` of *path variables* ``v`` that the "
"qubit holds in the computational basis:"
msgstr ""
":class:`PhaseFoldingPass` 是相位多项式优化中的旋转合并步骤（Amy–Maslov–Mosca "
"的“T-par”相位折叠；Nam 等，2018，arXiv:1710.07345，“rotation merging”）。它为"
"每个量子比特跟踪该比特在计算基下所携带的、关于 *路径变量* ``v`` 的仿射布尔函"
"数 ``L(v) ⊕ c``："

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold:9
msgid "every qubit starts with its own variable;"
msgstr "每个量子比特起始时都拥有自己的变量；"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold:10
msgid ""
"``cx`` XORs the control's function into the target, ``x``/``y`` flip the "
"constant, ``swap`` exchanges two functions;"
msgstr ""
"``cx`` 把控制位的函数异或到目标位上，``x``/``y`` 翻转常数项，``swap`` 交换两"
"个函数；"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold:12
msgid ""
"diagonal gates (``cz``, ``cp``, ``crz``, ``rzz``, ``ccz``…) leave the "
"functions unchanged;"
msgstr "对角门（``cz``、``cp``、``crz``、``rzz``、``ccz``…）不改变这些函数；"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold:14
msgid ""
"any other gate (``h``, ``rx``, ``u3``, the target of a ``ccx``…) gives each "
"qubit it changes a fresh variable."
msgstr ""
"其他任何门（``h``、``rx``、``u3``、``ccx`` 的目标位…）都会为其改变的每个量子"
"比特赋予一个新变量。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold:17
msgid ""
"In the sum-over-paths form of the circuit, a diagonal single-qubit rotation "
"``p(θ)`` on a qubit holding ``L ⊕ c`` contributes the phase factor ``e^{iθ(L "
"⊕ c)}``, which only depends on the path.  Two rotations whose qubits hold "
"the same ``L`` (at different times, possibly on different qubits) can "
"therefore be merged into one rotation at the position of the first, and a "
"rotation (merged or not) disappears when its angle is a multiple of ``2π``.  "
"The rewrite is exact up to a global phase, never adds gates and never moves "
"or touches a multi-qubit gate.  Typical gains: the ``cx·rz(θ)·cx·rz(−θ)`` "
"remnants of decomposed multi-controlled phases (e.g. ``crz(4π)`` or ``mcp`` "
"with angles that are multiples of ``2π``), and T/T† pairs of adjacent "
"Toffoli decompositions."
msgstr ""
"在线路的路径求和（sum-over-paths）形式中，作用于携带 ``L ⊕ c`` 的量子比特上的"
"对角单比特旋转 ``p(θ)`` 贡献相位因子 ``e^{iθ(L ⊕ c)}``，它只依赖于路径。因"
"此，所在量子比特携带相同 ``L`` 的两个旋转（可以在不同时刻、甚至不同量子比特"
"上）可以合并为位于第一个旋转处的一个旋转；而角度为 ``2π`` 整数倍的旋转（无论"
"是否经过合并）会被删除。该改写在相差全局相位的意义下是精确的，绝不增加门，也"
"绝不移动或改动任何多比特门。典型收益：分解后的多控相位门留下的 "
"``cx·rz(θ)·cx·rz(−θ)`` 残余（例如 ``crz(4π)``，或角度为 ``2π`` 整数倍的 "
"``mcp``），以及相邻 Toffoli 分解中的 T/T† 对。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold:29
msgid ""
"Run it on a circuit whose two-qubit gates are ``cx`` and diagonal gates "
"(e.g. after decomposing to ``{cx, h, rz, …}``); a ``cx`` written as "
"``h·cz·h`` hides the parity structure.  Follow it with a commutation-aware "
"CX cancellation (:class:`~quspect.transpiler.HighLevelOptimizePass`): once "
"the rotations between them are gone, CX pairs that share a target or a "
"control cancel."
msgstr ""
"请在双比特门只有 ``cx`` 和对角门的线路上运行它（例如分解到 ``{cx, h, rz, …}"
"`` 之后）；写成 ``h·cz·h`` 的 ``cx`` 会掩盖奇偶结构。之后应接一次对易感知的 "
"CX 消去（:class:`~quspect.transpiler.HighLevelOptimizePass`）：一旦它们之间的"
"旋转被消除，共享目标位或控制位的 CX 对就会相互抵消。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold.PhaseFoldingPass:1
msgid "Merge diagonal rotations acting on the same parity (phase folding)."
msgstr "合并作用于同一奇偶性的对角旋转（相位折叠）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold.PhaseFoldingPass:3
msgid ""
"See the module docstring for the algorithm.  The pass is a single linear "
"sweep; parities are Python integers used as bit sets over the path "
"variables.  Measurements, resets, barriers and noise channels end all "
"merging (rotations are never moved across them)."
msgstr ""
"算法详见模块文档字符串。该 pass 只做一次线性扫描；奇偶性用 Python 整数表示，"
"作为路径变量上的位集合。测量、重置、屏障和噪声信道会终止所有合并（旋转绝不会"
"被移过它们）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold.PhaseFoldingPass:8
msgid ""
"Merged rotations are emitted as ``rz`` with an angle in ``(−π, π]``; a "
"rotation that was not merged with any other is kept unchanged unless it is "
"an identity up to global phase (e.g. ``rz(4π)``), which is removed."
msgstr ""
"合并后的旋转以 ``rz`` 形式输出，角度位于 ``(−π, π]``；未与其他旋转合并的旋转"
"保持不变，除非它在相差全局相位的意义下是恒等操作（例如 ``rz(4π)``），此时会被"
"删除。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold.PhaseFoldingPass.run:1
msgid "Return a copy of ``circuit`` with same-parity rotations merged."
msgstr "返回合并了同奇偶性旋转的 ``circuit`` 副本。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold.PhaseFoldingPass.run:3
msgid ""
"Circuit to optimize (any instructions; unknown gates are handled as basis "
"changes on their qubits)."
msgstr "待优化的线路（可含任意指令；未知门被视为其比特上的基变换）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold.PhaseFoldingPass.run:6
msgid ""
"A new circuit, equal to ``circuit`` up to global phase, with no more gates "
"than the input."
msgstr ""
"一个新线路，在相差全局相位的意义下与 ``circuit`` 等价，且门数不多于输入线路。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold.PhaseFoldingStats:1
msgid "Counters of the last :meth:`PhaseFoldingPass.run`."
msgstr "描述上一次 :meth:`PhaseFoldingPass.run` 所做工作的计数器。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold.PhaseFoldingStats:5
msgid "Diagonal single-qubit rotations seen."
msgstr "遇到的对角单比特旋转数。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_phase_fold.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._phase_fold.PhaseFoldingStats:11
msgid "Rotations left after merging."
msgstr "合并后剩余的旋转数。"

#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:235
msgid "Transpiler: Three-Qubit Block Resynthesis"
msgstr "Transpiler：三比特块重综合"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit:1
msgid "Three-qubit block consolidation and resynthesis."
msgstr "三比特块合并与重综合。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit:3
msgid ""
":class:`ThreeQubitBlockPass` collects maximal runs of gates confined to "
"three qubits, multiplies them into an ``8×8`` unitary and resynthesizes it "
"with a quantum Shannon decomposition (Shende–Bullock–Markov 2006, quant-ph/"
"0406176), keeping the replacement only when it needs fewer two-qubit gates "
"than the run (estimated after two-qubit block resynthesis)."
msgstr ""
":class:`ThreeQubitBlockPass` 收集局限于三个量子比特上的最长门连续段，把它们相"
"乘得到一个 ``8×8`` 酉矩阵，再用量子 Shannon 分解（Shende–Bullock–Markov "
"2006，quant-ph/0406176）对其重综合；仅当替换所需的双比特门少于原连续段（按双"
"比特块重综合后的估计）时才保留替换。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit:10
msgid "Two constructions are tried:"
msgstr "会尝试两种构造："

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit:12
msgid ""
"**Controlled / multiplexed two-qubit unitary.**  If the block is block-"
"diagonal with respect to one of its qubits ``c`` (``|0⟩⟨0| ⊗ A + |1⟩⟨1| ⊗ "
"B``, e.g. a controlled-``U^(2^k)`` of phase estimation, whatever the number "
"of repetitions), it is *demultiplexed*: ``A = V·D·W`` and ``B = V·D†·W`` "
"with ``A B† = V D² V†`` (an eigen decomposition), so the block is ``W`` (two-"
"qubit, ≤ 3 CZ), a multiplexed ``Rz`` on ``c`` selected by the other two "
"qubits (4 CX, Gray code) and ``V`` (≤ 3 CZ): at most 10 two-qubit gates."
msgstr ""
"**受控/多路复用的两比特酉矩阵。** 若该块相对于其某个量子比特 ``c`` 是块对角的"
"（``|0⟩⟨0| ⊗ A + |1⟩⟨1| ⊗ B``，例如相位估计中的受控 ``U^(2^k)``，无论重复多少"
"次），就对其进行 *解复用*：``A = V·D·W`` 且 ``B = V·D†·W``，其中 ``A B† = V "
"D² V†``\\ （一个本征分解），于是该块由 ``W``\\ （两比特，≤ 3 个 CZ）、由另外"
"两个量子比特选择的作用于 ``c`` 的多路复用 ``Rz``\\ （4 个 CX，Gray 码）以及 "
"``V``\\ （≤ 3 个 CZ）组成：至多 10 个双比特门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit:20
msgid ""
"**General block.**  A cosine–sine decomposition splits the block into two "
"multiplexed two-qubit unitaries around a multiplexed ``Ry`` (4 CX); both "
"multiplexors are demultiplexed as above, at most 24 two-qubit gates."
msgstr ""
"**一般块。** 余弦–正弦分解（cosine–sine decomposition）把该块拆分为围绕一个多"
"路复用 ``Ry``\\ （4 个 CX）的两个多路复用两比特酉矩阵；两个多路复用器都按上述"
"方法解复用，至多 24 个双比特门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit:24
msgid ""
"Every replacement is verified on the emitted gates: the product of the "
"emitted gate matrices must equal the block unitary up to global phase with "
"``max|U − e^{iφ}V| ≤ 1e-9`` (phase-aligned, element-wise), otherwise the "
"block is kept.  The emitted gates are ``cx``, ``ry``, ``rz`` and the ``{cz, "
"h, rz, x}`` gates of the two-qubit synthesis; decompose afterwards."
msgstr ""
"每个替换都会在输出的门上进行验证：输出门矩阵的乘积必须在相差全局相位的意义下"
"等于块酉矩阵，满足 ``max|U − e^{iφ}V| ≤ 1e-9``\\ （相位对齐后逐元素比较），否"
"则保留原块。输出的门为 ``cx``、``ry``、``rz`` 以及两比特综合所用的 ``{cz, h, "
"rz, x}`` 门；之后需再进行分解。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit.ThreeQubitBlockPass:1
msgid "Resynthesize three-qubit blocks with a quantum Shannon decomposition."
msgstr "用量子 Shannon 分解重综合三比特块。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit.ThreeQubitBlockPass:3
msgid ""
"The pass sweeps the instruction list once, growing blocks of gates that act "
"within one set of at most three qubits (single-qubit gates on a free qubit "
"open a one-qubit block; blocks on disjoint qubits are merged when a gate "
"joins them and the union has at most three qubits).  A gate that does not "
"fit closes the blocks it touches.  Measurements, barriers, noise channels, "
"symbolic parameters and gates on more than three qubits are boundaries."
msgstr ""
"该 pass 对指令列表扫描一次，不断扩展作用于同一组至多三个量子比特之内的门块"
"（空闲比特上的单比特门会开启一个单比特块；当某个门连接作用于互不相交比特的若"
"干块且其并集至多含三个比特时，这些块会被合并）。放不进当前块的门会关闭它所涉"
"及的块。测量、屏障、噪声信道、符号参数以及作用于三个以上量子比特的门都是边"
"界。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit.ThreeQubitBlockPass:11
msgid ""
"Each closed three-qubit block whose estimated cost (two-qubit gates after "
"two-qubit block resynthesis, ``ccx`` = 6) is at least 8 is resynthesized "
"with :func:`synthesize_three_qubit`; the replacement is kept only if it has "
"strictly fewer two-qubit gates.  Replaced blocks are emitted at the position "
"of their last gate."
msgstr ""
"每个已关闭、且估计代价（双比特块重综合后的双比特门数，``ccx`` 计 6）至少为 8 "
"的三比特块，都会用 :func:`synthesize_three_qubit` 重综合；仅当替换的双比特门"
"严格更少时才保留。被替换的块在其最后一个门的位置输出。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit.ThreeQubitBlockPass.run:1
msgid "Return a copy of ``circuit`` with three-qubit blocks resynthesized."
msgstr "返回对三比特块进行重综合后的 ``circuit`` 副本。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit.ThreeQubitBlockPass.run:3
msgid "Circuit to optimize (not modified)."
msgstr "待优化的线路（不会被修改）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit.ThreeQubitBlockPass.run:5
msgid "A new circuit, equal to ``circuit`` up to global phase."
msgstr "一个新线路，在相差全局相位的意义下与 ``circuit`` 等价。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit.ThreeQubitBlockStats:1
msgid "Counters of the last :meth:`ThreeQubitBlockPass.run`."
msgstr "描述上一次 :meth:`ThreeQubitBlockPass.run` 所做工作的计数器。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit.ThreeQubitBlockStats:5
msgid "Three-qubit blocks above the cost threshold."
msgstr "代价超过阈值的三比特块数。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit.ThreeQubitBlockStats:17
msgid "Estimated two-qubit cost of the replaced blocks."
msgstr "被替换块的估计双比特代价。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit.ThreeQubitBlockStats:23
msgid "Two-qubit gates of their replacements."
msgstr "其替换中的双比特门数。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit.synthesize_three_qubit:1
msgid "Shannon-decompose an ``8×8`` unitary (local qubit 0 = high bit)."
msgstr "对 ``8×8`` 酉矩阵做 Shannon 分解（局部量子比特 0 为最高位）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit.synthesize_three_qubit:3
msgid ""
"Tries the demultiplexing of a block-diagonal unitary for each choice of the "
"select qubit, then the general cosine–sine construction, and returns the "
"cheapest verified gate list (``None`` if none verifies)."
msgstr ""
"依次以每个量子比特作为选择比特，尝试块对角酉矩阵的解复用，再尝试一般的余弦–正"
"弦构造，返回通过验证的代价最低的门列表（若都未通过验证则返回 ``None``）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit.synthesize_three_qubit:7
msgid "The unitary, local qubits ``(0, 1, 2)`` big-endian."
msgstr "该酉矩阵，局部量子比特 ``(0, 1, 2)`` 按大端序排列。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_three_qubit.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._three_qubit.synthesize_three_qubit:9
msgid ""
"``(name, local qubits, params)`` tuples with names ``cx``, ``ry``, ``rz``, "
"``cz``, ``h``, ``x``, or ``None``."
msgstr ""
"``(name, local qubits, params)`` 元组列表，门名为 ``cx``、``ry``、``rz``、"
"``cz``、``h``、``x``；或 ``None``。"

#: ../mergewt/docs/source/api.rst:243
msgid "Transpiler: Toffoli Routing and Synthesis"
msgstr "转译器：Toffoli 路由与综合"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli:1
msgid ""
"Connectivity-aware Toffoli (CCX) synthesis and three-qubit SABRE routing."
msgstr "感知连通性的 Toffoli（CCX）综合与三比特 SABRE 路由。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli:3
msgid ""
"Decomposing a Toffoli into the textbook six-CX circuit *before* routing "
"hands the router a triangle of interactions; on triangle-free coupling "
"graphs (line, ring, grid, heavy-hex) every such triangle forces SWAPs. This "
"module lets :class:`~quspect.transpiler.SABRE` route a ``ccx`` as one three-"
"qubit unit instead:"
msgstr ""
"在路由 *之前* 把 Toffoli 分解成教科书式的六 CX 线路，会交给路由器一个三角形的"
"相互作用；在无三角形的耦合图（线形、环形、网格、heavy-hex）上，每个这样的三角"
"形都会迫使插入 SWAP。本模块让 :class:`~quspect.transpiler.SABRE` 改为把 "
"``ccx`` 当作一个三比特单元来路由："

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli:9
msgid ""
"a ``ccx`` node is executable once its three physical qubits form a connected "
"subgraph (a path ``a - m - c`` or a triangle), and its routing cost is "
"``min_m (D[m][a] + D[m][c]) - 1`` (``1`` when executable, like the distance "
"of an executable two-qubit gate);"
msgstr ""
"当 ``ccx`` 节点的三个物理比特构成连通子图（路径 ``a - m - c`` 或三角形）时即"
"可执行，其路由代价为 ``min_m (D[m][a] + D[m][c]) - 1``\\ （可执行时为 ``1``，"
"与可执行两比特门的距离一致）；"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli:13
msgid ""
"after routing, each Toffoli is synthesized for the realised placement: the "
"six-CX circuit (:func:`ccx_triangle_decomposition`) on a triangle, or the "
"eight-CX nearest-neighbour circuit (:func:`ccx_path_decomposition`) whose "
"CXs act only on the two edges of the path.  Among the exact variants of each "
"(controls exchanged, circuit reversed; see :func:`ccx_candidates`) the one "
"that merges best with the neighbouring gates "
"under :class:`~quspect.transpiler.ConsolidateBlocksPass` is kept, which "
"typically saves one CX per Toffoli in adder-like circuits."
msgstr ""
"路由之后，每个 Toffoli 按实际落位进行综合：三角形上使用六 CX 线路"
"（:func:`ccx_triangle_decomposition`），路径上使用八 CX 的最近邻线路"
"（:func:`ccx_path_decomposition`），其 CX 只作用在路径的两条边上。在各自的精"
"确变体（交换控制位、线路反转；见 :func:`ccx_candidates`）中，保留"
"经 :class:`~quspect.transpiler.ConsolidateBlocksPass` 后与相邻门合并得最好的"
"那个，在加法器类线路中通常每个 Toffoli 可省一个 CX。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli:22
msgid ""
"Both syntheses are exact (no relative phase).  The eight-CX circuit is the "
"phase polynomial of ``CCZ = (-1)^{abc}`` evaluated on the seven parities "
"``a, b, c, a⊕b, b⊕c, a⊕c, a⊕b⊕c`` using CXs on the edges ``(a, m)`` and "
"``(m, c)`` only; the target is moved into the ``Z`` frame by two Hadamards, "
"so any of the three qubits may sit in the middle."
msgstr ""
"两种综合都是精确的（没有相对相位）。八 CX 线路是 ``CCZ = (-1)^{abc}`` 的相位"
"多项式，只用边 ``(a, m)`` 和 ``(m, c)`` 上的 CX 在七个奇偶项 ``a, b, c, a⊕b, "
"b⊕c, a⊕c, a⊕b⊕c`` 上求值；目标位通过两个 Hadamard 变换到 ``Z`` 基，因此三个比"
"特中任意一个都可以位于中间。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli:28
msgid ""
"Routing itself is done by the shared SABRE core "
"(:func:`quspect.transpiler._routing.route_dag`), which handles two- and "
"three-qubit nodes in one loop; three-qubit nodes enter the front and "
"extended-set terms with the cost above "
"(:func:`quspect.transpiler._routing.cost3`)."
msgstr ""
"路由本身由共享的 SABRE 核心完成"
"（:func:`quspect.transpiler._routing.route_dag`），它在同一个循环中处理两比特"
"与三比特节点；三比特节点以上述代价计入前沿项与扩展集项"
"（:func:`quspect.transpiler._routing.cost3`）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_candidates:1
msgid "All built-in exact Toffoli syntheses that fit the given coupling."
msgstr "适配给定耦合的所有内置精确 Toffoli 综合。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_candidates:3
msgid ""
"On a coupling triangle these are the four six-CX circuits obtained "
"from :func:`ccx_triangle_decomposition` by exchanging the controls and/or "
"reversing the circuit (``CCX`` is self-inverse, so the reversed circuit with "
"``t ↔ tdg`` is again ``CCX``).  On a path they are the four eight-CX "
"circuits of :func:`ccx_path_decomposition` around the middle qubit (target "
"preferred, then ``c1``), again with exchanged ends and/or reversed.  The "
"variants differ only in which CXs sit at the borders, which decides what "
"merges with neighbouring gates."
msgstr ""
"在耦合三角形上，它们是由 :func:`ccx_triangle_decomposition` 交换控制位和/或反"
"转线路得到的四个六 CX 线路（``CCX`` 是自逆的，因此 ``t ↔ tdg`` 互换后的反转线"
"路仍是 ``CCX``）。在路径上，它们是围绕中间比特（优先目标位，其次 ``c1``）的四"
"个 :func:`ccx_path_decomposition` 八 CX 线路，同样交换两端和/或反转。各变体只"
"在边界处的 CX 不同，这决定了它们能与相邻门合并什么。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_candidates:12
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_path_decomposition:9
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_triangle_decomposition:6
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.synthesize_ccx_for_coupling:12
msgid "First control."
msgstr "第一个控制位。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_candidates:13
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_path_decomposition:10
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_triangle_decomposition:7
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.synthesize_ccx_for_coupling:13
msgid "Second control."
msgstr "第二个控制位。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_candidates:14
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_path_decomposition:11
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_triangle_decomposition:8
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.synthesize_ccx_for_coupling:14
msgid "Target."
msgstr "目标位。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_candidates:15
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.synthesize_ccx_for_coupling:15
msgid "Predicate telling whether two qubits are coupled."
msgstr "判断两个比特是否耦合的谓词。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_candidates:17
msgid ""
"Candidate ``(gate, qubits)`` sequences; the first one is the canonical "
"choice."
msgstr "候选 ``(gate, qubits)`` 序列；第一个是规范选择。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_candidates:20
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.synthesize_ccx_for_coupling:23
msgid "If the three qubits do not form a connected subgraph."
msgstr "三个比特不构成连通子图时。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_path_decomposition:1
msgid "Eight-CX nearest-neighbour Toffoli whose CXs touch only ``middle``."
msgstr "所有 CX 都经过 ``middle`` 的八 CX 最近邻 Toffoli。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_path_decomposition:3
msgid ""
"The CX gates act on ``(e1, middle)`` and ``(middle, e2)`` only, where ``e1, "
"e2`` are the two qubits other than ``middle``, so the circuit runs on a "
"coupling path ``e1 - middle - e2`` without SWAPs.  ``middle`` may be either "
"control or the target.  The circuit is exactly ``CCX`` (no relative or "
"global phase)."
msgstr ""
"CX 门只作用在 ``(e1, middle)`` 和 ``(middle, e2)`` 上，其中 ``e1, e2`` 是 "
"``middle`` 之外的两个比特，因此线路无需 SWAP 即可在耦合路径 ``e1 - middle - "
"e2`` 上运行。``middle`` 可以是任一控制位或目标位。该线路恰好等于 ``CCX``\\ "
"（没有相对相位或全局相位）。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_path_decomposition:12
msgid ""
"One of ``c1``, ``c2``, ``t``: the qubit in the middle of the coupling path."
msgstr "``c1``、``c2``、``t`` 之一：位于耦合路径中间的比特。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_path_decomposition:15
msgid "``(gate, qubits)`` pairs over ``{h, t, tdg, cx}`` with 8 CXs."
msgstr "``{h, t, tdg, cx}`` 上的 ``(gate, qubits)`` 对，含 8 个 CX。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_path_decomposition:17
msgid "If the qubits are not distinct or ``middle`` is not one     of them."
msgstr "比特不互异或 ``middle`` 不是其中之一时。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_triangle_decomposition:1
msgid "Six-CX Toffoli for three pairwise-coupled qubits."
msgstr "用于三个两两耦合比特的六 CX Toffoli。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_triangle_decomposition:3
msgid ""
"This is the textbook circuit (Nielsen & Chuang, Fig. 4.9) used by the built-"
"in ``ccx`` decomposition rule; it needs a CX on every pair."
msgstr ""
"这是内置 ``ccx`` 分解规则所用的教科书线路（Nielsen & Chuang，图 4.9）；它在每"
"一对比特上都需要 CX。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.ccx_triangle_decomposition:10
msgid "``(gate, qubits)`` pairs over ``{h, t, tdg, cx}``."
msgstr "``{h, t, tdg, cx}`` 上的 ``(gate, qubits)`` 对。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.synthesize_ccx_for_coupling:1
msgid "Synthesize a Toffoli for the coupling of its three (physical) qubits."
msgstr "按三个（物理）比特的耦合综合 Toffoli。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.synthesize_ccx_for_coupling:3
msgid ""
"Uses the six-CX circuit when all three pairs are coupled and the eight-CX "
"nearest-neighbour circuit on a path (see :func:`ccx_candidates`).  When "
"neighbouring gates are given, the candidate whose two-qubit cost "
"after :class:`~quspect.transpiler.ConsolidateBlocksPass` resynthesis of "
"``before + candidate + after`` is lowest is returned (ties: fewer gates, "
"then the canonical order), so border CXs merge with adjacent gates on the "
"same pair."
msgstr ""
"三对比特都耦合时使用六 CX 线路，路径上使用八 CX 最近邻线路"
"（见 :func:`ccx_candidates`）。给出相邻门时，返回对 ``before + candidate + "
"after`` 做 :class:`~quspect.transpiler.ConsolidateBlocksPass` 重综合后两比特"
"代价最低的候选（相同时取门数更少者，再按规范顺序），从而让边界 CX 与同一对比"
"特上的相邻门合并。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.synthesize_ccx_for_coupling:16
msgid ""
"Gates on (a subset of) the three qubits right before the Toffoli; only used "
"to pick the cheapest candidate."
msgstr ""
"紧邻 Toffoli 之前、作用在这三个比特（的子集）上的门；仅用于挑选代价最低的候"
"选。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.synthesize_ccx_for_coupling:18
msgid "Gates on (a subset of) the three qubits right after it."
msgstr "紧随其后、作用在这三个比特（的子集）上的门。"

#: ../mergewt/quspect/transpiler/_toffoli.py:docstring of
#: quspect.transpiler._toffoli.synthesize_ccx_for_coupling:20
msgid ""
"``(gate, qubits)`` pairs over ``{h, t, tdg, cx}`` whose CXs all act on "
"coupled pairs."
msgstr ""
"``{h, t, tdg, cx}`` 上的 ``(gate, qubits)`` 对，其所有 CX 都作用在耦合的比特"
"对上。"
